window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4301,"title":"Chapter 4301 Blood Core Initiation Ceremony (1)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli nodded and strode forward.","Behind her, Li Moying's tall figure still followed silently.","Many girls from the Cloudy Qilin Clan secretly raised their heads and looked at Young Master Li.","Although the Cloudy Qilin Clan was their enemy, the Elders of the tribe strictly prohibited them from interacting with the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","However, this cannot stop their girlish hearts.","Beautiful men like Young Master Li are really rare.","Moreover, he is so strong and affectionate that he is willing to accompany his fiancée to a rival family.","No matter what kind of criticism he suffered, he would always be by Huang Yueli's side as a protector...","Such a man can only be found in the storybook!","Which girl has not secretly envied their new Matriarch?","When the Elders saw Li Moying, their expressions didn't look so good.","However, they already have a very important plan and are waiting to complete the final blow today.","At this time, they will definitely not jump out and conflict with Li Moying.","Therefore, even when they saw Li Moying and Huang Yueli interlocking their fingers and walking side by side, Huang Xindi and others tried their best to hold back.","Not long after, they arrived at Burning Sky Pond.","The array where Huang Yueli received the Blood Core Initiation was arranged on the edge of Burning Sky Pond. It was originally the closest to Burning Sky Pond among all the nearby training points. At the same time, it was also the location with the strongest fire attribute energy.","In this position, Dao Profound Realm cultivators can still withstand the pressure and hone themselves through practice.","But if you get closer to Burning Sky Lake, it will be dangerous.","Because the Blood Core Initiation itself is very dangerous, for the sake of safety and insurance, this place was finally selected to set up a large array.","The seven Elders responsible for protecting Huang Yueli have already taken their places.","Huang Xindi bowed slightly and saluted Huang Yueli.","\"Matriarch, the array has been set up. I have to be responsible for presiding over the array outside, so I can't protect you. However, these seven Elders are all in the late Dao Profound Realm and are well-known masters in the family. , the strength is very strong, you can rest assured.\"","Huang Yueli nodded slightly and said with a smile, \"I'm sure I can rest assured that Elder Xin Di is doing things.\"","She nodded towards Huang Xindi and walked towards the center of the array.","However, after taking a few steps, she stopped again.","Huang Xindi thought she saw something was wrong, and her heart suddenly rose in her throat.","Immediately asked: \"Matriarch, why don't you go in?\"","Huang Yueli did not answer him, but turned her attention to Li Moying.","The extremely handsome and peerless genius was standing under a big tree not far away. His features were clear-cut, his figure was tall and straight, and he was as handsome as a painting.","\"Moying...\"","She bit her lip.","Although they had made plans in advance and made a lot of preparations, she was still a little worried.","In the past, things more dangerous than this were not encountered before.","However, except for those sudden crises, as long as she was prepared, she and Li Moying would take action together and face them together.","But now, she has to enter the big array and fuse the blood core.","Before the blood core initiation was successful, she had absolutely no way to leave the array.","This also means that next, Li Moying will be alone outside.","Although she knew that Li Moying's strength and methods were not inferior to hers, she still couldn't rest assured."]},{"number":4302,"title":"Chapter 4302 Blood Core Initiation Ceremony (2)","paragraphs":["Li Moying slowly raised his head and looked towards her.","The two people's eyes intertwined in the air, neither of them spoke.","But every girl who saw this scene blushed.","It's really... too ambiguous.","Li Moying curled her lips and said, \"Little Li'er, don't worry, I will definitely wait for you outside until you successfully fuse the blood core!\"","Hearing this, Huang Xindi and others couldn't help but sneer.","Still waiting for Huang Yueli to come out!","Boy, I'm afraid you'll never see their Matriarch again!","Seeing that the two of them were still talking, Huang Xindi quickly walked out and stopped in front of Huang Yueli.","\"Matriarch, it's getting late, so hurry up! The best time for blood core initiation is at 9 o'clock in the morning. If you miss it, the effect may be less effective.\"","Huang Yueli then looked away and slowly walked into the array.","...","The spirit-gathering array of blood core initiation comes from the ancient secret scriptures collected by the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","A complete array requires a lot of very rare materials, and it must be deployed simultaneously by several array masters above the god level.","However, at this stage, the Sacred Phoenix Clan is not as glorious as it was in ancient times. It is impossible to find several god-level array masters at once.","Therefore, the array Huang Yueli is using now can only be regarded as a simplified version.","The array disk passed down from ancient times is mapped through an environment rich in fire attributes, and combined with some other rare materials.","It can probably exert 70% to 80% of the power of ancient arrays.","Because of this, the failure rate of blood core initiation is much higher now than in ancient times.","Huang Yueli stopped at the center of the array and sat down.","Seven Elders at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm were sitting around the outside of the array, separated by a layer of vague mist.","Seeing Huang Yueli sitting cross-legged, Huang Jiping took the lead and said, \"Matriarch, if you are ready, activate the array! Our profound energy will be gathered into the center of the array to help you melt your blood core.\"","Huang Yueli nodded and took a deep breath.","Now that she has entered the array, she no longer thinks wildly, completely abandons distracting thoughts, and adjusts herself to an ethereal and selfless state.","No matter what happens outside the array, the most important thing for her now is to complete the blood core initiation!","This is Li Moying's hope, and she cannot let her husband down.","She adjusted her breath for a while, and then performed a technique.","A burst of fire attribute energy fell on the array eye, and the entire array trembled slightly.","Immediately, the seven Elders showed stern expressions on their faces, and their bodies tensed involuntarily.","They could clearly feel that the profound energy in their bodies was quickly extracted by the array!","And the speed of this extraction is much faster than what is recorded in classical books!","Huang Jiping couldn't help but was secretly shocked, \"How could this happen? Mysterious energy evaporated so fast! It was twice as fast as the fastest speed recorded in the classics! By the way, it was recorded in that classic that those who received the blood core empowerment cultivators, the higher the talent, the stronger the meridians, and the faster the absorption speed! Could it be that...our Matriarch is so strong?\"","And Huang Yueli, who was in the center of the array, also felt tremendous pressure the moment he activated the array eye.","The surrounding fire energy energy all poured into her meridians through the spirit gathering array.","Moreover, the speed is extremely fast."]},{"number":4303,"title":"Chapter 4303 Blood Core Initiation Ceremony (3)","paragraphs":["For a moment, even she could hardly bear the impact.","The meridians all over the body felt like they were about to burst, and there were bursts of swelling and pain.","My head was buzzing, and my eyes were filled with fiery red color. I couldn't tell where I was or what I was doing.","This kind of pain is enough to make most cultivators go crazy on the spot.","However, Huang Yueli was determined enough and managed to hold on.","A large amount of fire attribute energy completed the aggregation process in her body, and then rushed to the top of her head and came out through her body.","These energies formed a lotus-like shape above her head.","The lotus is surrounded by flames that have become transparent and discernible.","These flames are almost invisible to the naked eye, but they are astonishingly hot, comparable to the heat in the center of Burning Sky Lake.","If anyone approaches Huang Yueli at this time, they will be burned to ashes on the spot!","At the same time, a red crystal core the size of an egg slowly rose into the air.","This is the legendary Phoenix Blood Core!","This small blood core can be said to have been repeatedly tempered and condensed by the ancient divine beasts throughout their lives. It not only contains a large amount of energy, but more importantly, it also contains many original laws of heaven and earth that only divine beasts can master!","These laws are difficult for even the most intelligent humans and gods to understand.","However, by fusing the blood core of the ancient beast, the difficulty of comprehension can be reduced countless times.","This is something more valuable than energy and cultivation itself.","cultivators who can successfully achieve blood core initiation can save a lot of time and energy in practice, paving the way for future advancement.","The Phoenix Blood Core moved directly above Huang Yueli's head, paused for a while, and then slowly fell down.","The bottom of the blood core touched the lotus flower, which was made of pure energy. It seemed that it could not withstand such high temperature, and the crystals below began to show signs of melting.","The whole falling process is very slow.","Because the crystal nucleus melts very slowly.","Even at a temperature as high as that of a fire lotus flower, only a faint layer of water marks can appear on the surface of the crystal every time.","After about an hour, one-fifth of the crystal core was melted.","At this moment, Huang Yueli felt very uncomfortable.","Blood Core Initiation, as the name suggests, is actually the whole process of piercing the Phoenix Blood Core from the position of the Heavenly Spirit Cap above her head.","Because, only in this way can she inherit the laws of heaven and earth contained in the blood core to the greatest extent.","The Phoenix Blood Core looks like a fragile crystal, but in fact, its hardness is extremely high. No matter how hard the magic weapon is, it is impossible to break it.","The only way is to use fire-attribute energy to generate high temperature, gradually melt it, and then absorb it.","Moreover, with Huang Yueli's current cultivation level in the Heart Profound Realm, no matter how talented he is, it is impossible for him to have such strong energy to generate high temperature enough to melt the Phoenix's blood core.","But after passing the Heart Profound Realm, the fused blood core is of little use.","Therefore, this is the reason why the spirit gathering array exists.","Only with external help can young geniuses in the Heart Profound Realm complete this initiation process.","The Phoenix blood core slowly fell, and the pressure in Huang Yueli's head became more and more intense.","This feeling of swelling and pain is completely different from injuries to the meridians and skin.","Because it radiates from the depths of my mind, it will appear clearer and the pain will be extremely acute!"]},{"number":4304,"title":"Chapter 4304 Blood Core Initiation Ceremony (4)","paragraphs":["Moreover, the consciousness in the brain will become blurred and various hallucinations will continue to occur.","This is a great test of the cultivator's willpower.","If you have weak willpower, you will soon be confused by the illusion, and you will not be able to continue to absorb the blood core. In the end, you will only end up going crazy!","Huang Yueli kept in mind the tips she read in the ancient secret book, forced herself to endure the strange pain, and began to use the profound energy in her body to try to absorb the blood core.","She didn't know how long it took before she felt that she had mastered some tricks and gradually achieved results.","She secretly breathed a sigh of relief and relaxed a little.","But when she used her spiritual consciousness to observe the surroundings and found that the Phoenix Blood Core had only shrunk by about one-fifth, her face turned a bit paler.","If this continues, won't it take her several hours to get out? !","Then how can she help her husband?","...","Not only Huang Yueli, but also Huang Jiping and other Elders were gritting their teeth and persisting.","Since the array can extract profound energy much faster than they imagined, this means that the speed at which they can recover their profound energy cannot keep up with the speed at which it is extracted.","According to the current trend, I'm afraid they can only last ten hours at most!","Compared with the ten days previously estimated, this is more than ten times worse!","In such a short period of time, no one can fuse the blood core of the ancient beast!","Thinking of this, the Elders trembled in their hearts.","I don't know why, such an accident would occur in a good spirit gathering array. Is there something wrong with the array, or is their strength too far apart?","Of course, it's too late to think about this now.","The worst thing now is that once Huang Yueli's blood core initiation fails, he will definitely be seriously injured, and maybe even go crazy!","Even the Elders who are responsible for driving the array will suffer violent backlash if they fail midway. It is not impossible to be seriously injured. Even death on the spot is not impossible!","However, it is impossible for them to stop.","The only thing they can do now is to persist and persist!","Huang Jiping, as one of the Elders with the highest cultivation level, has reached the peak of Dao Profound Realm.","Compared to other Elders, he can barely keep up with the speed of extracting profound energy.","He reluctantly suppressed the discomfort in his body, opened his closed eyes, and looked towards the center of the array, trying to see what was wrong with Huang Yueli.","But who would have thought that as soon as his eyes fell on Huang Yueli, he was shocked as if he was struck by lightning!","I almost forgot that I was in a array.","One-fifth of the phoenix blood core above Huang Yueli's head had been swallowed up!","This is simply shocking and completely unbelievable!","According to the ancient secret book, the fastest time to fuse the blood core is at least two days!","But their new Matriarch actually... merged one-fifth of it in just over an hour? !","Could it be that he was too weak and had hallucinations?","...","Outside the spirit gathering array.","After Huang Yueli entered the array, some of the clansmen surrounding him dispersed.","However, there are also many people who have not left.","For example, Huang Xindi and others stayed outside the array.","Of course Huang Likai would not leave either.","On the surface, he was following Huang Xindi's arrangements and standing not far away, waiting. But in fact, he was extremely nervous and looked at Li Moying under the big tree from time to time.","Li Moying remained expressionless."]},{"number":4305,"title":"Chapter 4305 Fusion Of Thunder And Fire (1)","paragraphs":["Li Moying looked quietly in the direction of the array and stood motionless.","From his cold handsome face, you really couldn't tell what he was thinking in his heart.","Huang Likai felt uneasy and wanted to find Li Moying and ask for details.","However, now under the watchful eyes of Huang Xindi and others, he could do nothing but worry.","Huang Xindi and others were not in a hurry to take action because there were still too many clansmen outside the array.","Moreover, they were also worried that something unexpected might happen during the process of Huang Yueli's blood core initiation.","Generally speaking, if the blood core initiation fails, it will show its symptoms in the first three or four hours. The cultivator who receives the initiation will immediately go crazy.","If nothing abnormal happens within five hours, then it is almost certain that the blood core initiation will be successful.","Then, after waiting for another seven days to half a month, you can welcome Huang Yueli who has successfully received the initiation and has greatly improved in strength!","For the sake of caution, Huang Xindi and others have been waiting silently.","During this process, they all turned a blind eye to Li Moying and seemed not to notice his existence at all.","For a cultivator, five hours is not a long time.","The sky was getting dark, but the location where they were was still very bright, at least it wouldn't affect their sight.","Because the strong magma in Burning Sky Pond is not only very hot, but also reflects a dark light.","More and more Saint Phoenix Clan cultivators were leaving.","A large part of them took the opportunity to observe Huang Yueli's blood core initiation ceremony and went to practice near Burning Sky Pond.","After all, if you want to apply for such a good practice point, you usually need a lot of contribution points!","Now that it can be used for free, no one is willing to leave.","However, their cultivation talents are limited, and most cultivators can only persist for three to five hours at most. By this point, they are 90% gone.","There is only one adult left, still holding on.","Huang Xindi secretly exchanged glances with the Elders on his side.","Immediately, several Elders came out and began to persuade the surrounding clansmen to retreat.","\"Everyone, it's already night now. It's not safe near Burning Sky Lake. You'd better go back!\"","\"Yes, you must have benefited a lot from being able to practice here for five hours. Don't hold on, and come back next time when you have the opportunity!\"","\"Everyone, if you don't leave, we will evict you!\"","With this combination of hard and soft tactics, the clansmen quickly dispersed.","The only ones left were the Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, Li Moying, Liu Buyan, and a few guards from the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Of course, Liu Buyan had been hiding far away for a long time.","It's not that he didn't want to contribute to his junior sister, it was just that... Li Moying disliked his poor strength and was afraid that he would get in the way, so he directly drove him aside.","When Huang Xindi saw that everyone was gone, she stood up and walked to Li Moying's side, coughing twice.","\"Young Master Li, it's rare that our Matriarch is not here. Can I have a good talk with you?\"","It was only then that Li Moying noticed him. He raised his eyes and glanced at him with a salty glance, \"What do you want to talk about? I don't know what common topics we can talk about.\"","\"Haha, Young Master Li, if people don't tell you secret words, I will tell you the truth! You are not suitable for our Matriarch, so please leave Ice Moon Summit and return to the Cloudy Qilin Clan!\""]},{"number":4306,"title":"Chapter 4306 Fusion Of Thunder And Fire (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Xindi's first step was to persuade.","Although I knew that saying this would not have much effect, I still wanted to try my luck.","After all, it would be best if Li Moying was willing to leave voluntarily. If they really killed people, they would not be completely without worries.","If Huang Yueli reacts violently, things will be in trouble.","Li Moying sneered, \"What? You don't dare to say these words in front of Little Li'er. Now that she is in the array, you dare to come to see me? But where do you get the confidence? Do you think I will obey your orders? I can't even obey the orders of the leader of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so who do you think you are?\"","Upon hearing this, Huang Xindi's expression immediately changed.","I originally planned to persuade him a few more words, but at this time, I was suddenly irritated and lost my patience.","\"You...what do you mean? Li Moying, let me tell you, don't think that just because you are a god-level genius, you are invincible! You are still young, and the hair on your mouth has not even grown. How do you know that there are people in the God Realm? How many masters dare to be so arrogant and domineering? Do you really think that our Sacred Phoenix Clan has no masters?\"","Not only him, but also the Elders behind him were all very angry.","\"Elder Xindi, don't talk nonsense to him. He won't shed tears until he sees the coffin!\"","\"How could our Matriarch marry such a person!\"","\"I think the Cloudy Qilin Clan sent him to be a spy. If we don't kill him, we will be in trouble sooner or later!\"","Everyone was filled with indignation, pointed at Li Moying's nose, and began to curse.","A chill flashed through Li Moying's eyes, \"There are indeed many masters in the God Realm, but... you bastards, you can't count them!\"","\"I won't leave Little Li'er. What are you going to do? Kill me?\"","As he said these words, a cold murderous aura suddenly burst out from his body!","Although Huang Xindi and the others considered themselves to be strong men in the Dao Profound Realm, under his astonishing momentum, they actually felt a little trembling and couldn't help but take a step back.","However, he quickly reacted and stopped.","\"Li Moying, do you think we don't dare to kill you? This is the Sacred Phoenix Clan ! Do you still dare to bargain with us on the territory of the Sacred Phoenix Clan ?\"","Huang Xindi steadied her steps and said sternly to Li Moying: \"I will give you one last chance. Take your people and get out of Ice Moon Summit immediately! Otherwise, don't blame me for being rude. Don't even think about it today.\" Stay alive!\"","Li Moying sneered, his tall and straight posture was like a sharp sword, motionless.","\"I also said that I will not leave Little Li'er.\"","\"Alright, you're seeking death on your own! You can't blame us!\"","Huang Xindi sneered, suddenly waved her hand, and shouted: \"Everyone, do it!\"","Following his movements, several Elders behind him took action together and attacked Li Moying!","Seven or eight Dao Profound Realm masters took action at the same time, forming an earth-shattering momentum, and the fire attribute energy came overwhelmingly.","Under such pressure, the guards behind Li Moying couldn't bear it and vomited blood and retreated.","But Li Moying still had no reaction, but his face looked more solemn.","Just when Huang Xindi and others were about to attack, several figures suddenly appeared from behind them!","Then attack them on the back!","Huang Xindi focused all her attention on Li Moying, and she did not expect that she would be attacked from behind."]},{"number":4307,"title":"Chapter 4307 Fusion Of Thunder And Fire (3)","paragraphs":["It all happened so fast!","Huang Xindi and others reacted fairly quickly. Although the ones with the highest cultivation levels were caught off guard, they still managed to dodge and avoid the most critical positions behind them.","\"Who dares to...\"","Before Huang Xindi could even finish her scolding, she suddenly felt a powerful energy coming from above her head.","His words stopped suddenly and he raised his head suddenly.","Then they saw a purple thunder light falling from the sky and heading towards their heads!","When Huang Xindi and others saw that it was Li Moying's Tianlei, their originally extremely frightened emotions calmed down a lot in an instant.","It's not that they look down on Young Master Li's ability, but that the position they are in now is Ice Moon Summit!","In order to guard against sneak attacks by the old enemy Cloudy Qilin Clan, the mountain protection array outside Ice Moon Summit has been transformed countless times over the years, and it was specially adapted to deal with thunder-attribute energy!","Thunder attribute energy cannot enter the range of the array at all. As long as it gets close, it will be bounced out!","As a result, Li Moying's strength will be reduced by at least half!","It is precisely because of this that Huang Xindi and others are so confident and eager to attack Li Moying.","To them, as long as Li Moying entered Ice Moon Summit, he would become a lamb to be slaughtered, unable to escape from their grasp.","Because of this, these Elders didn't even have the intention to dodge, and simply ignored the roaring lightning.","Huang Xindi turned to look behind her. When she discovered that the person who attacked was Huang Likai, her face suddenly became extremely ugly.","\"Huang Likai, you traitor...\"","Before he finished speaking, suddenly, a horrified cry came from behind: \"Be careful! Everyone, be careful!\"","However, it was too late to issue a warning at this time.","Huang Xindi noticed something was wrong, and when she looked up, she saw that Li Moying's lightning was covered in a layer of blazing flames at some point.","The flames, wrapped in electric light, penetrated the mountain guarding array and fell towards their heads.","A few people only thought of defending themselves at this time, but it was too late, it was too late!","The fire and lightning flashed and fell right on top of their heads.","Huang Xindi and others were all sent flying out, their heads buzzing, and they fell to the ground, almost unable to move.","This time, they were all chopped into pieces.","Furthermore, because the lightning struck Tianling Gai right in the middle, several Elders were stunned. Their eyes turned up, exposing the whites of their eyes, and they looked delirious.","After all, Huang Xindi was the one with the best cultivation among them. At least he was very conscious at this time.","Seeing Li Moying slowly walking towards them, he had a horrified look on his face.","\"No...impossible! You just...how could it be possible? Aren't you a cultivator with the thunder attribute?\"","Li Moying disagreed and raised her lips lightly, \"I am a cultivator with the thunder attribute. Can't I have the talent of the fire attribute? There are so many cultivators with multiple attributes in the God Realm. Is this strange?\"","\"But...but...you...this is impossible! It's impossible!\"","Huang Xindi was so shocked that she couldn't even speak complete words!","Li Moying also practices fire-attribute skills. This is not a strange thing.","The problem is, his fire attribute talent is a bit too strong!","In order for the flames and his electric light to be completely integrated, the gap in the cultivation of the two attributes cannot be too large."]},{"number":4308,"title":"Chapter 4308 Fusion Of Thunder And Fire (4)","paragraphs":["Otherwise, it is absolutely impossible to integrate so seamlessly and even deceive the mountain guarding array!","In this case, the problem arises.","Li Moying is a god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and his thunder attribute is a god-level talent!","If the fire attribute is the same as the thunder attribute, what kind of talent would it be? !","Impossible, this is absolutely impossible!","Huang Xindi was so frightened that she almost fainted.","What the hell is this!","Li Moying sneered and had no intention of explaining in detail.","In fact, although his fire attribute talent is good in itself, it is impossible for him to be so powerful in the first place. After all, he has not spent much time practicing.","The main reason why it is like this is because of dual cultivation with Huang Yueli!","Since the God Realm's Grand Meet, the two of them practiced dual cultivation again and made a brand new discovery.","After they completed the Secret Code of Dual Cultivation of the Evil Shadow Saint, they could actually obtain the other party's cultivation and abilities. Moreover, the more times they practiced dual cultivation, the more powerful the abilities they acquired.","They only learned this after conducting many tests in the past few days.","Li Moying is definitely very satisfied with this.","Now, his little Li'er can no longer refuse to practice dual cultivation with him!","Today is the first time he has tried to combine fire and thunder attributes. It is somewhat unexpected that he can cause such great destructive power.","Thunder and fire attributes are inherently extremely powerful attributes. After successful fusion, the power increased several times!","However, Huang Xindi and others were knocked down by him in one go, mainly because they underestimated the enemy.","When the energy from both thunder and fire elements fell down, they were still sleepwalking there, completely defenseless.","This is no different from seeking death.","Li Moying sneered coldly, \"Elder Xindi, you are an old man of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. My little Li'er has always trusted you and thought you were a reliable old man. Who knew... you would actually do this behind her back?\" Such a thing! She will be very disappointed!\"","Huang Xindi worked hard to adjust the breath in her body, barely suppressing the waves of discomfort.","Hearing Li Moying's voice, he felt indignant, \"Li Moying, stop pretending here! Don't think that we don't know that you are pretending to love our Matriarch and sneaking into the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and you are simply plotting against the Matriarch! You don't care about the Matriarch. No matter what, I will never let you stay in the tribe and endanger the tribe!\"","Speaking of this, Huang Xindi suddenly remembered the sneak attack from behind.","He quickly turned around and saw Huang Likai.","At this time, Huang Likai was also frightened by Li Moying's strength!","He had seen Li Moying and Huang Yueli capture Huang Sanbai during their God Realm's Grand Meet, and he thought he had some understanding of their strength.","But today, Li Moying's action still shocked him deeply!","Unexpectedly, what he saw that day was not even half of Li Moying's true strength!","The combat power of a god-level genius is actually so terrifying!","At this time, he was deeply glad that he chose to side with the new Matriarch.","This pair of young peerless geniuses is really terrifying!","It is estimated that within a few years, he will be able to grow into one of the top masters in the God Realm, which is simply not something that ordinary masters like them can compete with.","Huang Likai was very aware of current affairs and immediately stood next to Li Moying, looking like he was obeying orders.","When Huang Xindi saw this scene, she was so angry that she spat out a mouthful of blood!","\"Huang Likai, you despicable villain!\""]},{"number":4309,"title":"Chapter 4309 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (1)","paragraphs":["With Huang Xindi in such a state, Huang Likai would certainly not be afraid of him and immediately retorted.","\"Elder Xindi, why do you have the nerve to call me a despicable person? You are clearly the despicable person, right? You say one thing and do another in front of the Matriarch, and you obey her orders on the surface, but secretly you want to murder the Matriarch. Fiancé! If we take a closer look, this is also an act of betrayal of the family!\"","Huang Xindi was furious, \"What betrayal of the family? I did all this for the prosperity of the family! I can't just watch the Matriarch be deceived by this man! Regardless of the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan ! The Matriarch is still young, Since she did something wrong, we old people should correct her!\"","Hearing this, Li Moying couldn't help but sneer.","\"Huang Xindi, I've seen old guys like you a lot, and you are all so self-righteous! Why do you need to teach Little Li'er how to do things? The Sacred Phoenix Clan was originally one of the top three powers in the God Realm, but now it has fallen to this. Because there are old guys like you who point fingers at the Matriarch all day long!\"","\"You...Li Moying, you actually spoke to me like this!\"","Huang Xindi was so angry that she spat out another mouthful of blood on the spot.","\"Who do you think you are? You're just a bastard of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! I've wanted to kill you for a long time! The Matriarch is still so protective of you! If she remains so stubborn, what qualifications does she have to be the leader of the Sacred Phoenix Clan ?\"","Upon hearing this, Huang Likai jumped out immediately.","\"Alright, Huang Xindi, you have finally revealed your true thoughts! You are clearly dissatisfied with the Matriarch, and you think she can be at your mercy because she is young! How dare you say you are not betraying the family!\"","\"Bah! You, Huang Likai, are the traitor! You are all mixed up with the Cloudy Qilin Clan. What are you not a traitor?\"","The two held their own opinions and accused each other of being the traitor to the family.","Not only the two of them, but the Elders behind them also started arguing.","Li Moying looked at this scene and felt extremely bored. He frowned and interrupted them.","\"Alright, stop being so long-winded. Elder Likai, hurry up and send someone to tie up these people and take them to the dungeon for custody. Wait until your Matriarch comes out of seclusion before dealing with them.\"","Huang Likai responded quickly and led the people up to tie up Huang Xindi and others.","Li Moying stood not far away, his eyes had turned to the array again, and he was watching motionlessly.","At this moment, a sharp look suddenly flashed in Huang Xindi's eyes.","\"The traitor has been exposed, why don't you act quickly!\"","When the Elders behind him heard his order, they all jumped up from the ground and attacked Li Moying as if they had suddenly taken a pill that stimulated their potential!","Huang Likai and others did not expect such a change at all, and they were all stunned for a moment.","Some of those who were slightly inferior in cultivation were directly knocked out.","People with high cultivation levels, such as Huang Likai himself, blocked it instinctively, but they were unable to block Huang Xindi.","At this time, Huang Xindi was activating the secret technique and burning her own essence and blood to stimulate her potential and cover up the impact of the severe damage to her meridians.","He knew that if he didn't fight now, he would never have the chance to kill Li Moying!","Once he and the Elders who support him become prisoners, no one can stop Huang Yueli and Li Moying from getting married!","In his opinion, this is equivalent to destroying the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan !"]},{"number":4310,"title":"Chapter 4310 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Xindi and others suddenly went berserk and rushed towards Li Moying.","Li Moying was not as panicked as Huang Likai. He had always been cautious by nature and had already guessed that Huang Xindi and others, as Elders of the ancient gods, could not fall down so easily and become the targets of others' slaughter.","A hint of coldness flashed in his eyes.","The energy stimulated by Huang Xindi and others using secret techniques was indeed very powerful, even more powerful than he expected!","Under the current situation, he is already at a clear disadvantage!","Li Moying flipped his wrist and quickly drew out the long sword from his waist. His face was filled with a stern expression, and he was fully alert!","Several Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan joined forces, and their strength indeed exceeded him.","However, it may be possible to defeat him, but it is definitely not that easy to kill him!","As long as it can be delayed for a while, then...","The attacks from Huang Xindi and others were in front of Li Moying in an instant.","Li Moying blocked the first person's attack with his sword, and then started to dodge.","His figure is like a ghost, erratic.","Huang Xindi and others desperately chased after him. Every time they felt that they were about to catch up, they always fell short.","After many times, they even had the illusion that Li Moying was deliberately playing tricks on them!","Not only was Li Moying difficult to deal with, but after Huang Likai and others reacted, they also took action to help Li Moying.","Huang Xindi and others were attacked from both sides. Although they still had the upper hand for a while, there was a limit to how long they could burn their essence and blood. If it dragged on for a long time, the situation would definitely become more and more unfavorable for them!","Thinking of this, Huang Xindi's expression changed, \"Don't waste time, everyone, attack with all your strength! Kill Li Moying as soon as possible, at any cost!\"","After hearing this, the Elders of his faction all realized the seriousness of the matter and all entered a crazy attack mode.","Huang Likai and others were chasing after them. They hardly devoted their energy to defense, but used all their profound energy on attack!","These people have only one thought in their minds, and that is to kill Li Moying at all costs!","As a result, the pressure on Li Moying became more and more intense.","Even though he had outstanding attainments in body movements and mystical skills, he was forced to panic and gradually became unable to defend himself...","When Huang Xindi saw that his movements had slowed down, a trace of amusement flashed in her eyes.","\"Go to hell, Li Moying!\"","He used all the profound energy in his body and blasted towards Li Moying's chest!","His goal with this move was not to kill Li Moying with one move. He knew that Li Moying was wearing spiritual armour refined by Huang Yueli himself, and its defensive power was astonishingly high.","What he planned was to use this power to directly push Li Moying into the Burning Sky Pond not far behind him!","The magma in the Burning Sky Lake was extremely hot, several times higher than the temperature of the flames!","Once Li Moying falls into the pool, he will definitely be burned to death!","As soon as Li Moying saw Huang Xindi's face, he understood what he was thinking and used all his strength to defend himself.","However, several Dao Profound Realm powerhouses joined forces to fight to the death. This kind of power was indeed not something that a cultivator in the late Heart Profound Realm like him could withstand.","He clearly felt a powerful push coming towards his chest!","His body moved back uncontrollably.","Even though he had exhausted all his strength and used his profound energy to support the ground through his long sword, it could only slow him down and not stop him completely."]},{"number":4311,"title":"Chapter 4311 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (3)","paragraphs":["Li Moying could already feel waves of heat coming towards him from behind.","Although he had obtained a god-level fire attribute talent from Huang Yueli, such rich and blazing energy still made him secretly frightened.","Seeing that Li Moying was about to fall into the Burning Sky Pond just a few meters away, Huang Xindi couldn't help but sneer.","\"Haha, the so-called god-level genius is nothing more than that! Young people are too arrogant, and the final outcome will definitely be tragic!\"","Li Moying's eyes flashed.","He also didn't expect that the Sacred Phoenix Clan 's secret method for stimulating potential would be so powerful. It was obviously much more effective than the Cloudy Qilin Clan's secret method.","Now, he is actually forced to this point!","If he wants to escape, it seems he can only expose his strength as an evil cultivator...","Just when Li Moying was thinking secretly and couldn't make up his mind, there was another violent shaking on the ground!","Huang Xindi and others were caught off guard and were a little unsteady on their feet. The force blasting towards Li Moying was interrupted for a moment.","\"What...what's going on?\" an Elder asked uneasily.","Huang Xindi said angrily: \"Who cares what happened? Push Li Moying into Burning Sky Pond first!\"","\"But...but, this vibration seems...to come from the direction of the Spirit Gathering array...\"","\"What?!\"","Huang Xindi was shocked!","For a moment, he couldn't decide whether he should look back at the array or continue to attack Li Moying.","However, his will is firm, and other Elders are not as firm as him.","After hearing this, everyone turned their heads subconsciously and looked at the spirit gathering array.","The light curtain shrouding the outside of the array shook, and within a few breaths, it collapsed.","As the light curtain disappeared, a burst of flames suddenly burst out from the centre of the array and shot straight into the sky!","Compared to this fierce flame, even the temperature of Burning Sky Pond seems to pale in comparison.","As the flames spewed out, a slender figure leaped out.","Behind her, a pair of huge phoenix wings transformed from fire-attributed energy kept waving, bringing out scorching airflow, and at the same time, it also allowed her body to stay steadily in the air.","All the Elders were stunned!","Even Huang Xindi couldn't remember what happened to Li Moying at this time, and could only look at the girl who suddenly appeared in mid-air in shock!","No one thought that Huang Yueli would appear at this time!","It only took her more than five hours to enter the spirit gathering array, and to receive the blood core initiation, the shortest time recorded in the classics was seven days and seven nights.","Successful fusion in five hours is simply unheard of!","Unless... Huang Yueli failed to fuse the phoenix blood core, went crazy, and had to break out!","However, as soon as this idea flashed through the minds of the Elders, they were immediately denied by themselves!","The aura on Huang Yueli's body now is several times stronger than when she entered the spirit gathering array!","This kind of performance is a classic manifestation of extremely strong energy and blood in a short period of time after the retreat is successful!","cultivators who have just successfully advanced can often display strength that is several times stronger than usual.","Thinking of this, Huang Xindi's heart suddenly sank!","It's over, Huang Yueli came out so quickly, then their plan...","Before he could think of any countermeasures, Huang Yueli's eyes immediately fell on Li Moying.","After seeing where Li Moying was standing and the obvious traces of a fight on the ground, her expression suddenly changed!"]},{"number":4312,"title":"Chapter 4312 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (4)","paragraphs":["\"Elder Xindi, what did you do to my husband?!\"","Huang Yueli had discussed it with Li Moying before entering the spirit gathering array, so it was not surprising to her to see the two sides fighting.","Logically speaking, it should be expected.","However, when she saw a bloody mark on the back of Li Moying's hand, her mind buzzed!","The string of reason broke instantly!","Huang Xindi came back to her senses, extremely nervous, \"Clan... Matriarch, this... I can explain...explain...\"","Huang Yueli smiled coldly, \"What? Do you want to say that you attacked my husband to help him fail in his cultivation?\"","Huang Xindi was extremely panicked.","Huang Yueli came out of seclusion so early, which really surprised him!","He failed to kill Li Moying in time, so all the excuses he made up at the beginning were useless!","I wanted to deny it, but in such a short period of time, I really couldn't think of a reasonable explanation.","What's worse is that after Huang Yueli fused the blood core, his strength increased beyond his imagination!","She teamed up with Li Moying, and with the help of Huang Likai and others, it was really hard for a few people on his side to resist...","Huang Xindi was still thinking, but Huang Yueli was already impatient.","\"I don't have time to listen to your sophistry! All I know is that Elder Xindi promised to convince the tribe for me to agree to my marriage to Moying. However, secretly, he tried his best to plot against me while I was in seclusion. The Matriarch's fiancé, this is an act of betrayal of the family! What's the difference between you and Huang Sanbai?\"","When Huang Xindi heard this, she was immediately unconvinced, \"Matriarch, I am doing this for the family! You must never do it for a man...\"","Huang Yueli couldn't bear to hear others slandering Li Moying, so she immediately took action and blasted Huang Xindi with powerful fire energy!","Huang Xindi was defending her words, but she was secretly ready to resist.","As soon as he saw Huang Yueli taking action, he no longer cared about his status as a family Elder, and rose up to resist in order to save his life!","Unfortunately, his attack failed to even touch a piece of Huang Yueli's clothes and was blocked by Li Moying.","\"Little Li'er, are you out of seclusion? Have you advanced yet?\"","\"Well, that's right! Let's take down these traitors first, and we'll talk about it later!\"","The two of them joined forces, more than doubling their strength, and the situation suddenly reversed. Huang Xindi and others had no power to fight back and could only retreat step by step.","Huang Likai and others also acted according to the opportunity and rushed forward to attack fiercely.","Under the joint attack from both sides, Huang Xindi and others were completely unable to resist. Soon, they were knocked to the ground and could not get up no matter what.","This time, Li Moying did not dare to slack off anymore. She stood on the edge with her long sword in hand, watching Huang Likai and the others tie Huang Xindi and others into rice dumplings and take them away. She was relieved.","He turned to look at the girl beside him, and finally a faint smile appeared on his handsome face.","\"Little Li'er, I really want to congratulate you! You should have broken through to the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm!\"","In this way, the cultivation base of the two of them is almost the same.","Huang Yue's cultivation speed has improved by leaps and bounds, much faster than him. This is mainly because of their dual cultivation.","The Saint Iniquitous Shadow's double cultivation book will greatly improve the cultivation level of the weaker one. Until the cultivation level of the two is equal, the stronger one will make significant progress."]},{"number":4313,"title":"Chapter 4313 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (5)","paragraphs":["Of course, it seems that the stronger side is at a disadvantage, but in fact this is not the case.","Dual Cultivation is a process of two cultivators practicing together. The most important thing is the harmony of Yin and Yang and the balance of Xuan Qi.","Therefore, once Huang Yueli's cultivation level catches up with Li Moying's, Li Moying will also benefit a lot, and his cultivation speed will be more than twice as fast as before!","Therefore, Huang Yueli's breakthrough is also very beneficial to him.","Huang Yueli nodded, but her little face was still tense and there was no smile at all.","Li Moying looked at her angry little face and shook his head in a funny way, \"Little Li'er, what's wrong with you? It's a great joy that you can advance smoothly. There's no need to do it for a few unscrupulous fish. Affects good mood.\"","\"Who said I was angry because of Huang Xindi and the others?\" Huang Yueli said displeased.","Li Moying was stunned for a moment, \"It's not for them, could it be...\"","\"That's right, just for you!\"","Huang Yueli glared at him and said angrily: \"Did you know that you almost scared me to death just now? You are only a few meters away from Burning Sky Pond! If you are not careful, if you are attacked by them, you will fall in! If you really die, what do you want me to do?\"","\"I...ahem, Little Li'er, I think you are really worrying too much. Although I am a little closer to Ran Tianchi, I still know in my heart that there is absolutely no way I will fall like this...\"","\"Shut up! There are many, and you have the nerve to say that there are many! Do you know how scared I was when I saw you standing there when I came out? You almost scared me to death! I tell you, if you die No, I won't remember you, I will remarry right away! Just...marry my senior brother!\"","Huang Yueli put her hands on her hips, scolded her husband, and finally pointed at Liu Buyan.","Li Moying immediately looked in the direction of her finger, and a certain cold light flickered.","Liu Buyan shivered immediately, with a constipated expression on his face.","\"You two...enough is enough! If you quarrel, just quarrel, if you show affection, just show affection, don't involve me! Is it easy for me? I am abused by you every day, but... now you are still cheating on me like this?\"","Huang Yueli didn't pay attention to what he said at all, and stared at Li Moying angrily with her big eyes.","Li Moying looked away, took a few steps forward, and pulled Huang Yueli into his arms.","\"Alright, what are you worried about? You know that I can still use evil qi. Although I may not be able to Huang Xindi and the others, if you really want to escape, there are still many ways! I just want to delay it for a while. When you get out of seclusion, we can work together to take them down.\"","Li Moying whispered in her ear: \"Didn't we discuss it from the beginning? Is it necessary to be so surprised?\"","However, when they first discussed it, she didn't see such a thrilling scene of her husband about to fall into Burning Sky Pond!","Huang Yueli's face was still full of displeasure, \"Anyway, I can't do such risky things again! I didn't think well this time. Next time...\"","Her words suddenly stopped.","Li Moying watched her beautiful red lips opening and closing, couldn't bear it, lowered his head to block her voice.","The hot and fierce kiss instantly swallowed up Huang Yueli's breath.","She put her hand on Li Moying's chest and pushed it a few times symbolically. Soon, she was immersed in the powerful male aura..."]},{"number":4314,"title":"Chapter 4314 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (6)","paragraphs":["Since the two of them officially started studying the Secret Book of Dual Cultivation of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, Huang Yueli found that as her cultivation level continued to improve, she became increasingly unable to resist Li Moying's approach.","In the past, she had some resistance to Young Master Li's beauty trap.","But now, as long as Li Moying teases her a little bit, her legs will become weak.","The kiss between the two soon became more intense.","\"That's enough, you two! It's really enough! Can you still consider the feelings of the onlookers?!\"","Liu Buyan shouted loudly, expressing the bachelor's anger.","When Huang Yueli heard his voice, she came to her senses and pushed Li Moying.","However, Li Moying's body remained motionless, showing no intention of letting her go.","Huang Yueli could only use a few points of her profound strength and pushed hard on his chest.","Li Moying groaned, loosened his hand, and let go of the little girl in his arms.","Huang Yueli turned around and found that not only Liu Buyan was nearby, but Huang Likai and others had completed their mission of escorting Huang Xindi and returned.","However, Liu Buyan stood beside them, not only not shying away, but also staring at them with a look of contempt on his face.","But Huang Likai and others were not so bold. They all turned their backs and looked around, pretending to be watching the scenery.","The corner of Huang Yueli's mouth twitched, she couldn't help but glared at her husband again, turned her head, and walked away.","Li Moying looked at her arrogant look, the corners of his mouth turned up slightly, and he quickly followed her.","Returning to the main hall, Huang Yueli sat down on the Matriarch's throne in the middle.","Huang Likai and the Elders of his faction immediately stepped forward and knelt down to Huang Yueli without hesitation.","\"Meet the Matriarch!\"","Originally, before today's action, they were still a little uneasy and couldn't decide whether they were right or wrong in choosing to side with Huang Yueli.","However, after seeing the peerless talents of the two god-level geniuses in front of the Burning Sky Pond today, they felt happy in their hearts!","Fortunately, they made the right choice!","Li Moying showed today that he was even more powerful than when he was fighting in the God Realm. With his current fighting power, he seemed to have no problem killing the strong men in the late Dao Profound Realm.","Even though he was forced to the edge of Burning Sky Pond just now, and it seemed that he might die at any time, Huang Likai always had a feeling that Li Moying could not be killed like this.","Even if Huang Yueli doesn't come out on time, nothing will happen to him!","Facing such a peerless genius, if you fail to kill him at once and let him escape, then making this enemy will be like having a nightmare! Still a nightmare that will never wake up.","No one wants to have an enemy who grows extremely fast.","This means that your head is only temporarily stored on your neck, and you may be killed by the opponent at any time!","Huang Yueli looked at the Elders kneeling at her feet and nodded noncommittally, \"Please get up, everyone. Thank you for your hard work today.\"","All the Elders stood up in fear.","Huang Yueli pondered for a moment and then said: \"Since I have completed the blood core initiation, let's talk about the inauguration ceremony...\"","Hearing this, the Elders present became nervous again.","Immediately, they all turned their attention to Huang Likai.","After Huang Xindi was captured, he is now the de facto first Elder."]},{"number":4315,"title":"Chapter 4315 Are You Going To Elope? (1)","paragraphs":["There were some words that only he could say.","Huang Likai knew that he couldn't shirk it, so he could only bite the bullet and speak, \"This... Matriarch, this... ahem, regarding your marriage to Young Master Li, my subordinates suggest that it should not be confused with the installation ceremony... \"","Seeing Huang Yueli's expression change slightly, Huang Likai immediately became nervous and quickly defended himself loudly.","\"Matriarch, please don't misunderstand me! My subordinates have absolutely no objection to you being with Young Master Li. However, it is really inappropriate for you to be in such a hurry to marry Young Master Li. Although Huang Xindi and others have been You control it, but it is difficult to convict them. They are nothing more than criminals, so it is alright to keep them in prison. If you want to kill them, the clansmen will definitely object strongly!\"","\"Moreover, the majority of the clan members still hate the Cloudy Qilin Clan. This is definitely not a fact that can be changed by catching a few rebellious Elders. For the sake of you and the Sacred Phoenix Clan, let's wait a little longer... \"","Huang Likai said this with trepidation. It was because he had seen the methods of Huang Yueli and Li Moying and realized that it was absolutely impossible for him to compete with these two god-level geniuses.","Therefore, what he just said was indeed from the bottom of his heart.","No matter which angle you look at it, Huang Yueli and Li Moying should not get married now!","However, he was very worried that the young and willful new Matriarch would feel offended by this...","However, Huang Yueli showed no sign of anger.","She nodded and said: \"Elder Likai, your concerns are indeed justified. Then... in your opinion, when is the most appropriate time to hold the wedding ceremony of Moying and I?\"","Hearing that Huang Yueli's tone was very gentle, Huang Likai secretly breathed a sigh of relief, \"This... according to my subordinates, the best time is of course...\"","He paused here, hesitating a little, but finally began to speak boldly.","\"I believe that the most appropriate time is when you and Young Master Li have both broken through to the Fate Profound Realm!\"","He was afraid that Huang Yueli would misunderstand that he was deliberately causing trouble, so after saying this, he hurriedly explained.","\"Martialism is still respected in the divine world. As long as the strength is strong enough, no matter how many voices of opposition there are, they have to be calmed down. Although you and Young Master Li are already god-level geniuses, in the final analysis, they are just extraordinary talents and growth speed. It's astonishing, but compared with those powerful people in the Life Profound Realm who are hiding in the world, their strength is still far behind, and they cannot form a sufficient deterrent to the clansmen!\"","\"But once you break through the Life Profound Realm, it will be completely different. With your talents, at the early stage of the Life Profound Realm, you will probably be able to defeat most of the old monsters in the Life Profound Realm and become the true top masters in the God Realm. !\"","\"Besides, with the talents of both of you, as long as there are no accidents along the way, it is not difficult to reach the Life Profound Realm. It is estimated that it can be done in one or two hundred years at most. The life span of a strong Life Profound Realm exceeds ten thousand years. Time is nothing compared to a long lifespan. After the two of you break through the Life Profound Realm and want to stay together forever, no one will dare to interfere.\"","Huang Likai didn't dare to take a breath midway, so he said all these words in one breath at a flying speed.","Until he finished speaking, he took a deep breath and looked at Huang Yueli.","Occasionally missing content, please report errors in time."]},{"number":4316,"title":"Chapter 4316 Are You Going To Elope? (2)","paragraphs":["\"Did you just say that...you've just broken through to the Life Profound Realm?\"","After Huang Yueli listened to his long speech, she was silent for a moment before speaking thoughtfully.","Huang Likai hurriedly said: \"This is just a humble opinion of mine. Please take it as a reference, Matriarch!\"","Huang Yueli had no expression on her face. She nodded slightly and changed the topic.","\"Alright, now that Huang Xindi has been sent to the heavenly prison, Elder Likai will be responsible for taking charge of all clan affairs!\"","When Huang Likai heard this, he immediately beamed with joy!","He has struggled in the family for so many years, and he has tried every means to cling to Huang Yueli's lap. His ultimate goal is just to gain the power to take charge of family affairs!","This time I finally got what I wanted.","The little risk I took just now by the Burning Sky Lake was really worth it!","He quickly knelt down and said, \"I will obey the order of the Matriarch, and my subordinates will definitely fulfill their mission!\"","Huang Yueli nodded and waved: \"Today's advancement has consumed too much energy. I just had another battle with Huang Xindi and others. I'm a little tired. You can go.\"","All the Elders immediately saluted and said goodbye.","As soon as the Elders left, Liu Buyan came over.","\"Junior sister, you don't really want to listen to them and cancel your wedding ceremony with Li Moying, do you?\"","Huang Yueli muttered: \"Actually...what Elder Likai said still makes some sense...\"","Although the thorns like Huang Xindi have been eliminated, the opinions of the tens of thousands of remaining clansmen are not so easy to change.","When the time comes, internal strife within the clan will definitely be inevitable.","In addition, not only the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but also the Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely cause an uproar when they receive the news!","When the time comes, the pressure the two of them will bear must be very great, and it is indeed not a safe strategy.","Liu Buyan immediately showed a gloating smile, \"Li Moying, are you today too? Are you going to be abandoned by my junior sister now?\"","Li Moying glanced at him coldly, \"You are so smart! No wonder you can't find a wife until now.\"","\"Hey, what do you mean?!\" Liu Buyan blushed after being stepped on by him.","Li Moying did not continue to talk to him, but turned to Huang Yueli.","\"Little Li'er, do you mean... is this good?\"","Huang Yueli smiled sweetly at him, \"What's wrong? Anyway, Huang Likai also said just now that strength... is the biggest factor that determines whether we can be together openly, isn't it? Besides, you can do it Why can't I?\"","Li Moying's eyes became gentler, but her tone was still hesitant, \"But, after all, your situation is somewhat different from mine...\"","\"It's no different, right? I think Huang Tianhao recovered quickly after taking the god-level elixir collected by his family. With him in charge, there will probably be no problems.\"","Li Moying thought for a moment and nodded, \"If you have already made up your mind, I will naturally not object.\"","Liu Buyan listened at a loss.","He couldn't help but intervene, \"That's enough, you guys! What kind of riddles are you playing? Junior sister, what are you planning to do?\"","Liu Buyan knew that Li Moying would not answer his question, so he simply asked Huang Yueli directly.","Sure enough, Huang Yueli's attitude became much better.","She smiled and said: \"Senior brother, I plan to make arrangements in the next two days and secretly leave the Sacred Phoenix Clan to go out to practice with Moying. I won't be back in a short time.\""]},{"number":4317,"title":"Chapter 4317 Are You Going To Elope? (3)","paragraphs":["Liu Buyan was startled, \"What? Are you...are you going to elope?! Why? Now that you have captured Huang Xindi, there are fewer and fewer voices against you in the family. As long as you postpone your marriage with Li Moying is getting married, and there is no problem in taking the position of Matriarch.\"","\"Then, if you work hard for a few more years, you will be able to gather all the branches in the family and gain real power. Why do you want to leave?\"","Huang Yueli said disapprovingly: \"Of course it's because of my Moying. I don't want to be with him secretly! Besides, there are too many rules in the big family, and I don't like them. This time I returned to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, mainly because of In order to get the family resources, now that I have successfully completed the blood core initiation, what are I still doing? To be honest, I have no interest in dealing with family affairs or anything like that!\"","She has always been free and easy by nature.","Although she can be very sinister when necessary, no conspiracy can escape her eyes.","However, she doesn't like this kind of intrigue at all.","In Huang Yueli's opinion, if she had time to fight, it would be better to go out with her husband to practice, or study the magic of spirit armaments.","If that doesn't work, you can tease the little phoenix, little unicorn or something at home!","It's much better than staying with those old men who have made it difficult to improve in cultivation.","Liu Buyan was speechless, \"But...but...if you leave the Sacred Phoenix Clan now, wouldn't all your hard work these days be in vain? Even though Huang Likai seems to be very respectful to you now, but... After all, it's under your nose. If you really leave the Sacred Phoenix Clan and don't come back for a long time, he will soon become the second Huang Xindi!\"","Huang Yueli smiled and said: \"Of course I know this. But, as he said just now, strength is the biggest factor that determines the right to speak. When Moying and I break through the Life Profound Realm and come back, will he Do you still dare to resist me? When the time comes, it will be just a matter of effort for me to consolidate the power of the family.\"","Hearing this, Liu Buyan stayed for a while.","After coming back to his senses, his face became even more ugly.","\"Alright, you guys are awesome, show off your love and strength, right? Why am I so unlucky to meet you?\"","When these two people were in their previous lives, he could barely keep up with them.","Since their reincarnation, their talents have become more and more abnormal, and they are becoming more and more abnormal day by day.","Now, when he is around this blind young couple, he can only be stimulated every day!","Huang Yueli said with a smile: \"Senior brother, don't worry, you won't continue to be unlucky. Anyway, Moying and I are leaving, and we don't know when we will come back. No one will provoke you in the future, so don't Just miss us too much!\"","Liu Buyan's eyes widened again.","\"You...what do you mean? Where are you going? I'm going with you! Do you still want to abandon me?\"","He found that his brain was seriously insufficient tonight. He often couldn't react to what his junior sister said!","Huang Yueli blinked, \"What do you mean by abandoning you? It's just that Moying and I are going to the world of two, do you have to follow us all the time? Don't you always think it's annoying that we show affection every day? Don't you think it's annoying? Are you going to take the initiative to torture me?\"","\"This...\" Liu Buyan was stunned."]},{"number":4318,"title":"Chapter 4318 Are You Going To Elope? (4)","paragraphs":["Although he didn't like being stuffed with their displays of affection, he was a little reluctant to leave Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","After all, the auras of these two god-level geniuses are different from those of normal people, and they rarely cause trouble wherever they go.","He can eat melon and gossip every day, which is much more fun than wandering around alone.","However, now that people are strongly demanding a life of two, he is embarrassed and has to follow her.","Liu Buyan thought for a moment and could only say: \"Well, after you leave, I will go to the Spirit Medicine Master Guild to have a look.\"","It has been almost a year since I arrived in the God Realm.","Liu Buyan also gradually realized that his cultivation talent was nothing in the entire God Realm, especially with Huang Yueli and Li Moying, two extremely talented people around him, which seriously affected his cultivation. Confidence.","However, his talent in elixirs can still be regarded as a first-rate genius.","Therefore, Liu Buyan has made up his mind to develop mainly in spiritual medicine.","Huang Yueli nodded, \"That's alright. If you don't like to go to the Spirit Medicine Master Guild, senior brother, there's no problem in staying in the Sacred Phoenix Clan. I can give you access to the family library at any time. Over the years, the Sacred Phoenix Clan has I have collected a large number of classics on elixirs, which will definitely be helpful to you. Of course, you can also go to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and Li Shihong and others will definitely welcome you...\"","Having said this, Huang Yueli pursed her lips.","Suddenly, she realized that her senior brother was much more popular than she and Li Moying!","Welcome wherever you go!","She also discovered that they had only been in the Sacred Phoenix Clan for a few days, but many young girls in the clan would blush when they saw Liu Buyan...","Sometimes the popularity is higher than that of Li Moying.","Maybe, compared to the aloof and unapproachable Young Master Li, Liu Buyan is more like the big brother next door. He also has medical skills. He feels like a reliable person!","Although, the truth may be the opposite...","Huang Yueli suddenly thought of something, curled her lips, and smiled mysteriously, \"By the way, senior brother, actually, you might consider going to the Xuanwu Clan! After you saved Xuan Qingling last time, she was grateful to you. Not to mention, when we met her in Floating Sea, she also said that she wanted to invite you to the Xuanwu Clan as a guest!\"","Liu Buyan almost choked on his own saliva.","\"Ahem, cough, cough, cough! She is grateful to me... what is she grateful to me for? Kicked me into the cesspit, is this her way of thanking others? It tastes too strong!\"","Li Moying couldn't help but laugh, \"Didn't you always say before that you wanted to find a girl who was different and ordinary girls would look down on you? Is this time special enough? I think you and Miss Xuan are still different. It's a good match!\"","\"It's a perfect size for you!\" Liu Buyan vomited blood.","After falling into a manure pit last time, he had a psychological shadow and could not recover for a long time.","Although I am very clean after taking a shower, I often have an inexplicable hallucination and feel that my body smells bad.","It was not until recently that he finally recovered.","However, when he thought of Xuan Qingling, his thoughts drifted away again.","As the top genius of the Xuanwu clan, Xuan Qingling has been practicing water-based skills based on self-cultivation since she was a child, which is completely different from the highly offensive attributes of Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","As a result, Xuan Qingling usually looks very cold, with no expression on her face most of the time."]},{"number":4319,"title":"Chapter 4319 Are You Going To Elope? (5)","paragraphs":["Liu Buyan never imagined that such a girl could actually kick someone into a manure pit...","Seeing Liu Buyan in a daze, Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged glances and snickered.","...","In the next two days, Huang Yueli seized the last moment to distribute the clan affairs of the Sacred Phoenix Clan to the remaining Elders.","However, she did not say anything about her plans to leave, and planned to sneak away secretly.","Li Moying also told the guards about this.","Li Tianyi and others immediately said that they would follow their Young Master closely to the ends of the world!","This made Li Moying's head full of black lines, \"Alright, you should go back to the family and practice hard. When I return to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, I will still need you!\"","Are you kidding me?","If you go out to practice with your seniority, it will most likely be in the wilderness, which is just right... ahem.","If he has such a large group of dragsters, how can he still practice dual cultivation?","This will seriously affect the improvement of his cultivation!","Li Tianyi and others didn't know what was going on, but they didn't dare to disobey the Young Master's order, so they could only agree.","The next day, Li Tianyi and others secretly left Ice Moon Summit, and Liu Buyan followed them.","It just so happened that they would escort Divine Doctor Liu to the Spirit Medicine Master Guild.","At night, Huang Yueli and Li Moying were the ones sneaking away!","Both of them are now celebrities in the God Realm. Although ordinary cultivators may not recognize them, if they happen to meet a talented cultivator from the ancient gods, they can be recognized at a glance.","Therefore, Huang Yueli specially made some simple disguises for herself and her husband.","Under the cover of night, the two people left quietly from the back mountain.","It wasn't until Ice Moon Summit was out of sight that Li Moying turned his head and glanced at the excited girl next to him.","\"Little Li'er, are you leaving just like that? Aren't you reluctant to part with your identity as the leader of the Sacred Phoenix Clan ?\"","Huang Yueli blinked, \"What kind of strange question is this? What about you? Are you reluctant to let go of your identity as the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?\"","Li Moying frowned, \"That's different...\"","\"What's the difference?\"","Li Moying said seriously: \"I am a man...\"","Upon hearing this, Huang Yueli raised a charming smile on her lips, hooked one hand around Li Moying's neck, and pulled him over.","Li Moying didn't resist at all and lowered his head according to her strength.","Huang Yueli stood on her tiptoes, pressed her lips against his perfectly shaped lips, and breathed out, \"Yes, you are...'my' man!\"","Hearing this, Li Moying's heart trembled.","His arms suddenly wrapped around her slender waist, pulling her whole body into his arms, turning his back on himself and kissing her.","Because he was so tight, Huang Yueli felt that her waist was about to be broken, and she couldn't help but frown.","However, she didn't make a sound and still devoted herself to the kiss.","After a long time, Li Moying let go of her and stared at the girl's red and swollen lips from his kiss, with light flashing in his eyes.","\"Little Li'er...\"","The man's voice was unusually hoarse, with a sexy hint.","Huang Yueli was excited and quickly changed the subject, \"Well... ahem, by the way, Moying, why have you never asked where I want to take you? Just follow me like that?\"","The corners of Li Moying's mouth turned up, \"Don't you already have a plan?\"","Huang Yueli said unexpectedly: \"You even know this? I haven't told you yet!\""]},{"number":4320,"title":"Chapter 4320 Phoenix Relic (1)","paragraphs":["Li Moying smiled slightly and said nothing.","Huang Yueli realized that she had asked a very stupid question.","How could her husband not know what she wanted to do?","Huang Yueli quickly took out a scroll from her sleeve.","The scroll looks old and tattered on the outside, with holes eaten out by insects in some places. It is obviously old.","However, the scroll faintly exudes an indescribable ancient atmosphere.","Li Moying reached out and touched it, and a burst of fire energy came from his palm.","He raised his eyebrows, \"What is this?\"","Huang Yueli explained at the side: \"I found this from the secret vault of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. This scroll was thrown in the corner and covered with dust. If I hadn't rescued it in time, it would have been lost forever.\" After a few years, I probably won't even be able to read what's written on it!\"","The secret vault of the Sacred Phoenix Clan contains the top secret treasures that have been passed down by the family for hundreds of thousands of years.","It can only be opened with the Matriarch's seal.","In the past two days, Huang Yueli, apart from arranging family affairs, carefully visited the collection of the secret library.","Of course, the real treasures inside are all registered in the family. Even if she was the Matriarch, she must go through certain procedures to take them away.","Moreover, it's not very necessary.","Carrying a valuable treasure can easily attract others to covet you, and it will also affect your mentality during training, making it difficult to achieve the effect of training yourself in times of danger.","However, this humble little scroll is different.","Li Moying opened the scroll while listening.","This scroll not only looks shabby on the outside, it also looks tattered on the inside, with some parts blurred.","However, it can still be judged that this should be a map.","There is also a red mark in the upper right corner of the map, which should be the destination.","\"Where is this map going? Is it the cave of a strong man from ancient times?\" Li Moying asked.","Huang Yueli shook her head and showed a mysterious smile.","\"This...should not be a cave. It is the birthplace of the ancient mythical beast Phoenix Clan. Do you see the red mark on it? That is the mark of the ancient Phoenix Clan. In the secret collection of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, there are only the ones with the Phoenix Clan. Only secret treasures related to a clan have this mark.\"","\"However, I heard that the ancient beasts have been extinct in the God Realm for many years, and the only remains there should be.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, she suddenly felt a surge of excitement in Sky Phoenix Ring. Little Wang Cai flapped his little wings and shouted: \"I want to come out! I want to come out!\"","Huang Yueli changed her mind and the little phoenix fell to the ground with a plop.","It rolled, turned into a human form, and stood up.","Without even bothering to pat the dust on his butt, he directly grabbed Huang Yueli's sleeves and shouted excitedly: \"Devil, is it true? Is what you said true? Are you really Did you find the place where my people live?!\"","As the spirit body of the phoenix beast, Little Wang Cai's memory still lingers on the eve of his separation from the body and being sealed into Sky Phoenix Ring.","At that time, it was only born not long ago and had never left its hometown.","The Phoenix clan was attacked by foreign enemies, and his brother took it with him to escape, but then... he passed out!","What happened later was that part of Little Wang Cai's memory was missing.","In short, when he woke up again, it had become Sky Phoenix Ring's weapon spirit.","Little Wang Cai has always wanted to return to his hometown and see his relatives."]},{"number":4321,"title":"Chapter 4321 Phoenix Relic (2)","paragraphs":["Although... none of them may be alive long ago...","However, Little Wang Cai was too young at the time and could not remember where his hometown was.","Now, when he heard Huang Yueli's words, he was so surprised that he wanted to roll around in excitement!","Huang Yueli touched his little head.","\"Well... you'd better not be too happy first. I'm just guessing, and I can't guarantee it! Besides, since it's the relics of the Phoenix clan, there must be many hidden mechanisms and obstacles. Even if we go, there will be no guarantee. There will definitely be a place.\"","Little Wang Cai was still very excited, and his little head kept ticking.","\"No, no, no, sir, my hunch tells me that this time it will go smoothly! I can already feel the call of my family!\"","Huang Yueli was speechless for a while.","If Little Phoenix really had a premonition, she wouldn't wait until she found the map before telling her.","Aren't you overwhelmed by this news?","However, she did not say this to attack Little Wang Cai.","After all, she also hopes to find the remains of the Phoenix clan from the bottom of her heart.","It's not to discover some secret treasure or opportunity, but to find a way for the little Phoenix to be reborn from nirvana!","Now, the little phoenix is a spirit body and has been trapped in the Sky Phoenix Ring and cannot get out.","However, the spiritual state is not true death for Phoenix.","Because of the characteristics of the Phoenix clan, as long as certain conditions are met and certain rituals are performed, they can be reborn in the fire through the spirit body.","This is recorded in many classics in the divine world.","However, the specific conditions required and how to perform the ceremony are not something that the gods and human cultivators can know.","Only real phoenixes can understand such secret things, and even not every phoenix can know it.","Originally, Huang Yueli had no hope for this.","But after discovering this map, she had a lot of ideas.","\"Anyway, we are not in a hurry for this experience, and there are no restrictions. We have to wait until we break through the Life Profound Realm before going back. Then we might as well go to the location marked on the map to have a look. Even if we can't find this ruins, we still can't go back. No loss. Moying, what do you think?\"","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes and looked at Li Moying expectantly.","Li Moying nodded decisively, \"I'll listen to my wife.\"","Huang Yueli immediately laughed, stood on tiptoes, and kissed Li Moying on the face, \"Thank you, husband, you are so kind!\"","Li Moying's eyes dimmed, and just as he was about to grab his little fox into his arms and give her a good kiss, Huang Yueli had already moved away quickly.","\"Alright, let's study the map quickly! To be honest, I looked at it for a long time and couldn't figure out where this location is...\"","Li Moying stared at the map for a while and suddenly said: \"It's too dark here, and it's in the wilderness. We are discussing here. What if we are overheard by passers-by?\"","\"Hmm... That makes sense.\" Huang Yueli was convinced by him.","\"So, let's go to the city first and find an inn to stay in!\"","The little fox finally regained his freedom today. He was so excited that he didn't notice the light in his husband's eyes and was tricked into the inn.","As a result, as soon as he entered the guest room, he was knocked down directly.","\"Madam, the night is too short, let's hurry up and practice double cultivation!\""]},{"number":4322,"title":"Chapter 4322 Phoenix Relic (3)","paragraphs":["\"Double...double what kind of cultivation are you doing? Aren't we here to study the map?!\"","\"You can study the map slowly, but you can't slack off in practice! We want to break past the Life Profound Realm!\"","Huang Yueli was dismantled and eaten.","The next morning, she held her waist and struggled to get up. She was so angry that she didn't want to pay attention to anyone!","Li Moying, on the other hand, had eaten and drank enough and was in a good mood. Regardless of her cold face, she was very attentive and flattering.","Huang Yueli originally didn't want to forgive him so easily, but when she felt the anxious aura of Sky Phoenix Ring and the younger Phoenix, she reluctantly compromised a little.","\"Come here and look at the map first! If you don't understand it, you won't be able to enter my room for a month!\"","Li Moying frowned, \"Then... what if I can understand it? Is there a reward?\"","\"Certainly...\"","Huang Yueli was almost led astray by him, but fortunately, she reacted in time.","\"Of course not! Look at the map carefully and don't think about whether there is something or not, otherwise, I will kick you out right now!\"","Li Moying saw that his little fox had become smart again and couldn't be deceived. He had no choice but to stop thinking, sat down at the table, took the map, and observed it carefully.","This map only depicts a small specific area.","This map only depicts a small specific area.","In other words, only after entering this area can you use this map to find the location of the ruins.","However, how can we determine the specific location with such a small map with blurred surroundings?","Huang Yueli had thought about this issue when she was at Ice Moon Summit, but she didn't have time to think about it deeply.","Li Moying picked up the map and looked at it carefully for a long time. He even stretched out his fingers and touched the edge of the map for a long time.","Little Wang Cai was watching from the side, he couldn't wait any longer and wanted to urge him loudly.","But Huang Yueli covered her mouth, \"Don't disturb him, wait a moment.\"","After another half an hour, Li Moying put down the map.","\"I can't be sure now, where exactly is this place...\"","Upon hearing this, both Huang Yueli and Little Phoenix felt disappointed.","Li Moying arrived in the God Realm relatively early and stayed in the Cloudy Qilin Clan. He had read many more classics than Huang Yueli.","He has a photographic memory. As long as he has seen it, he will have an impression, and he knows the map of the God Realm clearly.","Since even he doesn't know where this place is, it will be really difficult to find it!","\"But...\" Li Moying changed the topic, \"I have some guesses.\"","\"What guess? Tell me quickly!\" Huang Yueli urged him.","Li Moying glanced at her, \"Kiss me and I'll tell you.\"","\"You, you, you...this is taking advantage of the situation!\" Huang Yueli glared at him angrily.","Li Moying said coolly: \"What do you mean by taking advantage of the situation? Originally, we didn't necessarily have to go find this relic. If you don't want to kiss us, we can just change places. What a big deal...\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Little Wang Cai was so anxious that he almost jumped up.","\"Devil, hurry up and kiss him! Anyway, you guys had sex all night last night, what's the use of a kiss?\"","Damn, this naughty kid!","What does bang bang bang mean? !","Huang Yueli was so angry that she grabbed Little Phoenix by the collar, \"Alright, you talk too much, go back to Sky Phoenix Ring to rest!\"","She took the little Phoenix back.","Turned his head again and glared at Li Moying.","The corners of Li Moying's mouth raised, her body leaned forward slightly, and the light from her pair of peach blossom eyes focused on her face.","Time seemed to go back decades to their previous lives."]},{"number":4323,"title":"Chapter 4323 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (1)","paragraphs":["4323 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (1)","Mu Chengying was like this at that time.","Come and mess with her every day when you have nothing to do.","Although he had long wanted to agree to her request, he wanted to embarrass her and find excuses to make her take the initiative to kiss him.","At that time, Huang Yueli was deeply disgusted by his behavior and felt that this man was really a shameless gangster!","Relying on my high strength and outstanding appearance, I feel that I can do whatever I want!","But now...","Now, she can understand the affection and concentration in his eyes, his persistence and lack of regrets...","Huang Yueli supported the table, slowly came closer, and gave his thin lips a lick.","Li Moying suddenly grabbed her slender waist, pulled her into his arms, and kissed her wantonly.","After a while, he let go of her.","Huang Yueli quickly jumped out of his arms, stood very far away, and said warily: \"Alright? I've already kissed you, stop being pretentious and speak clearly! What are you talking about on the map? What did you see?\"","Li Moying's eyes still stayed on her lips, and he even licked his own lips, as if he was still reminiscing about the kiss just now.","Huang Yueli's face suddenly turned red and she glared at him angrily, \"Answer the question quickly! Who told you to look around?\"","Li Moying sneered, \"My woman, let me see what's wrong?\"","Seeing that his little fox was about to go crazy, he calmed down a little.","\"Alright, alright, I said. Come here...\"","\"Don't come over!\" Huang Yueli immediately refused.","Li Moying raised his eyebrows, \"You really can't come here? If you don't look at the map, you can't explain this matter clearly!\"","Huang Yueli hesitated for a moment, then walked to the opposite side of Li Moying, separated by a table from him.","\"Alright, I can see clearly from here. Please tell me quickly!\"","Seeing her guarded look, Li Moying knew that he couldn't eat tofu today, so he could only stop thinking and become serious.","\"Little Li'er, look here.\"","He pointed at the edge of the map. There were several twisted symbols on the edge, which looked like writing and drawings. The specifics could not be distinguished.","\"I saw it. I've been observing these symbols for a long time, but I really can't figure it out. What does it mean?\"","Li Moying muttered: \"This... it's normal that you can't understand it. If I guessed correctly, this should be a language of the Devil Clan's...\"","\"What? Language of the Devil Clan's?\" Huang Yueli was surprised, \"How did you know?!\"","Li Moying said: \"Do you still remember the many classics we got from the Saint Iniquitous Shadow? He was both good and evil, and he also collected some devil skills. I put them away and looked at them in my spare time. That's why it feels familiar...\"","\"There are actually Devil Clan books collected in the secret realm of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow! Why didn't I notice it?\" Huang Yueli was even more surprised.","\"Because you only noticed the ones related to the spirit armament technique and the spiritual medicine technique, and you didn't look at the others carefully.\" Li Moying explained.","Huang Yueli looked at him worriedly, \"But... you actually dare to study the devil scriptures by yourself? We are not devils. If we practice devil skills, we can easily become possessed! Look at Huang Beicheng, he is just a living person example of.\"","Seeing that she was nervous, Li Moying quickly comforted his wife.","\"Little Li'er, don't worry, I just took a look and didn't intend to practice. I just studied the devil's writing, which is very different from our god's writing.\""]},{"number":4324,"title":"Chapter 4324 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (2)","paragraphs":["4324 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (2)","Huang Yueli felt relieved and asked again: \"Then can you understand the writing on the map?\"","Li Moying shook his head, \"It's impossible to fully understand. I can only make a rough guess. The edges of the map should be marked on the southeast, northwest, and southeast. These should indicate the entry path and the surrounding mechanisms. However, I still can't figure out where the specific location marked on this map is.\"","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and her eyes lit up.","\"I thought about it! Look at the black shadow on the map, it should be a large swamp indicated.\"","\"Do you still remember that when we were in You'an City, we went deep into the front line? Outside You'an City, where it meets the Devil Clan's territory, there is a large swamp! Maybe the location on the map is at the other end of the swamp, where the Devil Clan's On the territory! We might as well go to You'an City to have a look first, maybe we will find something.\"","When Huang Yueli said this, Li Moying also recalled it.","\"That makes sense. Anyway, we have no other ideas, so we might as well start from You'an City.\"","Huang Yueli's intuition is often very accurate.","Moreover, they have been able to determine that the location on the map should be on the devil territory.","In this way, using You'an City as a breakthrough point, at least there will be no losses.","After the two of them finished their discussion, they rested for a night at the inn.","The next morning, we set off for You'an City.","Huang Yueli left this time, taking a small airship with him.","However, she did not take it out immediately.","There are emblems of the Sacred Phoenix Clan on the airship. They are still on the territory of the Sacred Phoenix Continent. Once they get on board, they will definitely be seen by the garrison of major towns.","When the time comes, Huang Likai and the others will definitely catch up.","Although the Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan did not have the strength to take them back, it would be too embarrassing to be caught on the first day of the elopement!","Therefore, they walked for more than twenty days until they were out of the range of Sacred Phoenix Continent, and then boarded the airship.","It took another four or five days before we arrived at You'an City.","The city lord and divine general of You'an City were old acquaintances with Huang Yueli and the others.","At first, he admired Li Moying and Huang Yueli very much and even invited them to a banquet at the city lord's mansion.","However, they are on the way to elope now and cannot visit at home.","\"It doesn't matter. The city lord is busy with official duties and may not have time to receive us.\"","\"That's right. Let's go to the store and drugstore to buy some things, and then go directly out of the city. Alas, elopement is just like being a thief! We are so pitiful!\"","Little Wang Cai followed the two of them. Hearing the hostess's complaints, he couldn't help but roll his eyes secretly.","What's so pitiful? How do you see how pitiful they are?","He actually felt that Huang Yueli was very excited!","As if elopement was some fun game.","Of course... for geniuses like them, this may really be no different from a game!","After the two of them left the city, they quietly bypassed the frontline coalition defense line.","Both of them are now at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm. In terms of strength, they even surpass many strong men in the late Dao Profound Realm.","Deliberately step slowly so that no one can notice.","After spending two days moving forward, we arrived at the swamp Huang Yueli mentioned.","\"At that time, I was attacked by devils during the teleportation process. The teleportation array failed, and I fell at this location.\" Huang Yueli pointed eastward."]},{"number":4325,"title":"Chapter 4325 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (3)","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Li Moying immediately frowned.","He was tricked by Huang Sanbai, an old man, and passed by his wife. As a result, Huang Yueli was in danger one after another and almost died on the Devil Clan's battlefield.","This was one of the most annoying things after he ascended to the God Realm.","Seeing his expression, Huang Yueli quickly said: \"Ahem, I think the terrain in this area is very similar to the black area marked on the map. Come and confirm it for me.\"","As expected, Li Moying's attention was diverted, and he stepped forward and took the map she handed over.","After carefully comparing them, he began to walk slowly along the periphery of the swamp, comparing them bit by bit.","Huang Yueli slowly followed him, teasing Little Phoenix.","She sighed in her heart: It's good to have a husband! She doesn't have to do anything anymore, saving time and effort!","After a while, Li Moying put down the map, \"It should be right, your intuition is so accurate! The terrain of this swamp is very similar to that on the map, there is at least a 70% chance of it.\"","Huang Yueli walked over excitedly, \"This map is so shabby, it's rare to be 70% sure! Assuming that this swamp is the one on the map, then let's go east, here There should be a Devil Clan city. After passing this city and continuing forward, passing through this dense forest, you should be able to approach your destination...\"","Li Moying nodded, agreeing with her judgment.","\"Yes, let's keep moving forward. If we can find this Devil Clan city, it should prove that we are heading in the right direction.\"","The two followed the directions on the map and walked forward for another seven or eight days.","These tents are arranged one after another, forming a ring-like shape.","During this period, they also encountered many devil cultivators, but they cleverly avoided them.","Finally, they finally stood at the location of the \"Devil Clan City\" marked on the map.","Huang Yueli looked around and was very surprised, \"This... can this be regarded as... a city? It can only be said to be a gathering point!\"","In front of her, there were no tall city walls, regular streets, or row upon row of houses as she had imagined.","Instead, there were large tents set up in an empty wilderness.","These tents are arranged one after another, forming a ring-like shape.","It looks like a camp where soldiers from the Allied Forces of the Gods are stationed.","However, their tents looked larger and sturdier than those of the coalition forces.","Li Moying said thoughtfully: \"Perhaps, the 'city' of the devils is indeed like this. Their living and cultivation habits are different from ours, and it is normal for them to live in different places.\"","Huang Yueli thought for a while and nodded slightly.","She suddenly remembered that when Li Moying and Jun Sihan killed the devil Ruize, Ruize did not live in a tent like the human race, but hid in a cave and practiced.","Maybe, the life of these devils is really so... primitive?","She quickly thought of another question, \"Now that's troublesome, how do we get around here? These tents are so scattered, and there are so many devils coming and going around, it's almost impossible to hide your whereabouts!\"","Originally, they planned to go around the Devil Clan City.","After all, they are the gods, and they are not here to fight the devils. If they can avoid causing trouble, it is better not to cause trouble.","So as not to delay the business."]},{"number":4326,"title":"Chapter 4326 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (4)","paragraphs":["However, the humans and gods in the God Realm knew very little about the situation on the Devil Clan. Although they had consulted some books in advance, none of them mentioned that the Devil Clan actually lived in this form.","In such a large and scattered camp, devils come and go from time to time.","It is much more difficult to go around without alerting anyone.","\"There is indeed some trouble. Let's walk along the east side first to see how big this camp is.\" Li Moying quickly made a decision.","Huang Yueli nodded, \"Alright, I think so too.\"","The two of them cautiously moved along the perimeter of the camp.","I walked for several hours.","But the camp was larger than they expected, and they still couldn't see the edge.","The sky gradually darkened.","Huang Yueli slowed down, \"The five senses of the devils will be more acute at night. Let's find a place to rest first and wait until tomorrow...\"","Before she finished speaking, a sharp sound suddenly came from not far away.","\"Who is there? Get out of here quickly!\"","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were both shocked.","The conversation they just had was all done through inner breath. Logically speaking, they shouldn't be discovered by others.","Moreover, with the movement skills of the two of them, even in the dark, they caused very little movement.","He would actually be discovered by the patrolling devil cultivators!","The advantage of the devils fighting in the dark is indeed too obvious!","\"Who are they? Get out of here quickly! Otherwise I won't be polite!\"","\"Captain, what are you talking about with them? If you sneak up outside the camp in the middle of the night, even if you're not a human being, you're definitely not a good person!\"","\"That's right, just kill him! I haven't killed anyone for a long time, and my hands are so itchy...\"","Huang Yueli and Li Moying looked at each other, made a decision and walked out of the woods where they were hiding.","Outside the woods, many devils gathered together, holding weapons in their hands and looking at the two of them with great vigilance.","When the leading captain saw them, he immediately waved his hand and said: \"Get these two spies!\"","Several Devil Clans swarmed forward.","Huang Yueli dodged subconsciously, lowered her voice and said, \"Don't be impulsive! We are really not spies...\"","\"I don't care if you're a spy? Our team hasn't done anything for a long time. Let's arrest you two first to make up for it!\"","\"Hey, I haven't eaten meat for a long time. There is a girl here who can be caught and used!\"","\"Who told you to be unlucky?\"","Huang Yueli frowned slightly when she heard this.","Before she could say anything else, Li Moying beside her had already taken action decisively!","A black aura spread out from the right hand he waved, and a cold aura erupted!","Even Huang Yueli found it difficult to breathe and hurriedly used the profound energy in her body to resist.","What Li Moying used was not the thunder-attributed mysterious power, but the evil qi hidden in his body on weekdays!","Under the suppression of this aura, the devil soldiers could not bear the huge pressure at all, and most of them spurted blood and flew backwards on the spot!","Only the captain who took the lead could barely stand still, but with his hands covering his chest, he was obviously seriously injured.","Li Moying took back his evil qi and slowly took two steps forward.","Ever since he and Huang Yueli entered the devil territory, they had disguised themselves in order to hide their identities.","Not only that, he was also wearing a large cloak with the collar turned up, enough to cover most of his face.","Therefore, the devil captain's eyes widened, but he still didn't see anything."]},{"number":4327,"title":"Chapter 4327 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (5)","paragraphs":["4327 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (5)","Huang Yueli also walked out and looked at the devil captain coldly.","\"It's been a long time since I've seen such a cold-blooded person! My man and I were passing by here, and I didn't want to waste time on you, but I didn't expect you to come to your door to seek death!\"","\"In this case, you are here at the right time! I am short of living creatures to make elixirs, so I have captured you today to use as alchemy materials. Although you are a bit weak and cannot be used for great purposes, you can make a few pills and feed them to me. Even if the spirit beasts in the seat eat it, it's still barely enough.\"","When the devil captain heard this, he was so frightened that he trembled and fell to his knees.","\"My lord, have mercy on me! My lord, have mercy on me! I didn't know that these two adults are masters of the devil Realm. If I knew, I wouldn't dare to offend these two adults like this even if I were killed!\"","He kowtowed as hard as he could, making the ground bang.","Behind him, the devil soldiers who were knocked away by Li Moying also endured the pain, got up from the ground, knelt on the ground, and kowtowed.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying remained calm and did not say anything to stop them, allowing these devils to kowtow on the ground and beg for mercy.","However, they secretly exchanged a look in private.","Just now, as soon as Huang Yueli finished speaking, she realized that she had made a mistake.","She was thinking inertia, thinking that she was still on the territory of the Gods.","There is a whole camp of people behind the opponent, trying not to think of a big conflict and preparing to use relatively mild means to sneak in.","But she forgot that this was the territory of the Devil Clan.","The devils only believe in the law of the jungle. The strong are absolutely right, and the weak can bully them without any scruples.","Huang Yueli tried to persuade them, but it would only make them think that the two people opposite them had no strength and could be toyed with.","As for whether they are really spies, it is not important to the devil soldiers.","Li Moying's reaction was a little faster. When he heard his little fox said something wrong, he immediately took action and suppressed the situation.","Huang Yueli also woke up in time and immediately put on an inscrutable expression. She also said that she would make these devil cultivators alive to make elixirs to scare them.","The devil soldiers were indeed frightened by the two of them.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were a little surprised that such a situation would occur.","Li Moying had an idea just now, and instead of using profound energy, he used evil qi to attack. He just guessed that the two energies were very similar, and the devil cultivators might not be able to distinguish them.","However, this is just a guess. After all, no one has made such an attempt before him.","But now, it turns out that his guess was right!","These devil cultivators completely regarded them as devil masters in the Sky Devil Realm without any doubt!","This was surprising enough.","Of course, now was not the time to discuss this issue, so Huang Yueli did not say anything more to Li Moying and looked at the devil captain again.","\"Spare your lives...it's not impossible. But...\"","\"If you two adults have any requests, please feel free to ask. I am willing to help you two to make up for the offense I just caused...\"","Huang Yueli glanced at him with a half-smile and asked, \"What's your name?\"","The captain of the Devil Clan hurriedly said: \"To tell you what to say, the younger one's name is Tian Lin.\"","Huang Yueli nodded, \"My man and I were passing by here, and we happened to be going into your camp to buy some materials. We lack a few errands to lead the way.\""]},{"number":4328,"title":"Chapter 4328 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (6)","paragraphs":["4328 Entering the Devil Clan’s Territory (6)","Tian Lin understood and immediately expressed his loyalty, \"Two adults, this matter will be taken care of by me!\"","\"I am very familiar with the camp, and I guarantee that I will satisfy the two adults!\"","Tian Lin's tone sounded extremely sincere.","However, Huang Yueli noticed that his eyes rolled and a cunning dark light flashed in his eyes.","Huang Yueli glanced at him, \"If you dare to use any crooked ideas, I have plenty of ways to deal with you. When the time comes, it will be easy to refine elixirs alive...\"","\"I don't dare!\" The Devil Clan captain couldn't help but tremble when he heard this.","Thinking of that moment just now, Li Moying suddenly burst out with powerful power, and his heart trembled.","With such strength, I am afraid that only the lord of their camp is higher than him.","Such a strong man is definitely not comparable to an Earth devil Stage cultivator like him.","He immediately stopped his ulterior motives, got up, and led the way obediently.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli slowly followed a few devil soldiers and walked toward the camp.","The two of them had the same mind. The moment they were spotted by the devil soldiers, they exchanged glances and reached a consensus.","Now that it has been discovered, it is better to take advantage of this opportunity and sneak directly into the devil camp.","On the Devil Clan's territory, they might be able to find maps or other information to help them accurately locate the Phoenix Relic.","Moreover, this way, there is no need to take a detour.","Now, Tian Lin has determined that the two of them are devils in the devil stage, which makes it even easier.","Tian Lin led the two of them to the edge of the camp, showed his badge to the patrolling guard, and was immediately let in.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were about to follow, but were stopped.","\"Who are you two? Where are your badges?\"","Huang Yueli learned the lesson from last time this time. Instead of explaining, she sneered.","\"Who do you think you are? How dare you ask me who I am? Get out of here!\"","With that said, she also released the evil qi in her body in time, and directly bombarded the devil soldiers blocking the road!","The devil soldiers fell to the ground one after another.","However, after getting up again, they all fell to their knees, each with an extremely respectful attitude.","Huang Yueli looked speechless for a while.","She was too lazy to pay attention to these devils anymore, and followed Tian Lin into the devil camp in a big way.","When Tian Lin saw Huang Yueli take action, his attitude became obviously more respectful.","Li Moying's strength alone is similar to that of their lord, and now, his wife is also at the devil level!","This is too terrible!","Huang Yueli observed the surrounding environment calmly.","The tents in the devil camp are arranged neatly. From the outside, it looks like a military camp.","But after entering, we discovered that not all of these tents were inhabited by people. There were also people doing various things to make a living in the tents. Overall, they looked not much different from human cities.","If there is any difference, I'm afraid it's the atmosphere here.","The devils have absolutely no concept of protecting the weak. On the street, we often see people snatching away people at the slightest disagreement.","Even if the devil soldiers were standing on the edge, they would not stop these bandits.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli and Li Moying are not easy to mess with at first sight, and there is Tian Lin, a devil who can get to the captain level, so no one dares to cause trouble for them.","\"Further forward, we have the largest hotel in Vermillion Light Collet. Would you two adults go in and enjoy it?\""]},{"number":4329,"title":"Chapter 4329 Another Little Phoenix (1)","paragraphs":["4329 Another Little Phoenix (1)","Li Moying shook his head and said coldly: \"No, we are not in the mood. We just need to find a place to stay.\"","Huang Yueli also nodded.","Although they were both very hungry after a busy day, she was not interested in the devil diet at all.","I heard that the devils still have the habit of eating raw food. After killing the devil beasts, they don't even drain the blood, but cut the meat into pieces and eat it, calling it a delicious delicacy...","Although she didn't know whether the rumours were true or not, just thinking about it made her sick.","Anyway, Sky Phoenix Ring had a lot to eat in her dimension, so she should just eat human food honestly.","Tian Lin found an inn for the two of them to stay.","When they entered the inn, the boss looked at the two of them and saw something wrong.","However, after seeing that Tian Lin, the captain of the devil army, was so respectful to the two of them, the boss's expression also changed and he was very attentive to the two of them.","The night was spent peacefully.","Early the next morning, Tian Lin appeared again, offering to serve the two of them.","\"Two adults, what do you need me to do today?\"","Li Moying glanced at him and said, \"Where is the biggest market here? Take us there.\"","When Tian Lin heard this, he was obviously stunned for a moment, and then said: \"Fangshi? You are talking about the market, right? Fangshi is what the human race calls it.\"","Li Moying realized that he had also said the wrong thing, and pursed his lips, but his expression did not change.","Huang Yue left the mouth and said: \"Yes, let's go to the market. Husband, I have told you a long time ago that those human beings captured last time should have been killed long ago. You still talked so much nonsense to them, and now you can't even speak. He has a human accent.\"","Li Moying reacted quickly, pretending to be impatient, and glanced at Huang Yueli with a frown.","\"Woman, what do you know? Although the human race is a despicable race, they still have a lot of treasures, and those elixir masters and spirit armament masters do have some skills. Let them work for us. , wouldn't it be more effective than killing them?\"","The performance of the two was very successful, and Tian Lin really put down the doubt in his heart.","Not only that, but I also admire Li Moying's methods very much.","\"Sir, you are really amazing! Those useless people from the human race and the gods are not very strong, but their bones are very hard. Even our Lord, we can't make them obedient by all means.\"","Tian Lin's attitude towards the two of them became more and more respectful. While leading the way, he did not forget to flatter them.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","Although the cultivators of the God Clan Alliance often fought against the Devil Clan, the contact between the two sides was basically concentrated on the battlefield.","The area where the devils live has a harsh living environment and a lack of resources. Naturally, the gods and humans will not deliberately venture into such a barbaric land.","Precisely because they don't know much about them, it's easy for them to make mistakes in what they say and do. If they're not careful, their identity may be exposed.","This can be regarded as a wake-up call for them.","The evil qi in their bodies can be mistaken for real, but it does not mean that they can easily survive in the Devil Clan's territory.","Talking too much would be wrong, so the two of them were silent for a moment, and unanimously chose to enter the cold mode.","Tian Lin took them to a market.","\"Two adults, this is the largest market in our Vermillion Light Territory! Although our Vermillion Light Territory is not a big territory, the market is the most famous among the dozen or so territories in this area!\""]},{"number":4330,"title":"Chapter 4330 Another Little Phoenix (2)","paragraphs":["4330 Another Little Phoenix (2)","\"Because we are closest to the human race's territory, people often get some weird things to sell. Whatever you two adults want to buy, you can definitely find it.\"","Tian Lin showed a somewhat proud look on his face.","Huang Yueli glanced at the so-called market and couldn't help but twitch the corner of her mouth.","In addition to their amazing talent in cultivation, the devils are really primitive in other aspects.","This market is completely different from the markets in the Twelve Continents of the God Realm.","There isn't even a decent shop. The streets are full of itinerant vendors who tear off a piece of rag and sit on the ground to do business.","Moreover, neither the buyer nor the buyer seems to have a clear standard for the value of the goods. Rather than bargaining, the devil cultivators prefer to use force to speak.","While the three of them were talking at the door, several violent incidents occurred nearby.","A fight breaks out while the business is being discussed. This kind of thing is so common!","\"Two adults, how are you? Are you stunned?\" Tian Lin raised his head and chest.","Huang Yueli laughed dryly: \"Ahem, not bad, not bad. I'm really stunned. Your market is indeed extraordinary... Alright, I don't need you here anymore!\"","\"Ah?\" Tian Lin was startled, \"Two adults, don't you need me to follow you? I can serve you tea and water, so don't drive me away!\"","The strong men of the Devil Clan will most likely kill the weak ones who have offended them and have little use value.","Therefore, when Tian Lin heard Huang Yueli say, \"I don't need you,\" he immediately became nervous.","Huang Yueli reacted and frowned, \"I'm shopping with my man, and I don't like people following me. I just asked you to wait at the door. Do you want to die by making such a fuss?\"","Tian Lin was excited, \"No, no, no, I don't dare. You two adults, please do it.\"","Huang Yueli ignored him and walked into the market with Li Moying.","After entering the market, she discovered that although it looked a little shabby on the outside, the market was still very large and there were many devil cultivators setting up stalls.","Moreover, there are really some good things at the stall.","After all, the devil cultivators knew less about the coalition forces. Some of the treasures they had snatched from the human and divine cultivators they killed, but they didn't know what they were for, so they could only sell them blindly.","Huang Yueli thought to herself that if she collected a batch of things here and took them back to Twelve Continents for resale, she would definitely make a fortune...","\"Little Li'er, we are here to find the Phoenix Relic this time. Moreover, these elixirs are at the earth level at most, and are rare at the heaven level. Those spirit armaments are all ordinary standard spirit armaments. Even if they are all taken back and sold, it will not be enough. It's not as good as your ability to refine a high-quality treasure...\"","Li Moying's deep voice sounded in her ears.","Huang Yueli was startled, then raised her head and saw her husband's exquisite and perfect handsome face, with a meaningful smile hanging on the corner of her mouth.","Huang Yueli's face suddenly turned red and she pursed her lips in displeasure.","\"I didn't say I wanted to take them all back and sell them! Just take a look! I thought there would be bookstores in the market specifically selling Devil Clan books. But now it seems that they definitely don't have bookstores, so they can only sell stalls one by one. Look for it slowly.\"","Li Moying shook his head in amusement, but did not expose his wife.","When he saw this little fox showing a sly smile, how could he not know?","This is Little Li'er's money-obsessed symptom coming back again!"]},{"number":4331,"title":"Chapter 4331 Another Little Phoenix (3)","paragraphs":["4331 Another Little Phoenix (3)","She must be calculating wildly how much these things were worth in her mind now!","Huang Yueli glared at her husband and held his arm, \"Alright, alright, don't we have to do business? Why are you standing here in a daze? You really don't care at all!\"","She casually threw the pot on her husband's head and pulled him inside.","Before entering the devil territory, both of them disguised themselves to cover up their outstanding appearance.","However, this cannot conceal their outstanding temperament at all.","Moreover, in order to frighten the devil cultivators around them, the two of them also deliberately released some evil energy.","The appearance of such a man and woman in the market was quite eye-catching, but no one dared to mess with them.","The two of them walked around the market. Not only did they not see any bookstores, they didn't even see a few books on the Devil Clan. Moreover, without exception, they were very elementary techniques and had no value at all.","\"What's going on? Do the devils have other places to collect classics?\" Li Moying couldn't help but frown.","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and shook her head, \"I think it's more likely that the devils have very few classics, and they are different from the human race. Most of the devils' advancement in cultivation was probably based on instinct. Unlike us humans and gods, we have various classics as guidance from the first day of practice...\"","\"Speaking of which, isn't our trip in vain?\"","They ventured into Vermillion Light Collet mainly because they wanted to see if there were any devil manuals related to the Phoenix Clan.","\"That's not the case. We can find a way to inquire with Tian Lin and others.\"","Li Moying narrowed his eyes, \"It's alright to ask, but we have to think of our words first this time, and don't expose any flaws while talking.\"","\"That's right...\"","While the two were saying this, Huang Yueli's eyes suddenly widened and he turned to stare at a stall not far away.","Seeing that she stopped talking, Li Moying frowned in confusion, \"Little Li'er, what's wrong with you? What are you looking at?\"","He followed Huang Yueli's gaze and looked over.","Discovered that she was also looking at a stall, but this stall was not selling things, but...people!","Many ragged and thin children were forced to stand naked in front of everyone, being picked over and bought and sold like commodities.","This kind of situation was absolutely not allowed to happen in the twelve continents controlled by the gods.","Anyone who dares to buy or sell people will definitely be caught on the spot and thrown into a prison.","However, in the territory of the Devil Clan, this was nothing.","They just walked along and saw several stalls like this.","Li Moying became even more confused, \"Little Li'er, what are you looking at that stall for?\"","Now was not the time to be kind-hearted and save people.","Huang Yueli suddenly tugged on his sleeve, stood on tiptoes, leaned into his ear, and whispered: \"Husband, have you seen that little girl over there? Little Wang Cai just said that he was with this little girl I feel the same kind of breath on my body.\"","\"What?!\" Li Moying was also surprised.","The same kind as Little Wang Cai, then... isn't it also a phoenix?","Only then did he notice that in the middle of the stall, the little girl who was being promoted as a rare commodity by the stall owner was indeed something unusual.","Her skin was white and soft, and her facial features are beautiful. Even if she was covered in dust, you can tell that she was not an ordinary child.","In stark contrast to the dull-looking devil children around her."]},{"number":4332,"title":"Chapter 4332 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (1)","paragraphs":["4332 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (1)","Such a little girl was naturally very conspicuous among a group of dirty children.","There were many people gathered around the booth, and most of them were there for the little girl.","Of course, the stall owner also knew the value of this little girl, so he specially built a high platform, placed her on it, and shouted for sale.","\"Don't miss it if you pass by! Such a beautiful little girl was rare! Moreover, the profound energy in her body was strong. If you buy it home, whether you use it as a maid or to make elixirs, she will be first-class! Or Let her serve you on the bed, the feeling... tsk tsk...\"","Hearing this, the surrounding devil cultivators all showed salivating expressions.","\"Indeed, it looks delicious...\"","\"Such top-quality goods are really rare.\"","\"After collecting the tonic, you can use it to refine elixirs. It can be said that you kill two birds with one stone...\"","These people pointed and smiled obscenely at the little girl. Some even reached out and pinched her.","The little girl was so frightened that she almost cried, her eyes full of fear.","However, he couldn't make any sound. It was probably because the muscles and veins were restrained by special techniques and the sound was blocked.","Hearing these dirty words, Huang Yueli frowned and felt like vomiting.","This little girl looks only five or six years old! It feels smaller than their little Phoenix!","Although the true age of the Phoenix Clan may be hundreds of years old, they are still in their infancy, they are still little girls!","These devil cultivators are so cruel and crazy that they can attack such a little girl.","What's even more irritating was that with so many people around, no one thinks there's anything wrong with doing this, but they are all eager to try it.","\"However, the aura in this little girl's body was so pure, she was definitely not from our race, and she doesn't feel like the human race... What was the origin of this?\"","Someone noticed the suspicion and asked.","The stall owner was waiting for this question and immediately burst into laughter.","\"Good question! Compared with her appearance and aura, her origin was more mysterious. Everyone, please listen carefully. The cultivators who sold her to me are two strong men in the late stage of Earth devil, and their strength was quite outstanding. They came before Let's make an appointment to go to the outskirts of Celestial Ecliptic Forest to practice.\"","\"Everyone knows that there was no danger outside the Celestial Ecliptic Forest. If you are lucky, you can catch a few spiritual beast cubs or lone monsters to sell for money. But for some reason, they encountered something strange this time and entered Celestial Ecliptic Forest. After Lin, they didn't encounter any spiritual beasts. Instead, they seemed to have walked into a maze and couldn't get out. In the end, all the food they brought was exhausted, and they almost thought they were going to starve to death in there.\"","\"One night, an explosion suddenly occurred in the Celestial Ecliptic Forest. The fire shot into the sky deep in the dense forest. It was said that it lit up the entire sky. The two cultivators were also stunned by the huge impact. Waiting for their second When I woke up, I found that Celestial Ecliptic Forest had returned to normal and I could walk out.\"","\"However, on the way out, they picked up this little girl...\"","The devil cultivators present were so mesmerised by what they heard that they couldn't come back to their senses for a long time.","The stall owner finally said: \"So, do you understand? The origin of this little girl must be quite extraordinary! There were rumours in the early years that there were many ancient beasts living in the Celestial Ecliptic Forest in ancient times. Maybe, she too...\""]},{"number":4333,"title":"Chapter 4333 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (2)","paragraphs":["4333 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (2)","\"Tch, you dare to say such big words without cutting your tongue!\"","\"That's it, do you want to imply that this little girl is the human form of an ancient mythical beast? If that's the case, would you still sell it? Do you think we are all fools?\"","\"I think this little girl should have a relatively high bloodline among the Devil Clan.\"","Not all devil cultivators were fools, and many people immediately sneered at him.","The stall owner also realized that he had exaggerated a bit, and he lowered his head, \"Ahem, this was all told to me by the cultivator who sold this little girl to me, not me. It's up to you to believe it or not! However, She has a lot of profound energy in her body, and her skin is tender and tender, so eating it will definitely be a great supplement! If you buy it back, you will definitely not lose money!\"","\"Now you can bid, the base price is 10,000 gold soul coins!\"","As soon as this statement came out, another wave of protests arose.","\"What?! Ten thousand gold soul coins! Are you trying to steal money? A little girl like this, with inferior quality, can be bought for a hundred silver soul coins! Even if she has a higher bloodline, she is only worth one gold soul coin. You just doubled the soul coin ten thousand times?!\"","\"That's right, no matter how delicious this little girl is, she can only finish it in one meal. How can she still be worth so much money?\"","\"Bah, what a profiteer, shameless! Do you really think this is the cub of an ancient mythical beast?\"","Hearing these words, the stall owner was obviously unhappy, \"You poor guys, if you can't afford it, just get out of here! There are plenty of people who want to buy it!\"","In fact, the stall owner's judgement was not wrong.","No one would believe that the little girl was the descendant of the ancient beast, but judging from the strong life breath in her body, the more knowledgeable demon cultivators all believed that she was a child of the royal family of the Devil Clan.","The demon tribe lives on the other side of the Celestial Ecliptic Forest Forest. Occasionally, there are lost children who are caught by demon cultivators.","These children are hot commodities in short supply in the demon market.","Because the children of the Devil Clan who become slaves are basically of low bloodline and poor talent. If you buy such a child back, whether it is used to make elixirs or collect tonics, the effect will not be very good.","Moreover, the appearance of a demon is directly proportional to its strength.","The strong men in the Sky Devil Realm are all very handsome, and are almost the same as the talented cultivators of the God Clan. However, many of the lower-level Devil Clan soldiers are too ugly to look at, not to mention the slaves with worse bloodlines.","But the Devil Clan is different.","The demons are naturally handsome, and their appearance is more delicate and exquisite than the humans and gods. Even the men are more beautiful than most of the women of the human race. In addition, the demons are not a large group, so almost everyone has pure blood, which makes them He became the perfect slave in the eyes of the demons.","And the demon royal family is the most popular item among the most popular items.","Some demons who know the goods hesitated a little and started bidding as soon as they heard the lowest price quoted by the stall owner.","\"Eleven thousand gold soul coins!\"","\"Twelve thousand gold soul coins!\"","\"Thirteen thousand...\"","The bids rose very quickly, and soon it exceeded 20,000 gold soul coins.","Such a price made those poor cultivators who complained that it was too expensive just now change their expressions.","The stall owner was so happy that he kept encouraging everyone to increase prices.","\"Twenty thousand gold soul coins! This gentleman has already paid 20,000 gold soul coins! Is there anything higher?\"","Twenty thousand gold soul coins are already considered a huge sum of money for cultivators in the early stage of Sky Devil. There are only a handful of cultivators who can afford it."]},{"number":4334,"title":"Chapter 4334 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (3)","paragraphs":["Therefore, despite the stall owner yelling for a long time, this little girl was indeed a rare commodity, but there was no one who could continue to increase the price.","The stall owner secretly screamed bad luck!","I felt that it was not very wise for me to set up a stall today. There were not many rich people in the market, so I couldn't ask for high prices.","\"If no one continues to increase prices...\"","The stall owner rolled his eyes and spoke, not to make a decision, but to regret.","In the devil market, there are quite a few cases where people make bids and then regret not selling. After all, most devils don't know what integrity is.","However, this was also quite rude behavior.","If the buyer was very powerful and turns against him on the spot, the seller will be in bad luck.","The stall owner hesitated, secretly assessing the strength of the devil with the highest bid.","At this moment, a slightly hoarse female voice sounded, \"This little girl... I want it!\"","The sound was not very loud, but in such a noisy environment, it still sounded extremely clear and reached the ears of every onlooker present.","Everyone was shocked!","Because, along with this voice, there was also an invisible pressure, the aura of the strong!","The stall owner was also very surprised and looked towards the back of the crowd.","Two figures in black cloaks walked over slowly, their raised collars covering half of their faces, making them look particularly mysterious.","These two people were Huang Yueli and Li Moying who had been watching the show for a long time.","Finance Minister Xiaowang was so old. It was the first time he saw someone of his own race. He was extremely excited. He was also afraid that the little girl would be abused in any way, so he was very excited. He chirped in the Sky Phoenix Ring for a long time, urging his master to come and rescue him.","Huang Yueli originally wanted to observe for a while, but she was so annoyed by Little Wang Cai that she could only walk out.","When the stall owner saw the two people, he was first shocked by their aura. After a while, he calmed down.","\"My lords, the slaves I have here are all bought by the highest bidder. Now, the price has reached 20,000 gold soul coins. I wonder what price you two are prepared to pay?\"","There was greed in the stall owner's eyes.","The two people in front of me look quite mysterious, maybe they are big sponsors!","Huang Yueli didn't even look at the stall owner, her eyes fell on the little girl.","Seeing her shivering, I couldn't help but feel a little distressed.","Alas, such a cute little girl, much cuter than their Little Wang Cai, was tortured like this.","She calmly withdrew her gaze and said, \"As I said just now, I want this little girl! Send her over to me quickly!\"","The stall owner was stunned for a moment, and then his expression changed.","\"What do you mean? Are you still planning to steal someone from me without making a bid?\"","Huang Yueli raised her chin slightly, with a look of disdain on her face, \"It's an honor for you that I am willing to take the slaves in your stall! You still want to collect money? You are really ignorant!\"","She perfectly interprets the image of an arrogant and domineering powerful devil.","Just now, after the stall owner offered the lowest price, Huang Yueli realized that he had overlooked a very important issue.","That is, they were now on the territory of the Devil Clan!","Therefore, the top-grade jade quartz in her hand cannot be used anymore.","There are also the spiritual weapons and elixirs she refined. Even if they were taken out, most of the devil cultivators would not know what they were selling, so they would not be worth a big price."]},{"number":4335,"title":"Chapter 4335 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (4)","paragraphs":["Therefore, she can be said to be penniless now, without even a gold soul coin. What can she use to buy a little girl?","However, Huang Yueli only struggled for a short while before she came to her senses.","Since you can't afford to bid, just don't bid!","Anyway, this was the territory of the Devil Clan. Here, as long as you are strong enough, robbery was not a big deal.","Hearing such arrogant words, the stall owner couldn't recover for a moment.","When he reacted, he immediately became furious, \"You...who are you? How dare you talk to me like this, and how dare you rob me at my stall? Let me tell you, I belong to the lord! The business of this stall was subject to Protected by the Lord's Mansion! You are so brave that you dare to cause trouble here!\"","The devil cultivators who were watching obviously knew this, and they all looked at Huang Yueli and Li Moying as if they were fools.","\"Where do these two people come from? They look strange, they must have been brought by others, right? No wonder they don't know anything!\"","\"Haha, it seems that the strength was very strong, but no matter how strong it is, it was impossible to be as good as our lord, and he actually dares to rob people!\"","\"You are so stupid. If you offend the Lord's Mansion, they are dead!\"","Hearing what the stall owner said, Huang Yueli was really surprised.","In fact, she had already guessed that slaves could be sold in such a chaotic market. Moreover, there were top-notch slaves like the little girl on the stall, but no one came up to rob them. Instead, they bid politely one by one. It has been stated that there must be a very powerful backer behind the stall owner.","However, she never expected that the stall owner's backer was the Lord of Vermillion Light Collet!","Regarding this Lord, she had already heard Tian Lin mention it on the way to the market.","The Lord's name was Ruijiang, and he was from the same family as the Sky Devil Ruize whom Li Moying killed. However, his strength was even stronger than Ruize's, and he was already a strong man in the late Sky Devil stage!","Among the Devil Clan, he was also considered one of the top masters.","From a purely cultivation point of view, generally speaking, he was not far different from Huang Likai and others.","However, the combat effectiveness of the devils was generally higher than that of the cultivators of the gods, so their strength may be similar to that of Huang Tianhao, the leader of a large force.","Such strength... was actually much higher than that of Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","After all, although both of them are now at the peak of the Heart Profound Realm, they still have not broken through to the Dao Profound Realm.","Seeing Huang Yueli's hesitant look, the stall owner thought she was scared and immediately sneered.","\"What? Are you afraid now? Let me tell you, it's too late! If you still want to survive, leave 10,000 gold soul coins and kneel down to apologize to me! Otherwise, just wait for the lord to deal with you!\"","The stall owner looked confident and laughed proudly.","He has become accustomed to such scenes.","In this market, he was the boss that no one dares to mess with. Anyone who wants to cause trouble at his stall will eventually have to kneel down and beg for mercy from him because they are afraid of the power of the Lord's Mansion.","In the territory of the Devil Clan, it was like this. People without strength do not even have basic dignity.","The surrounding devils also followed suit.","\"That's right, kneel down quickly and kowtow to Master Li! This might save your lives!\"","\"If you don't kneel down quickly, you will know how powerful I am when we enter the dungeon of the Lord's Mansion later!\""]},{"number":4336,"title":"Chapter 4336 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (5)","paragraphs":["\"The Lord is one of the most famous strong men in our southeast region. You are so brave, daring to cause trouble in our Vermillion Light Collet!\"","Amid the many shouts, Huang Yueli and Li Moying remained motionless, showing no intention of kneeling down.","The stall owner waited for a while, but when he saw that they still didn't move, he suddenly became angry.","\"Are you obviously going to go against the Lord? You are really looking for death! Quick, go and report to the Lord!\"","The stall owner waved his hand and a boy ran out.","Huang Yueli's eyes flashed, and a streak of evil energy flew out from her fingertips, accurately hitting the boy's back.","The boy screamed and fell to the ground on the spot.","This move was so fast that all the devil cultivators present were obviously stunned.","Although just from the aura of Huang Yueli and Li Moying, it can be seen that they are quite capable.","However, no one expected that they would attack so quickly, and that they would really dare to attack the Lord!","After Huang Yueli killed the boy casually, she didn't want to continue talking nonsense, so she directly reached out and pulled the little girl in the middle of the stall.","When the stall owner saw this, he rushed over to stop her.","However, how could his strength be compared to Huang Yueli's.","Huang Yueli's hands were like lightning, she grabbed the little girl's waist and picked her up.","\"Damn, damn you bastard, put that little girl down! Where was she? The stall owner shouted eagerly, and several of his thugs rushed towards Huang Yueli.","However, Huang Yueli remained very calm. She hugged the little girl and took a few steps back leisurely.","Seeing the thugs waving their swords, they were about to hit her.","The man who had been silent beside her suddenly snorted coldly.","The cold and low voice seemed to carry unparalleled powerful pressure, instantly spreading through the air.","The thugs suddenly paused in their movements, with painful expressions on their faces.","The next moment, Li Moying suddenly waved his sleeves, and the stall owner and several thugs flew backwards!","There were waves of exclamations from all around.","No one expected that this man and woman would dare to rob someone even though they knew the stall belonged to the Lord!","And the stall owner with good strength was seriously injured by them in the blink of an eye.","The stall owner flew more than ten meters before falling in front of another stall, smashing the cart used to load goods to pieces.","However, the man who set up the stall did not dare to say a word and quickly helped the stall owner up.","The stall owner covered his chest and spit out a mouthful of blood with a \"wow\" sound!","Waves of energy and blood surged through his body, making him want to vomit all the blood. This was a sign that his meridians were seriously damaged!","The stall owner felt an indescribable horror in his heart!","He could tell that when the man in black attacked these people, he didn't take it seriously at all. He just waved his sleeve casually and used at most 10% of his strength, causing them all to be seriously injured!","\"Sir, what...what should we do?\"","One of his thugs struggled to get up, came to him, and asked cautiously.","\"What should I do if you ask me? What's the use of waste like you?\"","The stall owner lost such a big person and ruined his business. He was very angry and needed a punching bag.","Seeing this man coming to the door, he immediately yelled: \"Go to the Lord's Manor quickly to report the news! These two bastards dare to provoke the Lord, they are really tired of living!\""]},{"number":4337,"title":"Chapter 4337 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (6)","paragraphs":["The thug was stunned for a moment after being scolded, and quickly turned around to report the news.","The stall owner looked at Huang Yueli and Li Moying's backs as they left calmly. He still refused to give up and screamed at the top of his lungs.","\"What are you doing? Everyone, go after them! Stop those two guys! What they took away was the Lord's property. If we can't catch them, everyone in the market today will be beaten. Into the dungeon!\"","Upon hearing this, many devil cultivators became frightened and took action one after another, trying to stop Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","However, the skills of the two of them are much higher than those of ordinary devil cultivators.","Using his physical skills, he turned around a few times and passed through the crowd.","Those devil cultivators could not even touch a corner of their clothes.","The two of them ran out of the market holding the little girl in their arms.","Not far ahead, Tian Lin saw the two of them appear, and he got excited and came up to him, \"Two adults, have you finished shopping? Have you bought everything you need...\"","Before he finished speaking, he saw Huang Yueli and Li Moying running past him, as if they hadn't seen him at all.","\"Two adults...\"","Tian Lin wanted to catch up, but before he could take two steps, he was grabbed by the stall owner from behind.","\"Alright, you are actually related to these two bastards who robbed the Lord's finances! You traitor, traitor! Catch me!\"","Several thugs swarmed up and tied up Tian Lin.","Tian Lin didn't realize what happened, and struggled desperately, \"What? Why are you arresting me? I am loyal to the Lord...\"","\"Hmph, you still dare to quibble! Just go to the dungeon and scream slowly!\"","The stall owner directed his thugs to tie him up tightly and drag him down.","Seeing that the two culprits could not be caught, in order to prevent the Lord from tearing him into pieces, he always found someone to blame. Tian Lin happened to bump into his hand, which was unlucky!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying ran a distance and stopped at a remote alley.","\"We'd better not go back to our residence and leave Vermillion Light Collet directly!\" Huang Yueli said quickly.","Li Moying immediately nodded, \"Yes, we originally stayed here to find clues in the ruins. Now that we have this little girl, the problem was solved and there was no need to stay here. Besides, now We must be wanted throughout the territory.\"","\"Yes, we must leave right away! If it's a little later, maybe there will be martial law all around.\"","The stall owner seemed to be an important steward under the Lord and had considerable influence.","Not long after they came out of the market, they saw groups of devil soldiers patrolling nearby, seemingly searching for them.","Although the two of them joining forces may not be able to deal with the so-called Lord, but there was no need to fight in such a place.","There was something serious to do now, so it's better to take the little girl and leave quickly.","The two had similar minds, and after a brief discussion, they made up their minds.","In order to avoid unnecessary trouble, the two simply took off their cloaks and put on ordinary clothes again.","Although you can't cover your face, this was much safer than wearing a conspicuous black cloak.","Huang Yueli also changed her appearance again.","Then, they pretended to be a normal couple and walked out of the alley as if nothing had happened.","The stall owner was dozens of metres in front of them and did not recognize either of them."]},{"number":4338,"title":"Chapter 4338 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (7)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli secretly breathed a sigh of relief, feeling that the crisis was over.","She walked side by side with her husband, swaggering outside.","Huang Yueli never expected that their disguise was indeed successful, but they missed a very important point.","Just when they reached the intersection, suddenly, the little girl held in Huang Yueli's arms saw the stall owner. A look of fear immediately flashed in her eyes, and at the same time, she screamed involuntarily like a frightened bird.","Huang Yueli secretly screamed something bad and quickened her pace, wanting to leave this high-risk area quickly.","However, the stall owner and the surrounding guards had noticed the little girl's shrill cries.","The stall owner's expression changed and he shouted sternly: \"Those two in front are not allowed to leave. Stop! Are you here with children?!\"","Huang Yueli knew that they couldn't withstand the search at all, and if they were stopped, they would definitely join the gang immediately.","Therefore, she made a decisive decision. Not only did she not listen to the stall owner's order to stop, but she tiptoed and flew out!","Li Moying also followed her footsteps immediately.","Two strong figures flew out!","No matter how stupid the stall owner was, he realized it now and stamped his feet in anger.","\"Damn it, it's those two guys, even I was deceived by them just now! Damn it, hurry up and chase me!!\"","Under his order, all the guards chased in the same direction.","However, how could they catch up with the speed of Huang Yueli and Li Moying?","The two of them used their physical skills and quickly ran out of the sight of the guards, running all the way to the outskirts of the territory.","Running to the edge of the territory, the two of them couldn't help but slow down.","Running to the edge of the territory, the two of them couldn't help but slow down.","Because, a large number of devil guards have gathered nearby.","Apparently, after the stall owner determined the direction in which they were escaping, he sent a message through fireworks, causing the nearby devil guards to gather in this direction.","Huang Yueli paused and looked back at Li Moying.","She didn't speak, just gestured with her eyes.","Li Moying immediately understood her intention and nodded slightly to her.","The two stood up at the same time, released the evil energy in their bodies, and attacked the devil guards fiercely!","This time, their goal is to escape quickly, lest time drag on for too long and more and more guards gather nearby.","Therefore, the two of them did not hold back at all, and the overwhelming black mist bombarded the crowd.","The devil cultivator who stood closer to the front was immediately hit, vomiting blood and fell to the ground. The cultivator behind was also pushed back by the impact, unable to stand firm at all.","The leading devil captain's expression suddenly changed as he tried to stabilize his men.","\"Everyone, calm down, stay calm! No one is allowed to retreat! These two people are what the lord wants to arrest. If we let them go, we will all be in bad luck. We must stop them! No one is allowed to retreat! Everyone...\"","Before he could finish his words, he was stabbed in the chest by a flying knife thrown by Huang Yueli.","Suddenly he covered his chest with his hands and fell backward.","Although Huang Yueli and Li Moying acted decisively, they rarely used evil energy, and they were still not as smooth as they used ordinary profound energy.","Therefore, it took a lot of effort to knock down all the devil cultivators present.","When they were about to escape, there was another roar from behind.","\"Stop! You two little thieves actually dare to steal my lord's things! I'm so tired of living!!\""]},{"number":4339,"title":"Chapter 4339 I Just Want to Rob You, So What? (8)","paragraphs":["This roar, reverberated like thunder, rolled in and resounded through the sky.","Just from this movement, one can tell that the person coming was a very powerful devil master.","Huang Yueli knew that it was too late to run away now, so she simply stopped.","She frowned, \"Lord Ruijiang of Vermillion Light Collet?\"","Ruijiang was a tall devil cultivator, at least two meters tall, with a formidable aura. He was worthy of being a powerful man who can serve as a Lord.","He glanced at Huang Yueli and Li Moying, and said angrily: \"Who are the two of you? Who brought the masters? The two of them are really good, but they dare to steal things from my Vermillion Light Collet. Isn't it too arrogant?\"","As he spoke, he released the devil qi in his body.","This made Huang Yueli feel a little threatened.","However, her expression did not change at all, and she still looked cold, \"There was no such thing as arrogance or arrogance. In our Devil Clan, those who have strength can get everything they want. Isn't this a natural thing?\"","After hearing this, Ruijiang's face became even uglier, \"Do you really think that this Lord was afraid of you? I'm simply looking for death!\"","At this time, the stall owner also hurried over with his people.","Upon hearing this, he hurriedly shouted: \"Lord, these two people are too arrogant! I have already reported your name just now, and they actually dare to rob you openly. It was clear that they do not take you seriously!\" \"","After hearing these embellished words, Ruijiang could no longer suppress the anger in his heart, and the devil qi in his body suddenly exploded!","\"Looking for death! Two juniors who are in the Sky Devil early-phase dare to be arrogant in front of me!\"","It bombarded the two of them.","Huang Yueli had been on guard for a long time, and Li Moying had also been concentrating on guarding.","The two of them took action at the same time, and the two evil spirits gathered together to meet Ruijiang's attack head-on!","A violent explosion sounded.","The ground shook suddenly!","The stall owners and guards were immediately unable to stand still and fell to the ground one by one. The surrounding tents were even blown away!","Thick black smoke spread from the center of the explosion, covering a large area nearby.","The stall owner fell to the ground, which was involved in the wound that Huang Yueli had previously punched, and his body felt a pain.","However, his spirit was quite high, and he stared at the black mist without blinking, \"Those two bastards must be miserable now, they might be slapped into pieces by the Lord! They really deserve it!\" How dare you snatch something from my hands? The more miserable your death, the worse...\"","Suddenly, his eyes widened and he stared in the direction of the black mist in disbelief.","Like lightning, two figures emerged from the black mist, and then rushed out due east.","Shockingly, they are Huang Yueli and Li Moying!","Moreover, judging from their elegant and graceful movements, it was clear that the two of them were not injured, and there was no hesitation in their movements at all.","The stall owner shook his head desperately, \"No, this was impossible! This was impossible! The Lord took action, how could the two of them not be injured?! They should have been beaten to death on the spot! Could it be that...\"","At this moment, the black fog gradually dissipated, revealing a miserable figure in the open space in the middle.","Sky Devil Ruijiang faced down and fell to the ground in a prostrate posture. His body was twisted in a weird posture, and it was obvious that he had multiple fractures.","And underneath his body, there was still blood flowing out."]},{"number":4340,"title":"Chapter 4340 A Cute And Lovely Little Lady (1)","paragraphs":["The stall owner and the surrounding guards didn't react for a while.","Because they cannot accept this fact.","In their eyes, Sky Devil Ruijiang was the number one master of the Vermillion Light Collet, and he was even invincible in several nearby territories.","No one expected that Ruijiang would be defeated by a young couple.","Moreover, in just one face-to-face encounter, he had already suffered such a big loss!","After a while, everyone realized what was going on and hurried over to help Ruijiang up.","Ruijiang finally regained his composure, and when he realized that he had lost such a big person, he became extremely angry.","\"You two... better not appear in front of me again, otherwise, I will definitely make you regret being born in this world!\"","His roar spread far away, and Huang Yueli also heard it.","However, she didn't take this seriously at all.","In fact, the reason why she and Li Moying were able to defeat Ruijiang today was mostly due to luck.","There was still a slight gap between the strength of the two of them and the Sky Devil late-phase powerhouses like Ruijiang.","However, since they started dual cultivation, they have joined forces and doubled their strength. Ruijiang obviously did not expect this. In addition, he relied on his identity and underestimated the enemy, so he fell into the trap of the two of them.","\"It's unlucky for you. I know you are not willing to lose. But, my husband and I are not stupid. We will not go to your territory in the future. You can just be angry there alone.\"","Huang Yueli calculated with a smile.","After the two people left Vermillion Light Collet, they entered Celestial Ecliptic Forest.","This woodland was where the stall owner said the two devil cultivators picked up the little girl.","Entering Celestial Ecliptic Forest, the little girl became obviously excited, and even her breathing rhythm changed.","Huang Yueli used her spiritual sense to explore the surrounding situation, and after confirming that there was no one else, she put the little girl down.","At this time, the little girl's face was pale, her lips were purple, and she looked like she was about to faint at any time.","When Little Wang Cai saw this, he jumped anxiously in the Sky Phoenix Ring.","\"Female Devil, you, you, you... actually abused a lovely little lady like this! You are simply too much, too cruel!\"","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth in anger, \"Shut up! Where did I abuse her? She was clearly abusing me, alright? She screamed suddenly just now and almost killed us all! Now she fainted, mainly because of It's scary, and we had a fight with Ruijiang just now, so much devil qi exploded around her, she must have been affected.\"","Huang Yueli said, laying the little girl flat on the ground, then squatting down, pinching her slender wrist, and taking a pulse.","She took out a bottle of pills, poured one out, and stuffed it into the little girl's mouth.","\"There should be no problem. Take a good rest and resolve the remaining devil qi in your body, and you should wake up.\"","Her judgment was very accurate. After the little girl lay there for about half an hour, her pale complexion improved significantly, and there was still a trace of blood on her face.","At the same time, his eyelashes trembled slightly and he woke up.","Huang Yueli, who was sitting cross-legged and practicing on the edge, opened her eyes and said, \"Little girl, are you feeling better now?\"","The little girl was obviously frightened, her body was shaking, but she didn't dare to speak.","Upon seeing this, Huang Yueli did not rush her, but took out a glass of spiritual spring water from the space and handed it to the little girl.","Comment","1","View All","Post your first comment!","10","Vote","Send Gift","Translation quailty rate","Ch.4340","?? Good","?? Average","?? Terrible"]},{"number":4341,"title":"Chapter 4341 A Cute And Lovely Little Lady (2)","paragraphs":["The little girl shook her head and refused to drink. She even reached out and pushed hard to knock over the quilt.","Obviously, she must have suffered a loss before and knew not to drink water given by strangers.","Huang Yueli had no choice but to forcefully hold her down and feed her a glass of spiritual spring water.","The little girl was forced to drink the water. She immediately showed a look of horror and fell to the ground in despair.","Huang Yueli was speechless for a while, \"Okay, little girl, you don't have to be like this, I'm really not a bad person! I rescued you because I wanted to ask you a few questions, and I will never hurt you.\"","As she spoke, she touched her face.","In the past, it was still easy for her to be liked by children? Why can't I coax the little girl today?","Is it because she is too ugly in disguise?","After hearing this, the little girl still didn't speak, and stared at her fiercely with her big round eyes, obviously thinking that she was a big liar who abducted children.","Huang Yueli had no choice but to look around, then raised her hand and released Little Wang Cai from the space.","She originally thought that Little Wang Cai was so excited in Tianhuang Jue, and now that he was released, he would definitely pounce on the little girl as soon as possible.","But who would have expected that after the young lady landed, she didn't go over immediately. Instead, she straightened the soft hair on her head and pulled up her robe.","Then, he slowly walked over, showed a gentle and friendly smile, on her head and pulled up her robe.","Then, he slowly walked over, showed a gentle and friendly smile, and said softly: \"Hello, beautiful lady, nice to meet you.\"","The little girl was obviously stunned for a moment. She didn't expect that a little boy about her age would suddenly appear in front of her.","Moreover, this little boy seems to have a familiar aura...","Little Wang Cai stretched out his hand towards the little girl and said politely: \"It's too cold to sit on the ground. Let me pull you up.\"","Huang Yueli was watching from the side, her eyes almost popping out of her head!","What's going on?","When did their little kid become so well-behaved and polite? !","She must have seen a fake little phoenix.","The little girl felt a little relieved when she saw Little Wang Cai, and stretched out her hand to put it on Little Wang Cai's hand.","Little Wang Cai pulled her to sit under the shade of a tree, and the little girl came back to her senses.","\"You...you...you...could it be...\"","The little girl opened her mouth and stammered.","Little Wang Cai understood and nodded, \"Yes, you read that right, I am a phoenix, but a spiritual body. By the way, young lady, you are a Phoenix as well, right?\"","The little girl was a little nervous when he saw through her at a glance, but when she thought about it, he was the same kind as her, so she became less wary.","She nodded and said: \"Yes, me too, you...how did you end up with these two...well, were you kidnapped by them? What did they do to you?!\"","When Huang Yueli heard this, the corner of her mouth twitched.","It seems that in the little girl's mind, she and Li Moying are definitely the bad guys!","But it seems like the two of them didn't do anything bad, right?","Little Wang Cai understood very well, \"Oh, I know that these two are not good people at first glance! Yes, they are the Female Devil and the Big Devil!\"","Huang Yueli secretly clenched her fists, ready to catch Little Wang Cai and beat him up.","Little Wang Cai seemed to be aware of the danger, trembled, and quickly changed his words, \"Ahem, but that's for the enemy, they are still good to me...\""]},{"number":4342,"title":"Chapter 4342 A Cute And Lovely Little Lady (3)","paragraphs":["\"Really?\" The little girl still looked worried, \"But you have turned into a spirit body now! Although we, the Phoenix Clan, have the opportunity to be reborn from nirvana, if we don't encounter a situation of near death, we may not be able to survive and become a spirit body...\"","Little Wang Cai hurriedly explained: \"That's another matter. It has nothing to do with my female devil! Speaking of which, she saved me! In short, they are not bad people!\"","Hearing what he said, the little girl felt relieved.","Huang Yueli took advantage of the situation and walked over, squatted down in front of her, and tried her best to show an amiable smile.","\"Well, little girl, you really don't have to worry. I already have a small fortune, and I can't force a contract with you anymore.\"","She just stood aside and thought for a while, and finally realized that something was wrong.","She considers herself not too mean-looking, and her attitude towards little girls was pretty good.","I never bullied her from beginning to end.","However, the little girl's first reaction was that she was a bad person and wanted to harm people...","There was only one explanation. The little girl must have met someone who forcibly established a contract with her before, so she was very repulsive to all humans or devils.","The little girl still looked nervous, but with Little Wang Cai by her side, she gradually relaxed.","Little Wang Cai was even more excited.","Since he woke up in the Sky Phoenix Ring, this was the first time he has met the same race!","Moreover, they are little girls of the same race who are similar in age, and they look so cute and well-behaved.","On weekdays, he only has one playmate: Little Qilin, and Li Moying's Little Qilin was a scheming lolita. Little Wang Cai can't beat her most of the time, and the two are simply not at odds with each other.","Well now, he finally met the little girl of his dreams!","Suddenly, he kept circling around the house in a very dog-like manner.","Huang Yueli was secretly amused, but she did not bother the two little ones.","She and Li Moying wandered around the area. Then, seeing the sky getting dark, they returned to the original place and lit a fire.","Huang Yueli took out the reserved chicken, beef and vegetables from the space, brushed the sauce on them, and grilled them on the fire.","Her ability to control flames was one of the best in the entire God Realm, so she was naturally very good at making barbecues.","Soon, the aroma of barbecue began to waft out and fill the air.","In order to prevent the surrounding beasts from approaching, Huang Yueli arranged a formation in advance to prevent the scent from spreading too far, but to control it within the formation.","In this way, the fragrance was more concentrated and the smell was even more exciting.","The little girl had never tasted such delicious barbecue, and she was immediately attracted. She kept turning her head to look at Huang Yueli, and even secretly swallowed her saliva.","Huang Yueli smiled but did not expose her.","After the barbecue was all cooked, she invited the two little ones to come over and eat.","Little Wang Cai couldn't wait any longer, so he rushed over and picked out the best chicken legs and wings.","However, he didn't eat it himself, but handed it to the little girl, \"Miss, you eat this roasted chicken leg! My Female Devil's craftsmanship was pretty good, and the roast was delicious. This was my favorite!!\"","Huang Yueli pulled Li Moying's sleeve next to her, \"Wow, husband, it's so strange! Wang Cai actually gave his beloved chicken legs to someone else! Has the sun come out from the west?\""]},{"number":4343,"title":"Chapter 4343 A Cute And Lovely Little Lady (4)","paragraphs":["Li Moying tilted his head slightly and glanced at her.","Then, just like Little Wang Cai, he took a chicken leg from the barbecue rack, sprinkled some salt and pepper on it, and then personally delivered it to Huang Yueli.","\"Don't be so surprised, there is your share.\"","Huang Yueli blinked, leaned over, took the chicken leg from husband's hand and enjoyed the chicken leg that was 'made with love'.","At the same time, a satisfied smile appeared on her face, \"Husband, you are so considerate.\"","Li Moying raised an eyebrow, \"When a man meets the person he likes, he will become considerate.\"","When Little Wang Cai heard the conversation between the two masters, his chubby little face suddenly turned red, and his ears were also red.","However, he pretended not to hear anything and lowered his head to act like an ostrich.","When the little girl saw this, she was a little worried, \"You...what's wrong with you? Why is your face so red? You're not sick, are you?\"","Little Wang Cai shook his head hurriedly, \"No, I'm fine, I just ate too much...\"","\"Really? Are you really alright? That's good!\" The little girl looked at Little Wang Cai's face carefully and suddenly remembered something, \"By the way, what's your name? I don't know what to call you. you?\"","Little Wang Cai had deliberately not mentioned his name. As a result, the little girl sensed something was wrong and took the initiative to ask questions.","His eyes widened and he held it in for a long time before he managed to speak: \"Just call me...\"","\"Wang Cai! His name was Wang Cai!\"","Huang Yueli held her chin aside and answered with a smile.","Little Wang Cai's face suddenly fell, \"Female... female devil!! If you don't speak, no one will think you are mute!\"","\"Tsk, tsk, was this your attitude when talking to your master? Besides, I'm telling the truth! Isn't your name Wang Cai?\"","\"Of course... of course not! This was obviously a name you gave me blindly. I had a name when I was in the Phoenix Clan!\"","Huang Yueli asked curiously: \"Then what was your previous name?\"","\"My name is...\"","Little Wang Cai opened his mouth, but suddenly choked.","He couldn't even remember his name!","However, this did not just happen recently. Ever since he was sealed into the Sky Phoenix Ring and became an Artifact Spirit, many of his memories have been blurred. Otherwise, he would not have been able to remember the way back to the Phoenix Clan's ruins. .","Huang Yueli said slowly: \"Look, you don't know what your name is, so you might as well call yourself Wang Cai!\"","\"I don't want it, I'm not a dog!\" Little Phoenix protested strongly!","Huang Yueli jumped over him and looked at the little girl.","After the little girl ate her roasted chicken legs, she was no longer afraid of her. At this time, she timidly replied: \"My...my name is Xiangxiang.\"","\"Xiangxiang, what a cute name!\" Huang Yueli said with a smile: \"Xiangxiang, how old are you this year?\"","\"Two...two hundred and eighteen years old.\"","The phoenix clan only passes through its infancy when it was three hundred years old, so Xiangxiang was a real phoenix cub.","Roughly equivalent to the age of four or five years old in the human race.","Huang Yueli turned her head and glared at Little Wang Cai, \"I said, Wang Cai, aren't you a bit thick-skinned? Xiangxiang was only over 200 years old, how old are you? You actually call her young lady? !\"","Little Wang Cai was so angry that he jumped up and down, \"I...I am also in my early childhood! I am also over two hundred years old!\"","\"Really? But I clearly remember that you entered the Sky Phoenix Ring tens of thousands of years ago. You are so old that you are still pretending to be young and deceiving a little girl?\""]},{"number":4344,"title":"Chapter 4344: A Cute And Lovely Little Lady (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, Little Wang Cai’s expression visibly froze.","He subconsciously glanced at Xiangxiang beside him.","Xiangxiang’s face was full of shock.","The lifespan of ancient divine beasts was very long, far beyond that of cultivators, and even the powerful ones in the Ming Xuan Realm are completely unable to compare with them.","But even so, ten thousand years old was already an adult for Phoenix.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Tens of thousands of years old, he was already an old man.","Those who are less lucky have already lost their pigtails.","Xiangxiang was young, still in her infancy. To her, a Phoenix that was over a thousand years old was already very old, let alone one that was tens of thousands of years old.","Xiangxiang, who was originally sitting next to Little Wang Cai, chatting and laughing with him, suddenly distanced herself from him. Little Butt moved to the side and kept a certain distance from him.","When Little Wang Cai saw this, he was so angry!","The female devil was so evil, she actually tricked him again and beat him up!","This was his first love!","Yes, in the short period of time just now, he felt that he had fallen in love at first sight with the lovely Xiangxiang.","Seeing Little Wang Caisheng’s helpless expression, Huang Yueli felt funny for a while.","Little Wang Cai was about to express his extremely angry emotions when Xiangxiang suddenly spoke. “Brother Wang Cai...no, grandpa...”","“Grandpa...poof hahahaha! ! ”","Huang Yueli was listening on the side and almost fell down laughing!","Xiangxiang was really so cute!","Completely different from this stinky little bird in their family!","Little Wang Cai’s face turned red. For a moment, it was not a matter of agreeing, nor was it a matter of not agreeing.","If he agrees, won’t he become Xiangxiang’s grandfather?","But, if you don’t agree, what if Xiangxiang misunderstands? What should I do if I think he hates her?","Little Wang Cai, who was only tens of thousands...and 200 years old, soon had the troubles common to DeoDle in love.","“Alright, Little Li’er, stop teasing them.” Li Moying walked over in a funny way and hugged her, “If you keep teasing me, when can we enter the Phoenix","Ruins?”","His little fox was getting skinnier and skinnier.","Upon hearing the words “Phoenix Ruins” , Xiangxiang immediately became alert, her big eyes widened, and she looked at them warily.","“You’re going to the Phoenix Ruins? Who are you? That’s why you saved me!” Xiangxiang’s whole little body was stiff, as if she was facing a formidable enemy.","She just ate chicken legs and let down her guard. Now, she suddenly returned to her previous state.","Huang Yueli frowned.","Little Wang Cai didn’t care about getting angry with Huang Yueli anymore, and hurriedly walked over and took Xiangxiang’s hand.","“Xiangxiang, don’t be afraid, we are really not bad people!”","Xiangxiang obviously still didn’t believe it, and even shook her hands twice, trying to shake Little Wang Cai away.","“Go away! You must have deliberately lied to me! I will never tell you where the","Phoenix ruins are, and there was no point in killing me! I know that your God Clan was the worst, especially the people from the Sacred Phoenix Clan. They want to come to our clan to capture the phoenix! I will never let you succeed!”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli and Li Moying looked at each other, both looking very surprised.","They didn’t expect to hear such words from Xiangxiang’s mouth.","Huang Yueli frowned, “It’s strange.. Aren’t we, the ancient gods, supposed to have a good relationship with the beast clan? Why are the Phoenix Clan so repulsive to the people of the Sacred Phoenix Clan? What happened?”"]},{"number":4345,"title":"Chapter 4345: A Cute And Lovely Little Lady (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s eyes also flashed with surprise.","“It seems that there are really more secrets in the divine world than we imagined. In this way, the divine beast clan was not gradually extinct at all, but was hiding in some hidden places, or to avoid the ancient gods. Behind this , something must have happened.”","Although Xiangxiang was very wary, she was still too young after all and didn’t know the correct posture to guard against bad guys.","The screams of protest just now were actually self-inflicted and revealed too much information.","Li Moying thought briefly and analyzed a lot of useful information.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Huang Yueli nodded, “It seems that things are not as simple as we first thought. We must proceed with caution.”","Xiangxiang was very distrustful of the two gods.","But fortunately, they still have a small fortune.","Little Wang Cai firmly grabbed Xiangxiang’s hand and refused to let go, saying loudly: “We are really not bad people! My female devil was going to the Phoenix ruins not to capture the Phoenix, they are actually doing it for me!” His words successfully attracted Xiangxiang’s attention.","Xiangxiang didn’t speak, but her eyes turned to him, waiting for him to continue.","So, Little Wang Cai gave a rough summary of his situation.","“As you can see, I am now in a spiritual state. However, I used to have a physical body. I remember when I was a child, one time, the Phoenix Clan had a battle with someone unknown, and my brother took me to escape. . However, before we could run too far, we were overtaken. I was killed directly and my body was destroyed. At that time, my brother preserved my spirit body in time and wanted to bring me back to the clan and be reborn in Nirvana. .”","“But what he didn’t expect was that when he was fleeing with my spirit body, he encountered several attacks. In one of them, he was also seriously injured, and he still tried his best to protect me. However...”","Little Wang Cai paused for a moment, his eyes filled with sadness.","When Xiangxiang heard such a story, she was immediately moved, with tears in her eyes, and asked desperately.","“What happened next? What happened next? Did your brother escape? Why does your spirit body still exist to this day?”","Although the Phoenix Clan can exist in the form of spiritual bodies, this state was very weak after all, and they are easily harmed by various external factors.","As time goes by, it will become weaker and weaker, and will gradually lose the unique aura of the Phoenix family.","Therefore, generally speaking, the spirit body must be reborn through the Nirvana ceremony within one year.","After more than a year, there was a high probability that it will dissipate.","Judging from Little Wang Cai’s appearance, the spirit body was still very powerful, and importantly, it was also very stable.","It looks like it has just been a few months since it became a spirit body.","But through the conversation just now, she has learned that Little Wang Cai looks like a little kid, but in fact, he was an “old grandfather” who was tens of thousands of years old!","Xiangxiang was young and not knowledgeable enough, so she doesn’t understand how this was done.","Little Wang Cai explained simply: “I don’t know whether my brother managed to escape. After I was caught, I was sealed into a Spirit Armament and became an Artifact Spirit. This Spirit Armament was very powerful and it helped me stabilise my spirit body, so I can exist for such a long time.”","Xiangxiang’s mouth widened after listening to it. She was obviously attracted by these twists and turns of this bizarre story.."]},{"number":4346,"title":"Chapter 4346: Phoenix Tranquility Gorge (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Little Wang Cai finally said: “My female devil was actually quite nice. I have always been in a spiritual state and cannot leave her side for too long, and my cultivation speed was also affected. That’s why she found the map and brought me here because she wanted me to find my clan and perform the ritual of nirvana and rebirth. This is all for my own good!”","Huang Yueli looked at the two of them and sighed secretly.","Her little phoenix was pretty awesome, with a high emotional intelligence. He deserves to be a person who has lived for tens of thousands of years. He was very good at coaxing little girls.","After Xiangxiang heard Little Wang Cai’s story, she was indeed tortured to tears and felt sorry for Little Wang Cai.","Little Wang Cai was very good and even described himself as extremely miserable.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","If he wants to eat a roasted chicken leg, he will be embarrassed by the Female Devil and have to train hard all day under the scorching sun...","Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched.","Speaking of which, Little Wang Cai’s strength was not improving fast enough, and this was indeed her fault.","She never abused Little Wang Cai, but spoiled him rotten!","However, for the sake of the overall situation, Huang Yueli chose not to expose Little Wang Cai.","After listening to Little Wang Cai’s narration, Xiangxiang fell into hesitation. She stood alone in the corner pointing her fingers for a long time, hesitating. Huang Yueli and the others did not disturb her thinking, they just waited quietly.","Finally, Xiangxiang made up her mind, got up and walked towards them.","“You...you are really here to hold a nirvana ceremony for Grandpa Wang Cai, aren’t you here to catch the phoenix?”","After hearing this, Little Wang Cai’s face suddenly turned green.","After talking for a long time, Xiangxiang was so moved that he thought Xiangxiang had fallen in love with him out of sympathy!","In the end, he was still that kind of grandfather?!","Huang Yueli was also secretly amused.","Children were children after all and they had no social experience.","It’s not like bad guys have the word “bad guy” written on their faces. If I asked them directly if they were going to catch Phoenix, of course she would answer","How can you ask someone like this?","Fortunately, they are really not bad people.","Otherwise, Xiangxiang will be sold again.","However, looking at Xiangxiang’s innocent big eyes, Huang Yueli was too embarrassed to say anything else.","“That’s right, we are really here for Little Wang Cai’s nirvana. Don’t worry, I can swear to the Heavens.”","Xiangxiang nodded, “Yeah, the people that Grandpa Wang Cai trusts are definitely not bad people. Then I will take you to our family’s territory! Grandpa Wang Cai has never had a physical body, it was really pitiful!”","Xiangxiang made up her mind and set off with the three of them early the next morning.","From Xiangxiang’s mouth, they learned that the so-called Phoenix ruins were actually not ruins at all, but a place where the Phoenix Clan lived all year round.","The official name was Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, located between two steep mountains.","Now, there are more than a hundred phoenixes living on this land.","More than a hundred, which sounds like a lot, especially for most of the Ancient God Clan who have not seen a divine beast for tens of thousands of years, this was a completely shocking number.","However, for the Phoenix Clan, this was already a very dangerous number.","The Phoenix Clan has such a long lifespan, almost all of them can live for tens of thousands of years. Just like this, there are only over a hundred of them alive, which was really scary to think about.","While Xiangxiang introduced the situation of the clan, she gradually led the three of them deep into Celestial Ecliptic Forest.."]},{"number":4347,"title":"Chapter 4347: Phoenix Tranquility Gorge (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli had already memorized all the maps of the Phoenix ruins in her mind.","As she followed Xiangxiang forward, she recalled the contents on the map in her mind and compared them with each other.","Although Xiangxiang looks like an innocent little girl, she was still very cautious.","When you go out, don’t be afraid of ten thousand, just be afraid of the unexpected.","Fortunately, Xiangxiang really had no intention of lying to them.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","They moved forward all the way, following Xiangxiang’s instructions, going forward, backward, left and right, and around the bends.","Huang Yueli followed them, feeling secretly happy in her heart.","In some places, the mechanisms are so secretive that even an outstanding Spirit Armament Master like Huang Yueli cannot discover them all in an instant.","If they were to enter Phoenix Tranquility Gorge by themselves, although they might not be able to reach their destination, it would definitely take a lot of effort.","After seven days and seven nights, they finally arrived at the center location marked on the map.","Several people stopped.","Little Wang Cai raised his head, looked left and right, and finally frowned with a puzzled look.","“Strange, isn’t it said that Phoenix Tranquility Gorge was a canyon? This was not a canyon at all!”","No matter how you look at it, there was a whole dense forest nearby, how can it turn into a canyon.","Xiangxiang blinked her eyes and wanted to speak.","However, before she could speak, Huang Yueli had already explained: “Wang Cai, you have to be careful. This place just looks like a dense forest. If you continue to walk forward, you will fall into an abyss soon.” Among them. Even if you are a spirit body, you will be very weak if you bear such a big impact.”","“Is this... so terrifying?”","Hearing this, Little Wang Cai was startled and stopped.","Xiangxiang turned her head and looked at Huang Yueli in surprise, “How do you know so much?”","Huang Yueli smiled, “Because, I happen to be an array master!”","The real reason was of course not only that, she also happens to be from the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","He also used phoenix blood to bathe in the trial tower, and used phoenix blood core for initiation on Lingyue Peak.","In fact, she already has the spiritual energy of the Phoenix Clan in her body, so she can interact with the spiritual energy gathered in the formation to form an induction.","However, she saw that Xiangxiang was particularly disgusted with the Sacred Phoenix Clan, so she didn’t say these words and kept them in her heart.","Xiangxiang’s eyes widened with an expression of wonder, obviously shocked by her performance.","“You are so powerful! My grandpa said that our Phoenix Clan’s formation was so powerful that it was impossible for outsiders to see through it! Even the Ming Xuan Realm experts from your God Clan can’t see through it! You can actually see it!”","Huang Yueli touched her little head.","Xiangxiang seemed to be more accepting of her this time and did not dodge.","Huang Yueli said: “Alright, let’s hurry up and go to Phoenix Tranquility Gorge. It will get dark soon. According to my understanding, this formation can only be opened during the day, right?”","Xiangxiang lowered her little head, a trace of sadness flashed in her eyes.","“That’s right, grandpa once told me. The mountain protection formation of our Phoenix Clan can only be opened during the day. If you forcefully enter at night, even if you know the location of the formation, you will still fall into the fog. I just ran away for fun. When I came out, I didn’t realize anything was wrong until it got dark. As a result, I ran in the formation for a long time and passed out. When I woke up, I found that I had been captured by those devils....”"]},{"number":4348,"title":"Chapter 4348: Phoenix Tranquility Gorge (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4348: Phoenix Tranquility Gorge (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli and Li Moying walked over decisively and mounted astride. As soon as they sat down, Little Wang Cai and Xiangxiang took off at the same time.","Xiangxiang flapped her young wings and led the way.","Little Wang Cai followed closely behind.","Two phoenixes kept walking through the clouds.","Although Xiangxiang was very young, she was very familiar with the surrounding environment. She goes around in familiar ways, sometimes flying up and sometimes sliding down.","Little Wang Cai, on the other hand, spent a lot of effort to keep up with her speed.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying sat on Little Wang Cai’s back, being tossed around.","Fortunately, they were strong. If they had been replaced by slightly weaker cultivators, they would have been overturned by this time and fell directly into the abyss.","I don’t know how long it took, but Xiangxiang squeaked twice, and then suddenly jumped up.","Little Wang Cai said at the same time: “The female devil, the big devil, we seem to be arriving, you guys sit tight!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he also ran away.","If he hadn’t reminded her just now, Huang Yueli and the others would have fallen down.","After this thrilling moment, Little Wang Cai’s flight became stable.","Huang Yueli looked around and found that they had entered a spacious plain. The surrounding fire attribute was extremely rich. All kinds of fire attribute plants were growing on the entire plain. They were lush and green. There were also buildings on both sides of the plain. There are many neat and beautiful small yards, which look very rich and peaceful.","“This was simply a paradise-like existence!” Huang Yueli sighed in a low voice.","After Xiangxiang landed, she turned into a human form again.","Because the flight just now was very tiring, her face turned red and she was still panting slightly.","“Grandpa Wang Cai, and uncles and aunts, you have to wait here for a while. I want to go and talk to grandpa first. I don’t know if grandpa will be angry. I heard that no outsiders have come into our canyon for thousands of years.","Woolen cloth...”","Before she could finish her words, suddenly, an extremely excited voice came from behind.","“Xiangxiang, was Xiangxiang back? Let grandpa see why you haven’t come back for several days. Grandpa was worried to death!!”","Hearing this voice, Huang Yueli was slightly startled.","Judging from the meaning behind these words, this person should be the grandpa Xiangxiang talks about.","But, this voice doesn’t sound like grandpa’s at all, does it?","Huang Yueli thought this, and when she looked back, she saw a young and handsome red-haired man running out of a thatched hut.","He was very fast. With a few jumps, he appeared in front of several people.","He reached out and hugged Xiangxiang, looking nervously at her left and right.","“Xiangxiang, are you alright? Since you haven’t come back for so many days, we all thought you were kidnapped by those Devil Clan bastards! Fortunately, you’re alright!”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a while.","It turns out that this was really Xiangxiang’s grandpa!","Doesn’t it look too young?","She remembered Xiangxiang said that her grandfather must be tens of thousands of years old!","“Grandpa, I’m fine...”","Before Xiangxiang could finish her words, many people started running out of other courtyards. They immediately gathered around Xiangxiang and asked her about her well-being.","The cubs of the Phoenix Clan are too rare.","Each one was an important treasure for the entire group.","Xiangxiang said “it’s alright” hundreds of times before comforting these “elderly people”.","“Grandpa, I brought some friends back. They have something to do...” She tugged on Grandpa’s sleeve.."]},{"number":4349,"title":"Chapter 4349: Phoenix Tranquility Gorge (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4349: Phoenix Tranquility Gorge (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli and Li Moying walked over decisively and sat on his back. As soon as they sat down, Little Wang Cai and Xiangxiang took off at the same time.","Xiangxiang flapped her tender little wings and led the way up front.","Little Wang Cai followed closely behind.","Two Phoenixes traversed through the clouds.","Although Xiangxiang was very young, she was very familiar with the surrounding environment. She familiarly flew around around freely, flying upwards at one time and gliding downwards at another.","Little Wang Cai, on the other hand, spent a lot of effort to keep up with her speed.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying sat on Little Wang Cai’s back, were being tossed around.","Fortunately, they were strong. If they had been replaced by slightly weaker cultivators, they would have been overturned by this time and fell directly into the abyss.","Not knowing how long it took, but Xiangxiang suddenly screeched out twice, before she suddenly changed her trajectory and swooped down.","Little wang cam sala at tne same time: ‘”Ine Female Devil, Big Devil, we seem to be arriving, you guys sit tight!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he also followed suit and swooped down.","If it wasn’t for him voicing out a reminder just now, they would have fallen off.","After this thrilling moment, Little Wang Cai’s flight became stable.","Huang Yueli looked around and realized that they had entered a spacious plain, the surrounding fire attribute was exceptionally dense, on the entire plain, there were all sorts of fire attribute plants growing luxuriously. There were also quite a number of neat and beautiful small courtyards built on each side of the plain lined up, looking very quaint and peaceful.","“This is simply a paradise-like existence!” Huang Yueli sighed in a low voice.","After Xiangxiang landed, she turned into a human form again.","Because the journey was very physically exhausting, her small face was flushed red and she was still panting slightly.","“Grandpa Wang Cai, Uncle and Aunt, you have to wait here for a while. I want to go and talk to Grandpa first. I don’t know if Grandpa will be angry. I heard that no outsiders have come into our canyon for thousands of years. Woolen cloth...”","Before she could finish her words, suddenly, an extremely excited voice came from behind.","“Xiangxiang, was Xiangxiang back? Let Grandpa see why you haven’t come back for several days. Grandpa was worried to death!!”","Hearing this voice, Huang Yueli was slightly startled.","Judging from the meaning behind these words, this person should be the person whom Xiangxiang called Grandpa.","But, this voice doesn’t sound like a Grandpa’s at all, does it?","Huang Yueli thought this, and when she looked back, she saw a young and handsome red-haired man running out of a thatched hut.","He was very fast. With a few jumps, he appeared in front of several people.","He reached out and hugged Xiangxiang, looking nervously at her left and right.","“Xiangxiang, are you alright? Since you haven’t come back for so many days, we all thought you were kidnapped by those Devil Clan bastards! Fortunately, you’re alright!”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a while.","It turns out that this was really Xiangxiang’s Grandpa!","Doesn’t he look too young?","She remembered Xiangxiang said that her grandfather must be tens of thousands of years old!","“Grandpa, I’m fine...”","Before Xiangxiang could finish her words, many people started running out of other courtyards. They immediately gathered around Xiangxiang and asked her about her well-being.","The little ones of the Phoenix Clan are too rare.","Each one was an important treasure for the entire clan.","Xiangxiang said “I’m alright” hundreds of times before comforting these “elderly people”.","“Grandpa, I brought some friends back. They have something to do...” She tugged on Grandpa’s sleeve.."]},{"number":4350,"title":"Chapter 4350: Phoenix Tranquility Gorge (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4350: Phoenix Tranquility Gorge (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xiangxiang’s Grandpa was so nervous about his granddaughter that he didn’t notice anyone at first.","Hearing Xiangxiang’s words, he was slightly stunned at first, frowned and said: “Xiangxiang, how many times has Grandpa taught you? There are no good people out there! You must not have contact with them, let alone bring them back...”","Before he finished speaking, his eyes fell on Little Wang Cai.","“What?! A Phoenix? You brought a Phoenix back?! How is that possible? Where did you find him?”","Although the Little Wang Cai in front of him was just a spirit body, he was still a real Phoenix!","With the strength of his current spiritual body, he can still return to his physical body after undergoing the Nirvana ceremony.","The number of Phoenixes in Phoenix Tranquility Gorge was getting smaller and smaller, and every new member who joined was precious.","Therefore, Xiangxiang’s Grandfather immediately became excited and walked towards Little Wang Cai.","“Hello, welcome to Phoenix Tranquility Gorge. My name is Yan Zhu, and I am Xiangxiang’s grandfather...”","Little Wang Cai nodded politely, with a rare serious look on his childish face, he tried to look all mature and grown up.","He cupped his hands towards Yan Zhu and said, “Senior Yan Zhu, hello, my name is... my name is Wang Cai...”","“Hello, Wang... wait, what did you say your name was?” Yan Zhu was obviously taken aback.","Little Wang Cai also felt that this name was too shameful, and secretly regretted why he had a brain twitch just now and actually said out that embarrassing name!","This was in front of his own people, how could he say such an embarrassing name out aloud!","He should give himself a cool name on the spot!","He coughed twice quickly, trying to slide over this incident.","“Ahem, this is not important...Senior Yan Zhu, I’m sorry for letting Xiangxiang take me to Phoenix Tranquility Gorge and breaking the rules of your clan.”","“No, no, no, it’s a good thing that you are willing to return to the clan. There is nothing of the likes of breaking the rules.” Yan Zhu said hurriedly.","The other Phoenixes around also responded.","“Yes, welcome back to our Phoenix Clan’s base.”","“Come to our house and sit down. The Patriarch is in seclusion. Otherwise, he will definitely come out to greet you in person!”","Little Wang Cai hurriedly waved his hand: “Well... there’s no need to sit down. I came with the Female Devil and her husband. We are here this time to ask you for advice...","Only then did the Phoenixes notice Huang Yueli and Li Moying standing beside a big tree not far away.","In order to show their sincerity, they had already taken off the disguise on their faces and revealed their true faces on the way.","A pair of handsome men and beautiful women stand side by side under the red maple tree, with their fingers clasped together. No matter from which angle one looked, they looked like a beautiful and romantic picture.","However, after Yan Zhu and others looked at the two of them intently for a while, their expressions suddenly changed.","What’s going on? Did you bring these two people from the Ancient God Clan? You actually brought them to Phoenix Tranquility Gorge! ! ”","“Oh my goodness, they are really from the Ancient God Clans! How could they come here? How dare they come?”","“It’s not just the Ancient God Clan, I have sensed the blood of this woman. She was clearly a cultivator of the Sacred Phoenix Clan!! Moreover, she seems to have been fused with the Phoenix Blood Core! Such a person dares to come to Phoenix Tranquility Gorge. This is simply ridiculous. A provocation to our","Phoenix Clan! ”","“It’s too much.. Since they insist on dying, let’s help them!”"]},{"number":4351,"title":"Chapter 4351: Little Phoenix’s Life Experience (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4351: Little Phoenix’s Life Experience (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli and Li Moying noticed something was wrong when they saw all of them rush up.","Huang Yueli waved her hands and tried to explain: “Everyone...seniors, please wait. We really don’t have any ill intentions when we come here this time. Hey, wait, listen to what I have to say first...”","However, these Phoenixes, who were filled with indignation, had no patience to listen to their explanations at all.","Without saying a word, they mercilessly launched an assault at them.","Streams of fire pierced the sky and bombarded the two of them.","A hint of coldness flashed in Li Moying’s dark eyes. With one arm, he swiftly wrapped Huang Yueli’s slender waist and held her in his arms, while waving his other hand to counter the oncoming attacks.","A dazzling light suddenly flashed in front of everyone’s eyes, so bright that it blinded them for a moment.","The explosive thunder energy directly hit the fire, making a deafening sound.","The Phoenixes originally saw the two of them as just young men and women, younger than a fraction of them in age, so they didn’t take them seriously at all","and didn’t use all their strength in their attacks.","and didn’t use all their strength in their attacks.","As a result, Li Moying managed to block their attacks.","Li Moying also knew that the strength of these Phoenixes was actually very strong. With their powerful cultivation accumulated over the years, neither him nor Huang Yueli was a match against any one of them.","So, after he scored a hit, he dragged Huang Yueli and ran away.","The two of them darted out, dodging the attacks of these Phoenixes.","Although they all have extremely high attainments in body movements and mystical skills, these Phoenixes were also very fast, chasing closely behind them and refusing to relax in the slightest.","Stream after stream of fire flashed behind them, landing almost right on their heels.","Several times, it was a close call.","Little Wang Cai was now anxious, and together with Xiangxiang, the two little ones were chasing behind the grandfathers with their short legs.","While chasing, he shouted: “Seniors, wait a minute, listen to us! Ouch, what’s going on? Why do you always hit and try to kill people? This is not good. You are already so old and yet your temper is so fiery, it’s easy to shorten one’s lifespan.”","Xiangxiang followed behind and said: “Grandpa Wang Cai is right! You can’t hit people!”","It’s a pity that the two little ones spoke softly and called for a long time from behind, but no one paid attention to them.","Only Yan Zhu looked back at them, with a look of hatred on his face.","“What do you kids know? Go ahead and play! Let me tell you, none of these guys from the Ancient God Clan are good people. They treat you well just to take advantage of you. It’s because you are young and ignorant that you are deceived by them! ”","“Uh, but, the Female Devil and the others really came here for me...”","Little Wang Cai chased after him for a long time, but to no avail, his legs almost broken.","The only good thing was that Li Moying and Huang Yueli seem to have very good endurance. Even after being besieged and chased by so many Phoenixes for a long time, they showed no signs of being caught.","Just as three waves of people were endlessly, suddenly, a violent fire attributed energy rose from above a thatched cottage in the corner and shot straight into the sky.","The entire sky was illuminated by the fire as bright as day, and a crimson light enveloped the earth.","The Phoenixes that were chasing Huang Yueli and Li Moying suddenly stopped and turned to look in the direction of the rising flames.","A look of surprise appeared on each of their faces. “It’s the Patriarch!! The Patriarch is out of seclusion!!”"]},{"number":4352,"title":"Chapter 4352: Little Phoenix’s Life Experience (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The pressure on Li Moying and Huang Yueli was instantly relieved.","The two stopped and saw the Phoenixes’ expressions of excitement, admiration and surprise, and looked at each other.","“What’s going on? Why have they stopped chasing us?”","“It looks like the leader of the Phoenix Clan has left seclusion...","Huang Yueli frowned, “This is really bad. We entered Phoenix Tranquility","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Gorge without making any preparations. We were really careless. These","Phoenixes were not even willing to listen to Little Wang Cai’s words and simply attacked us relentlessly. How can we escape now that we have been caught?” The residence of the Phoenix Clan was above the clouds.","The two of them wanted to leave. They couldn’t just jump down. They had to let Little Wang Cai take them down.","However, Huang Yueli finally managed to send him back to the Phoenix Clan’s territory, so she was unwilling to leave like this.","Little Wang Cai doesn’t have his own body, it’s really pitiful...","Just when she was struggling, the door of the thatched cottage suddenly opened.","A young man wearing a red-gold robe walked out of the thatched house.","His complexion was fair and his facial features were delicate. He had an aloof and a don’t-mess-with-me aura surrounding him.","When the Phoenixes saw him, they immediately bent down and saluted,","“Patriarch, you are out of seclusion!”","“Well, yes.” the Patriarch nodded, “What are you all doing here?”","Before Yan Zhu and the others could speak, suddenly, a childish voice sounded.","“Brother, is that you? Brother? I am your brother, I am Zhao Hua!”","Little Wang Cai suddenly spoke out, his voice full of excitement.","The Patriarch’s brows furrowed, and he suddenly turned his head to look at the Little Phoenix who was rushing from behind the crowd, and his pupils suddenly shrank.","“You...you are really...”","“Brother, brother! I am really your brother! I remembered it, I remembered it all. Your name is Zhao Lin, and we are all royal children of the Phoenix Clan. One hundred thousand years ago, our Phoenix Clan was attacked by the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. During the siege, a large number of","Phoenixes were captured by them. You hugged me and ran away, and then...”","Upon hearing these words, Zhao Lin’s body trembled suddenly, and he stared at Little Wang Cai in disbelief, his eyes unblinking.","“Zhao Hua...you are really Zhao Hua!”","He rushed to Little Wang Cai’s side, picked him up, and examined him carefully.","In fact, he didn’t need to do many checks to confirm Little Wang Cai’s identity.","Little Wang Cai looks exactly like his brother who disappeared one hundred thousand years ago, and he can still recall the details of that past event one hundred thousand years ago.","Moreover, it was impossible for the spirit bodies of the Phoenix Clan to be exposed to broad daylight for such a long time and still be alive and kicking.","Only his younger brother Zhao Hua, who was sealed into a fragment of the Sky Phoenix Ring by him, could maintain the lasting stability of his spiritual body. “Brother, I really miss you! I didn’t expect to see you again!”","The two brothers met again after a hundred thousand years, and they were both extremely excited.","Little Wang Cai threw himself into his brother’s arms, tears streaming down his face.","The Phoenixes on the side all had surprised expressions on their faces.","“What? This...this little guy was the Patriarch’s brother? Doesn’t that mean that he...he is already a hundred thousand years old?”","“I heard that Master Zhao Hua died in the war a hundred thousand years ago?","Where did this little kid come from?”","“What on earth is going on?”"]},{"number":4353,"title":"Chapter 4353: Little Phoenix’s Life Experience (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Not only these Phoenixes, but also Huang Yueli and Li Moying also had an incredulous expression on their faces.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly and murmured to herself: “It turns out that Little","Wang Cai really has another name...”","From the day he got together with her, the little guy has always emphasised that he has a name, a name that was a hundred times better than the old-fashioned name of “Wang Cai”!","However, Huang Yueli didn’t take it seriously at all.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Because every time she asked him what his “super cool” name was, Wang Cai would suddenly go into a daze, his mind would go blank, and he couldn’t remember it no matter how hard he thought about it.","Li Moying’s focus was different from hers.","He frowned, thoughtfully, “So, Wang Cai’s brother is actually still alive?","Moreover, he seems to be quite young...”","Of course, the “young” Li Moying refers to was not really young.","But relative to his age.","Even an ancient Phoenix with pure blood was almost impossible to live to be 100,000 years old.","Even if you can barely rely on medicine to extend your life, by this time, you will definitely be unable to maintain your youthful appearance and become senile.","However, Little Wang Cai’s brother Zhao Lin still looks like a young man.","This means that the fire of his life was far from burning out...","There was almost only one explanation for this, and that was that Zhao Lin was very powerful and has even made a breakthrough that has never been seen in the historical records of the Phoenix Clan!","Such a strong man was obviously not something he and Huang Yueli could fight against.","Huang Yueli looked at each other and noticed this, and suddenly became nervous.","Although they have the amulet of Little Wang Cai, it was really hard to say how much love they have left as the brothers have been separated for a hundred thousand years.","Considering how much the Phoenix Clan hates the ancient gods, maybe the Patriarch will still insist on killing them...","Li Moying subconsciously took a step forward, wanting to block his wife behind him.","However, Huang Yueli grabbed his sleeve.","“Don’t be like this, I still have to see my Wang Cai! Besides, the other party is so powerful. If he really wants to kill someone, you can’t protect me...”","A hint of coldness flashed across Li Moying’s eyes.","He was still not strong enough...","Today, if he can leave Phoenix Tranquility Gorge safely, he must practice even harder until he reaches the pinnacle and surpasses everyone in the God Realm... or beasts.","In this way, he can protect his Little Li’er.","While the two were whispering, a pair of brothers over there who had reunited after a long absence had already completed the first stage of recognizing each other.","Little Wang Cai was already in tears and kept wiping his tears.","Zhao Lin was obviously also shocked, with obvious excitement in his expression.","After a long time, he stood up and looked at so many people around him. He was surprised, frowned and asked: “Why are you all gathered here? When I came out of seclusion just now, it was so noisy outside. What happened? ” “Uh, this... Patriarch...” Yan Zhu didn’t know where to start for a while.","Zhao Lin became even more confused, and at the same time, he thought of another question: “By the way, Zhao Hua, how did you find Phoenix Tranquility","Gorge? I remember, I obviously... sealed you into the Sky Phoenix Ring.”","Afterwards, he went to the territory of the Ancient God Clans countless times, hoping to find the Sky Phoenix Ring and rescue his younger brother.."]},{"number":4354,"title":"Chapter 4354: Little Phoenix’s Life Experience (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, the last news we got was that the Sky Phoenix Ring had been lost in a battle and fell into the lower realm.","In addition to the God Realm, there were three thousand other realms in the void.","There was no way for him to find such a big world.","He thought that it would be absolutely impossible for him to see his brother again in this life.","But he didn’t expect that this surprise would come so suddenly today. Even now, he still feels like he was dreaming.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Moreover, his younger brother was still in a spiritual state, which means that he could not leave the Sky Phoenix Ring for too long.","However, he was here. Could it be that someone brought the Sky Phoenix Ring over?","After hearing his brother’s question, Little Wang Cai suddenly remembered the business and hurriedly said loudly: “Brother, let me make it clear to you first, I came here with the Female Devil and the Big Devil! When these Phoenixes saw them, they simply lost their minds and just screamed to kill them, and I can’t stop them no matter what. You can’t be like them, otherwise, I will leave immediately and never come back!”","When Zhao Lin heard this, he was stunned for a moment, “Female Devil? Big devil?”","What kind of weird name was this?","Yan Zhu lowered his voice and explained: “Patriarch, Master Zhao Hua seems to have made a contract with a little girl from the Sacred Phoenix Clan. This time, it was the girl and her husband who sent Master Zhao Hua back.”","After hearing this, Zhao Lin frowned and looked in the direction indicated by","Yan Zhu.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying knew that they would definitely not be able to escape, so they had no intention of running away.","Sensing Zhao Lin’s gaze, both of them looked towards him, their expressions were calm and composed, and they bowed their hands to him in a neither humble nor overbearing manner.","“Patriarch Zhao Lin, what a pleasure it is to meet you!”","Zhao Lin was also secretly surprised.","He has seen countless talented cultivators from the Ancient God Clan in the past 100,000 years.","However, it was the first time that he had seen a pair as outstanding as the pair in front of him, whether in talent, appearance or temperament.","From the major attributes of the two, he easily judged who was the owner of Little Wang Cai.","“Girl, you are the benefactor who saved my brother, right? I am so grateful to you that you even made a special trip to send him back.”","Before Huang Yueli could reply, Little Wang Cai had already arrived.","“Yeah, brother, you still have vision and a clear mind! These seniors just rushed to kill my Female Devil as soon as they saw her! In fact, the Female Devil is not a bad person at all. If she hadn’t insisted on finding a solution, and wanted me to be reborn from nirvana and have my own body, we can’t find this place at all.”","When Yan Zhu heard this, he was dissatisfied and opened his mouth to defend himself: “Patriarch, please don’t believe these cunning people from the Ancient God Clans just because of Young Master Zhao Hua’s words! Young Master Zhao Hua has always been in the Sky Phoenix Ring, so he is not very experienced in the world, and he may not be able to tell the difference between good and bad, and will be deceived by these insidious guys!”","His views were the same as many Phoenixes.","“That’s right, I don’t believe that there are any good people among the Ancient God Clans!”","“I would rather make ten thousand mistakes than let one person go! Have you forgotten what the Sacred Phoenix Clan did to us back then?”","“Enough!”","Zhao Lin couldn’t listen anymore and suddenly interrupted everyone with a sharp shout.","The Phoenixes immediately did not dare to speak.","Zhao Lin said coldly: “The grudge between us and the Sacred Phoenix Clan has been going on for a hundred thousand years. How old are these two young people? It has nothing to do with them! Now, they are sending my brother back specially, and we can’t retaliate..”"]},{"number":4355,"title":"Chapter 4355: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Zhao Lin obviously has great prestige among the Phoenix Clan.","He opened his mouth to let Huang Yueli and Li Moying go, but none of the Phoenix dared to say a word.","Although judging from the expressions on their faces, they were clearly unconvinced, at least no one dared to openly challenge Zhao Lin’s authority. Zhao Lin took a few steps forward, walked in front of Huang Yueli and Li Moying, and cupped his fists.","“Both of you, thank you for making the trip to send my brother back. Our clan has some prejudices against cultivators from the Ancient God Clans and offended you two. Please don’t mind. I don’t know how I should address you?”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect that the leader of the Phoenix Clan, who had lived for 100,000 years who was extremely powerful, would be so polite.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","She immediately returned the greeting with cupped fists, “Lord Zhao Lin, I am taking the liberty of visiting you this time. I am Huang Yueli from the Sacred Phoenix Clan. This is my husband Li Moying, he was a cultivator from the Cloudy Qilin Clan...”","Hearing this, Zhao Lin couldn’t hold back and said “Hey”.","The other Phoenixes even looked at each other.","Some people even blurted out: “What is going on? The Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan...are they reconciled?”","“Isn’t it possible? I clearly remember that there was a deep hatred between these two clans that has lasted for hundreds of thousands of years and has not yet been resolved.”","“That’s right. Isn’t the reason why our Phoenix Clan lives in seclusion in","Phoenix Tranquility Gorge also because of these two Ancient God Clans?”","Huang Yueli was confused when she heard this, “What? Even you guys know about the disagreement between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Also, what does this have to do with you living in seclusion?”","Zhao Lin squinted his eyes, looking a little surprised.","He was silent for a moment and said slowly: “I didn’t expect that a god-level genius like you didn’t know this period of history. Also, a hundred thousand years have passed, and no one probably remembers some things. Also. It’s only us old guys who live in seclusion who remember the past so clearly when we have nothing to do.”","Huang Yueli became even more confused and couldn’t help but frown.","“Master Zhao Lin, we really don’t know much about the past. However, there is still a rift between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan. My husband and I... ahem, to be precise, I ran out on my own regardless of the clan’s objections.","Zhao Lin’s handsome face showed a hint of astonishment, “So, you are eloping?”","Huang Yueli turned back to look at her husband, and then said: “That’s right.’","“However, this was really unreasonable. If I read it correctly, both of them should be god-level talents. Even among the ancient gods, they are both peerless geniuses. Just this, you can’t let your family concede?”","Huang Yueli smiled, “However, you also said that the hatred between the two families has been going on for hundreds of thousands of years...”","Zhao Lin pondered for a moment and nodded, “I understand. It’s rare for you two to come here, so don’t stand outside. I’ll have someone prepare a few dishes. I’ll entertain you two well tonight. I really want to thank you for your kindness to Zhao Hua.”","Little Wang Cai nodded at the side, “Yes, yes, the Female Devil is still very good to me.”","When Zhao Lin heard this, he couldn’t help but turn around and glared at his younger brother.","“I’m really good to you. I’ve made you so fat. Look at Xiangxiang, I guess she’s not even half as heavy as you!”","The two little Phoenixes appear to be about the same age, but little Wang Cai was obviously a bit fatter than the others.","The face was chubby all around.","Huang Yueli felt a little embarrassed.","It seems she felt a little sorry for Zhao Lin, for spoiling this kid...."]},{"number":4356,"title":"Chapter 4356: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Fortunately, Zhao Lin didn’t care.","He held his younger brother with one hand, made a “please” gesture with the other, and led the two of them into his thatched cottage.","Although he was the Patriarch, Zhao Lin’s residence was not more luxurious than that of ordinary clan members.","Zhao Lin asked Huang Yueli and Li Moying to sit down and explained: “We, the Phoenix Clan, originally advocated nature and followed the way of heaven. We usually show our original bodies and travel in the mountains. We rarely live in these houses, so we aren’t very particular... you two can live here for a while, please don’t mind it.”","Huang Yueli would naturally have no objection.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","In the evening, Zhao Lin prepared a table of dishes to entertain them.","However, Little Wang Cai did not attend.","According to Zhao Lin, his spiritual body was weak and needed a good recovery.","In terms of cooking skills, it was obviously incomparable with human chefs, and almost all of their dishes were vegetarian.","Fortunately, the Phoenix Clan’s brewing technique was very good.","There were many rare fruits growing in the canyon, and they are all turned into medicinal wine.","Huang Yueli picked up the wine glass. The dark red wine was clear and sweet, exuding a rich aroma.","“This aroma...could it be said...”","Seeing Huang Yueli’s slightly shocked expression, Zhao Lin smiled slightly and said, “It seems that Miss Huang also has some research on elixirs. Yes, the main ingredient for this wine was Red Soul Fruit. In addition, it is also paired with several fire-attributed medicinal materials.","When Huang Yueli heard this, she was speechless inwardly.","Red Soul Fruit was a top fire-attribute medicinal material. It can be used to refine heaven-level elixirs that increase the chance of breakthrough when fire-attribute cultivators advance to the Life Profound Realm.","Liu Buyan has been looking for the Red Soul Fruit for a long time, but none of the major auction houses were selling it.","As a result, the Phoenix Clan was all used to make wine...","Moreover, judging from the quality of the wine, there are probably more than one or two Red Soul Fruits in each barrel.","Huang Yueli raised her head and drank all the wine in the cup.","After drinking, she immediately felt a hot air rising from her Dantian and slowly flowing into her meridians.","This air flow merged with her own profound energy, and quickly circulated in the meridians for a whole day.","She clearly felt that her own profound strength had improved slightly.","“As expected of the medicinal wine brewed from Red Soul Fruit!” Huang Yueli couldn’t help but praise.","Secretly thinking to herself, it seems that the Phoenix Clan has indeed found a lot of treasures in this inaccessible gorge. I wonder if they can find a way to exchange some for them when they leave.","Zhao Lin saw what she was thinking and said with a smile: “Red Soul Fruit is not uncommon in Phoenix Tranquility Gorge. It’s just a little troublesome to pick and collect it. If Miss Huang likes it, you might as well take some back.","However, we don’t have anything with thunder attributes here. Young Master Li, please don’t be offended.”","Li Moying’s face remained expressionless, but he still bowed his hand politely.","“It doesn’t matter.”","During the dinner, Zhao Lin said many words of gratitude.","Huang Yueli brought up the business: “Master Zhao Lin, to be honest, I brought Zhao Hua here this time just to let him regain his physical body. I heard that the Phoenix Clan has a ritual of nirvana and rebirth. I don’t know... if this is true?”","Hearing this, Zhao Lin laughed, “Yes, our clan’s classics do record the ritual of Nirvana, and I have witnessed it several times in my lifetime. The most important thing about the Nirvana ritual was that it requires a large amount of rare materials, and also requires the assistance of eight powerful clansmen, but this was not a problem. Our tribe has been recuperating here for many years, consuming very few resources, and these materials are all readily available..”"]},{"number":4357,"title":"Chapter 4357: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“The only possible problem is that Zhao Hua’s spirit body has been away from the physical body for too long and needs to be recuperated for a period of time before it can meet the requirements of the Nirvana ceremony. Therefore, I’ve let him start the practice today.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli breathed a sigh of relief.","It seems that Little Wang Cai will be able to recover his body soon.","Although the process of searching for the Phoenix Clan was a little bumpy this time, it was generally very smooth.","The Phoenix Clan was now so few in number, and Zhao Lin was Wang Cai’s elder brother. They must really hope that Little Wang Cai can recover smoothly.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Therefore, since Zhao Lin has a guarantee, this matter will definitely succeed.","Huang Yueli was very happy and thanked her repeatedly.","Zhao Lin smiled and said: “Miss Huang, you are mistaken. It should be me, the Elder Brother, who should thank you. Come on, let me toast you.” Huang Yueli also drank several more drinks.","After three drinks, everyone at the banquet gradually became lively.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but raise a question that had been lingering in her heart.","“Lord Zhao Lin, there was one thing... I really don’t understand. I wonder if you can explain it to me?”","Zhao Lin said: “What’s the matter?”","Huang Yueli thought for a while, “I wonder what happened between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Phoenix Clan a hundred thousand years ago? Why did you all return to Phoenix Tranquility Gorge to live in seclusion, and Little Wang Cai encountered such a misfortune... ...”","Upon hearing this, Zhao Lin was obviously stunned for a moment and seemed a little embarrassed.","“This...it’s a long story. Besides, a hundred thousand years have passed, so there’s no point in bringing up old things again. In any case, even if the Phoenix Clan has enmity with the Sacred Phoenix Clan, it’s not with you. It’s a grudge between our ancestors. Both You and Young Master Li are distinguished guests of our clan, so you don’t need to worry about that.”","“Ahem, Master Zhao Lin, you are too polite.”","Huang Yueli saw that Zhao Lin was unwilling to answer, so it was difficult to continue asking.","But, for some reason, she always felt that something was wrong.","This journey seems a bit too smooth.","Although she has always been very lucky, it was somewhat strange that she has such good luck.","She thought that the process of reshaping Little Wang Cai’s body would take at least several decades to slowly explore.","The result... it was done so quickly?","While Huang Yueli was thinking, she suddenly felt dizzy in her head.","The scenery in front of me also became blurry instantly.","Her body swayed and she quickly supported her head with her hands.","“Ughh..”","She let out a muffled groan.","Li Moying frowned, hugged her shoulders, and asked anxiously: “Little Li’er, what’s wrong with you? What’s wrong with you?”","“I...l’m a little dizzy...what’s going on?”","Huang Yueli leaned on her husband’s shoulder, wanting to take a rest.","However, the dizziness in my head became more and more serious.","Zhao Lin also looked a little nervous and stood up from his seat, “Miss Huang, what’s wrong with you? Are you drunk?”","He walked quickly to Huang Yueli and gestured to help her.","However, when his finger was still half a metre away from Huang Yueli.","Suddenly, a crisp sound of “choking” came from my ears.","A sharp cold light suddenly flashed in front of his eyes, and a terrifying murderous intention suddenly struck!","Zhao Lin was startled, but luckily he was strong enough and reacted quickly enough, so he immediately pulled away and retreated backwards.","Only then did he escape the sword at the last moment.","“You... Young Master Li, what are you doing?”","Li Moying’s handsome and graceful face was filled with coldness. The long sword in his hand was unsheathed, and blue-purple lightning flashed continuously on the sword, making it feel cold.."]},{"number":4358,"title":"Chapter 4358: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“What did you do to Little Li’er?!”","Li Moying pursed his lips and spoke in a cold voice.","Zhao Lin’s face was full of confusion and he frowned, “Young Master Li, what do you mean? Young Miss Huang suddenly fainted. I’m afraid she was unwell. How could it have anything to do with me? Don’t be impatient first. Put her down and lie down, I do have some medical skills and can diagnose and treat her.”","Li Moying sneered coldly, still holding the sword tightly in his hand, and did not relax because of Zhao Lin’s excuse.","Zhao Lin sighed, his expression serious and very sincere.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","“Young Master Li, don’t be like this. If there was really something wrong with Miss Huang’s body, if you do this, it will delay the treatment time. Don’t worry, our Phoenix Clan also has many medical classics. I have lived for a hundred thousand years. I still have some knowledge, so I won’t make a wrong diagnosis.”","Li Moying looked directly at him coldly, “Your Excellency, you think you can deceive me with these words? You are clearly...”","Halfway through his words, he suddenly felt a severe dizziness.","The scenery in front of me suddenly became blurry.","Li Moying’s figure shook twice and fell headfirst onto the table.","Zhao Lin’s eyes widened and he rushed over nervously.","“Young Master Li, Young Master Li! What’s going on with you? Why did you faint?","Wake up, wake up!”","However, Li Moying lay quietly on the table, motionless.","No matter how Zhao Lin called or even pushed him hard several times, he didn’t react at all.","After about a quarter of an hour, the anxious look on Zhao Lin’s face gradually faded.","Instead, there was an icy look on his face.","He stood up straight and ordered outside: “Someone, come.”","Two members of the Phoenix Clan came in, one of them was Yan Zhu.","The two looked at Huang Yueli and Li Moying who were slumped at the table, and asked in a low voice: “Patriarch, is this considered...done?”","Zhao Lin nodded, “I finally took the bait... If I hadn’t gone crazy a few years ago and suffered internal injuries that haven’t healed yet, and these two god-level geniuses are a bit powerful, else I wouldn’t have had to put in such a big effort. Finally, everything is going well now, and it has not attracted Zhao Hua’s attention... ”","With that said, he turned to the two of them and ordered: “Take them down. However, you must be careful and don’t let Zhao Hua know. If he asks, you just say...that these two cultivators of the Ancient God Clan had something urgent and they’ve already gone back.”","Yan Zhu was stunned for a moment and hesitated, “But, Patriarch, this...will Young Master Zhao Hua will believe this? I think Young Master Zhao Hua has great trust in these two cultivators of the Ancient God Clan. Besides, Young Master Zhao Hua is now a spirit body and he can’t be away from its Master,","Young Miss Huang, for too long. If you tell such a lie...can he really believe it?”","“Believe it or not, it depends on what you say!”","Zhao Hua looked a little impatient and glanced at the two of them, “Zhao Hua has been away from the Phoenix Clan for a hundred thousand years. When he was in the family, he was still young and didn’t understand many things. You want to make up a few reasons? Tell him that it’s alright for the spirit body to leave its Master, will he still doubt it?”","Yan Zhu suddenly understood, nodded hurriedly, and agreed.","The two men hurried forward, dragging Huang Yueli and Li Moying outside.","But who would have thought that just as they dragged the person to the door, they heard a burst of urgent footsteps coming from outside.","“Female Devil, why did you drink until so late?”"]},{"number":4359,"title":"Chapter 4359: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Stop drinking, Female Devil, you can come out now! Haven’t you always told me that drinking too much is not good and that you need to exercise moderation?”","Little Wang Cai’s slightly childish voice came from the corridor.","For a moment, Yan Zhu and his companions were stunned on the spot, and even Zhao Lin himself was a little unable to recover.","“Damn it, why did Zhao Hua come here! Isn’t Yan Feng and the others watching him? How do these losers do things?”","Several people were stunned for a while, but it was too late to say anything at this time.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Little Wang Cai was already shouting loudly and rushing towards the room.","Zhao Lin reacted suddenly and rushed out of the door with a single step. He ducked along the corridor and just blocked Little Wang Cai who was running towards him.","Little Wang Cai was rushing inside like a small cannonball.","Suddenly, an obstacle appeared in front of him.","He couldn’t brake in time and bumped directly into Zhao Lin, causing his nose to turn red immediately.","“Ouch!! Who, who doesn’t have eyes and dares to block my way?”","Little Wang Cai covered his nose, his face turned red with anger, and he shouted loudly.","The corner of Zhao Lin’s mouth twitched and he coughed hard: “Zhao Hua, why are you here? Didn’t I tell you already? In order for your spirit body to become more solid in order to cope with the Nirvana Ceremony, you must practice well according to the training plan I gave you! If you don’t stay in your room to practice now, why are you running out? ”","When Little Wang Cai saw that it was his Eldest Brother, most of his arrogance was extinguished.","He was still a little afraid of this Big Brother who was very powerful in his memory.","“Uh...brother, I know you are doing it for my own good. But, I have completed today’s practice plan! Didn’t you also say that practice must be gradual, not just one-minded, but must be paced and have some relaxation mixed in? Since today’s plan has been completed, why should I stay in the room?”","Zhao Lin was obviously stunned for a moment, “What? You have already completed today’s training plan?!”","Little Wang Cai said this, which really surprised him!","Because, in order to hold the little guy back, he deliberately added about 50% of the content to the normal training plan, hoping that he could stay in the room and practice without being distracted by other issues.","But, even so, the little guy actually completed the plan so far ahead of schedule?","How was this possible?","Now that he was a spirit body, his cultivation speed should be far slower than that of a normal young Phoenix with a body!","Besides, in his impression, Zhao Hua did not have such an amazing talent.","What happened in these one hundred thousand years?","Little Wang Cai was completely unaware of his brother’s entanglement.","He nodded vigorously, “Yes, I’ve finished it! Alright, brother, get out of the way quickly, I’m going to see my Female Devil!”","“I am linked with her and I feel that there is something wrong with her. She must be secretly drinking behind my back. Humph! This woman is too much. She’s in charge of my affairs. She says that I’m not allowed to do this and that yet she can drink by herself! I want to expose her!”","As Little Wang Cai said this, he wanted to go around Zhao Lin.","But who would have expected that when he took a step with his short legs, he found that Zhao Lin also moved a step to the left.","It happened to be right in front of him.","Little Wang Cai ran several steps to the other side.","As a result, Zhao Lin’s long legs stepped to the right again, blocking his way.."]},{"number":4360,"title":"Chapter 4360: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Little Wang Cai ran left and right with his short legs, running until he was out of breath.","However, his brother only needed to move a few steps with his long legs to stop him easily.","Not long after, sweat broke out on Little Wang Cai’s forehead.","Seeing that he would definitely not be able to outrun his Big Brother, he simply stopped.","“Brother, get out of the way! You...why are you stopping me? Is my Female Devil already drunk?”","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Hearing that he seemed to have misunderstood, Zhao Lin followed suit and said with a straight face: “You are a child, so don’t worry about adults’ affairs. What does it matter if Miss Huang drinks a few sips of wine? She has already gone to rest with Young Master Li, don’t disturb others.”","“What? The Female Devil was really drinking behind my back, hum! Forget it, I will laugh at her again tomorrow!”","Little Wang Cai said, turned around and left.","Zhao Lin secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","But at this moment, the little guy suddenly turned around again, “Something’s wrong! I suddenly felt very panicked... Brother, will something happen to the Female Devil?”","Zhao Lin frowned, “You are thinking too much!”","“No, that’s not right! I didn’t think too much! I’m connected to the spirit of the Female Devil. I sensed when something happened to her. I can’t make a mistake! Brother, get out of the way!”","“Do you really want to...”","Before Zhao Lin could finish speaking, Little Wang Cai suddenly dodged and ran out from his side.","This time, Little Wang Cai used the secret skills of the Phoenix Clan that he had just learned, maximizing his speed.","Zhao Lin didn’t expect that he would be in such a panic and ran away before he finished speaking.","He was caught off guard and failed to stop him.","Zhao Lin reacted quickly and immediately chased after him.","However, this corridor was only a few metres long. As soon as Little Wang Cai ran behind Zhao Lin, he had already seen the situation at the door of the room.","He was startled and screamed, “Female Devil! Female Devil, how are you... how are you? You... you guys, what are you doing? Where are you dragging my Female Devil off to?! Let her go, let her go quickly!!”","Little Wang Cai suddenly jumped on Huang Yueli, grabbed her collar in tear, and shook her.","However, no matter how he shook her, Huang Yueli remained motionless.","When Yan Zhu and others saw this, they did not dare to force him away. They could only let go of Huang Yueli and Li Moying and stood aside with an awkward expression.","Zhao Lin followed closely and walked in.","“Zhao Hua...”","As soon as Little Wang Cai heard his brother’s voice, he immediately jumped up like a firecracker.","“Brother, what do you mean? Why did you make my Female Devil faint?! I thought you were different from those people who don’t know right from wrong! It turns out that you are just more insidious and secretly harmed the Female Devil and the others behind my back. I really misjudged you!”","His childish face was full of anger, his eyes were wide open, and he looked like he wanted to pounce on his brother and bite him to death.","Zhao Lin frowned, “Zhao Hua, there is a reason for this. Please listen to my explanation...”","“Explain it! You obviously did it on purpose! You said you wanted me to practice, were you lying to me? Just to get me away so you can attack the Female Devil! How many times have I said that the Female Devil is very good to me? Yes, they sent me back specifically to help me repair my body. They never meant to harm the Phoenix Clan! You didn’t listen to me at all!”","“No, that’s not the case, Zhao Hua, this matter is not as simple as you think....”"]},{"number":4361,"title":"Chapter 4361: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (7)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Zhao Lin still wanted to explain.","However, Little Wang Cai’s body has begun to glow with bursts of red light.","This was the sign that the Phoenix Clan was going to change back to its original form.","It was obvious that Little Wang Cai was not going to listen to Zhao Lin anymore and was preparing to restore his original body and take Huang Yueli and Li Moying away from Phoenix Tranquility Gorge.","When Zhao Lin saw this, a trace of panic flashed in his eyes.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","“Wait a minute, Zhao Hua, don’t do this! Although your current physical condition is relatively stable, it won’t last too long. You must complete the Nirvana ceremony as soon as possible. You can’t leave!”","Little Wang Cai said coldly: “I no longer believe what you say! Anyway, I have been fine for the past hundred thousand years, and I believe there will be no problems in the future!”","“No, this is not what you think...”","However, waves of heat swept over, and the rich fire energy quickly filled the entire room.","A pair of illusive huge wings even began to appear behind Little Wang Cai.","Zhao Lin quickly shouted: “What are you still doing? Stop him quickly!”","Yan Zhu and the others just woke up from their stupor and hurried over and held Little Wang Cai down.","Zhao Lin also used his skills to seal in all the fire energy around him.","Little Wang Cai was still very aggressive just now, but within a few breaths, he was pushed to the ground.","“Let me go! Let me go! You are all liars! Bad people! I will never trust you again!”","Unfortunately, no matter how hard he struggled and twisted, it had no effect.","Not to mention Zhao Lin, even Yan Zhu and others are adult Phoenixes with at least tens of thousands of years of life. Their magical power was boundless and cannot be resisted by Little Wang Cai.","If you really want to control him, it will be effortless.","Little Wang Cai struggled for a while before realizing this, and simply lay down on the ground and stopped moving.","He muttered: “If you want to kill the Female Devil, kill me first! Anyway, in your eyes, I am a person who has been dead for a hundred thousand years!”","“What are you talking about?!” Zhao Lin said angrily: “Stop spouting all these nonsense! If it weren’t for saving you, would I have had trouble with these two Ancient God Clans? You are not allowed to mention anything about death again!”","“Why are you trying to save me? I’m very well now! Don’t try to lie to me again!”","“You...!”","Zhao Lin almost fainted from his brother’s stubborn words and expressions.","“Alright, in that case, I’ll just say it! Let him go!”","“But, Patriarch, I’m afraid that Young Master Zhao Hua will run away directly...” Yan Zhu was a little worried.","Zhao Lin raised his lips coldly, “Don’t worry, as long as that Miss Huang is still here, this brat can’t escape!”","Yan Zhu let go of his hand.","Little Wang Cai jumped up from the ground immediately and glared at his brother, “Hurry up! I want to hear what reasons you can make up!”","Zhao Lin glanced at him and said, “Alright, then I will tell you that your spirit body was sealed into the Sky Phoenix Ring. Although this rare treasure stabilised your spirit body which is why your spirit body has not dissipated after a hundred thousand years. However, this also has disadvantages. That is...your spirit body has been completely integrated with the Sky Phoenix Ring. Unless the Sky Phoenix Ring is destroyed, your spirit body cannot be separated, let alone reshape the physical body!”","Little Wang Cai’s eyes widened in shock, “What are you talking about?! But the Sky Phoenix Ring is now in the soul of my Female Devil, and she can’t get it out, and there’s no way to destroy it?”","Halfway through his words, he raised his head and met Zhao Lin’s cold and meaningful gaze.","Suddenly, an epiphany flashed in his mind and his heart tightened at once.."]},{"number":4362,"title":"Chapter 4362: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (8)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Could it be...could it be that...you want to deal with the Female Devil...” Little Wang Cai opened his mouth and his face was pale.","“Don’t tell me that you want to kill the Female Devil and destroy the Sky Phoenix Ring by force, do you?”","When Zhao Lin saw this, he still felt sorry for his brother, so he walked over and wanted to pick him up.","“Zhao Hua, this was a last resort! I am your brother, so of course I can only take care of you! Anyway, there has always been a blood feud between the","Sacred Phoenix Clan and our Phoenix Clan. If anyone from the Sacred Phoenix Clan dared to break into Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, it would have been a crime that warrants death!”","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Although Zhao Lin did not directly answer Little Wang Cai’s words, the implication was that he had already acquiesced in the little guy’s guess.","Little Wang Cai suddenly turned red with anger, “Brother, I really didn’t expect you to be such a cold-blooded person! I misjudged you! I’m not as selfish as you, I will be sealed in the Sky Phoenix Ring , it has nothing to do with the","Female Devil! If it weren’t for me, would she have come to Phoenix Tranquility","Gorge? If you want to kill her, kill me first!”","“Zhao Hua, please be sensible! There are only a few people left in the Phoenix Clan. You can no longer joke with your own life...”","“I don’t care! Even if the Phoenix Clan was really extinct, what does it have to do with me? Anyway, I’m a spirit and I’ve already died once!”","“You...! Are you saying this to make your brother die of anger?”","Zhao Hua’s face suddenly turned pale, his chest heaved violently, and he was obviously very angry.","“I.” Little Wang Cai couldn’t bear it when he saw this, and lowered his voice a little, “If you didn’t do such a cold-blooded thing, how could I be angry with you?”","The little guy gritted his teeth and said, “Forget it, if I have to risk the life of the Female Devil to get my body back, then I would rather stay as I am now. Please wake up the Female Devil quickly, and we will leave immediately...","“No! Impossible!”","Zhao Lin refused coldly: “I can’t possibly watch you fool around like this!”","“Then don’t blame me...”","Seeing that the two brothers were about to fight.","Suddenly, a voice came from behind the two of them: “So, this was why you secretly drugged me and my husband’s wine?”","This voice was soft and sweet, neither slow nor fast, especially pleasant to the ear.","However, Zhao Lin and Zhao Hua were both startled and turned around in a hurry.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were seen getting up at some point, while Yan Zhu, who was originally responsible for guarding the two of them, fell to the ground, his meridians being restrained and unable to move.","Zhao Lin became alert, and his body emitted strong fluctuations of profound energy.","“You...when did you wake up?”","Huang Yueli smiled and said disapprovingly: “To be precise, I was not stunned by you in the first place. I have been doubting you for a long time. After all, your clan hates the Ancient God Clan so much. As the leader of the clan, you, on the contrary, would be so enthusiastic about us, even if it’s because of Zhao Hua’s relationship. I found this point rather intriguing.”","“When you were toasting to us just now, I was observing you and found that you just raised the glass and took a sip without drinking it. I knew something was wrong, so I didn’t drink the wine you handed me.”","Zhao Lin’s eyes widened in shock, “So... so you were just pretending? How...","how is that possible?”","Huang Yueli said: “How is this impossible?”","Zhao Lin looked at the two of them in disbelief, with a layer of anger gradually appearing in his eyes, “Very good, I have indeed underestimated you.. The Ancient God Clans are indeed more sinister and cunning than the others!”"]},{"number":4363,"title":"Chapter 4363: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (9)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but laugh, “What you said was so interesting. We didn’t do anything, so why are we so cunning? It’s obvious that you secretly drugged the guests, but you have a vicious intention this time!”","“You...”","Zhao Lin was blocked by her and couldn’t say anything to refute for a while.","After a while, he gritted his teeth and said: “I can’t defeat you Ancient Gol","Clans! But, even if you know my plan, so what? There are more than a hundred Phoenixes in Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, each of which was at least equivalent to the strength of the Dao Profound Realm cultivators of the Ancient God","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Clans, you still want to escape from here?”","When Huang Yueli heard the words, she lowered her eyes slightly.","Zhao Lin’s words were not wrong. This was exactly what she was most worried about.","However, she did not show her inner doubts on her face, and she still had a calm expression.","“So, in your opinion, I should just surrender and let you kill me, right?”","Zhao Lin smiled coldly, “You can’t say that. I know that you have a very good relationship with Zhao Hua. You have heard what Zhao Hua just said. He will fight to the death to protect you, even at the expense of my brother. Fall out! He was sincere to you, so why can’t you sacrifice for him? ”","“Brother! You...what are you talking about? Shut up!”","Zhao Lin narrowed his eyes, suddenly raised his hand and pressed it on Little Wang Cai’s chest. He didn’t know how to control the little guy’s meridians. He could only sit on the ground, eyes wide open and worried, but unable to move or even say a word.","Zhao Lin looked at Huang Yueli again, “How is it? Have you thought about it? Since you and Zhao Hua have a good relationship, it shouldn’t be difficult to sacrifice for him, right? Or... you just treat my brother as a pet? Have you never regarded him as a true companion? ‘","“Ughhh!!” Little Wang Cai was struggling on the ground.","However, he was completely ignored by his brother.","Zhao Lin stared at Huang Yueli with his eyes, and a mocking smile appeared at the corner of his mouth.","“What do you mean by this?”","Li Moying, who had been standing behind Huang Yueli and silently guarding her, couldn’t bear it after hearing this.","He walked around in front of Huang Yueli in a few steps and protected her behind him. His aura continued to rise.","Huang Yueli quickly grabbed his sleeve.","“Moying, don’t be impatient, wait until I finish speaking.”","She raised her head and looked directly at Zhao Lin, “If sacrificing my life can really save Zhao Hua, I don’t have any objection. However, what you just said was clearly deceiving your brother. It was not what you said at all!”","Upon hearing this, Zhao Lin’s pupils shrank suddenly, his jaw tightened, and a look of astonishment appeared on his face.","However, he quickly calmed down and put on a nonchalant expression again.","“Haha, interesting! Why should I lie to my brother? The truth was the truth! If you are selfish and don’t want to sacrifice for my brother, then just say it and stop making excuses for yourself!”","Huang Yueli continued speaking as if she hadn’t heard what he said.","“...Although Zhao Hua stays in the Sky Phoenix Ring in the form of a spiritual body, it is different from ordinary Artifact Spirits. He was sealed into it by his very own brother, and not like how Spirit Armament Masters refine a Spirit Armament by putting the seal in the midst of forging. I don’t believe that, as his brother, you have never considered how to let him escape in the future..”"]},{"number":4364,"title":"Chapter 4364: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4364: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“So, at least at the beginning, you were sure that Zhao Hua’s spirit body would escape from the Sky Phoenix Ring intact at the right time. However, you didn’t expect that the Sky Phoenix Ring would suddenly disappear and you would find it again. At that time, one hundred thousand years passed, and too many changes happened in the meantime.”","“The most important change was that the Sky Phoenix Ring, who was originally just a fragment, was actually repaired by me. Moreover, during the repair process, he was combined with my soul...”","When Huang Yueli said this, she paused deliberately and raised her gaze to look at Zhao Lin.","Zhao Lin’s face was as heavy as water, he narrowed his eyes and said nothing.","Huang Yueli was not afraid at all, with a smile on his lips, “So, Zhao Hua’s spirit body has already fused part of my soul. If he was reborn in this state, he will be. It always carries the mark of my soul, which means... the contract between us will always exist. Moreover, this contract is more powerful than the ordinary spirit beast contract. No matter how far apart we are, we will be affected by the contract.”","“So, if you want Zhao Hua to get rid of this contract, get rid of me, and become a truly free agent, the only way is to kill me!”","“How’s it going? Am I right?”","Huang Yueli finished speaking slowly and then st0DDed.","Zhao Lin’s expression turned extremely ugly.","He could no longer maintain the elegant and arrogant demeanour of a noble son, and stared at Huang Yueli fiercely, gritting his teeth.","“As expected of the insidious and cunning Ancient God Clan!”","“Then I guessed it right.” Huang Yueli smiled sarcastically, “You always despise the Ancient God Clans, but I think your approach was not very upright, right?”","“Hmph, no matter what I do, I am much better than you Ancient God Clans! Since you have guessed it, then I have nothing to defend. You can’t escape anyway, so just stay here and wait until the day of the Nirvana Ceremony, which is also the day you die!”","Speaking of which, Zhao Lin’s purpose has been completely exposed.","He simply broke his skin, sneered, turned around and ordered Yan Zhu and others, “Alright, take them down here!”","Yan Zhu hesitated for a moment, “But, Patriarch, look at Young Master Zhao","Hua...”","Little Wang Cai blocked Huang Yueli and Li Moying, refusing to let go.","“Zhao Hua, get out of my way! You’ve heard it, brother was doing it for your own good!” Zhao Lin stretched out his hand to pull Little Wang Cai over.","However, Little Wang Cai dodged.","At the same time, two small hands tightly hugged Huang Yueli’s thighs, refusing to let go no matter what.","“No, you are not doing it for my own good at all! What you just said are all excuses! Even if the Female Devil does not die, I can be reborn in Nirvana, but you want to kill her just for the contract between us? Brother, how can you be so cruel? ! It’s terribly scary!”","“Am I scary?!”","Zhao Lin didn’t expect that his brother would understand his hard work like this.","He almost fainted from anger on the spot.","Little Wang Cai looked stubborn, “Aren’t you scary? It’s just a contract, it’s not the Female Devil who forced me! Why do you kill her?”","“What do you know? Do you think this was just a contract?” Zhao Lin laughed angrily, “With this contract, you will be controlled by this little girl for the rest of your life! If she wants to harm you, it won’t take any effort at all! You will definitely die in her hands!”"]},{"number":4365,"title":"Chapter 4365: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (11)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4365: One Hundred Thousand Years Ago (11)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Brother, what are you talking about? How could the Female Devil harm me?!","You are thinking too much!”","Little Wang Cai didn’t believe such nonsense at all.","Huang Yueli also looked surprised and interjected: “Lord Zhao Lin, what you said is going too far. How could I possibly kill my partner?”","“Stop quibbling here!”","Zhao Lin turned around and interrupted her unceremoniously.","“Don’t I understand your Sacred Phoenix Clan? Every one of them was a hypocritical and shameless person! They pretend to be kind on the surface, but in fact they are full of conspiracies! If not for this, we Phoenix Clan would not have fallen into the trap a hundred thousand years ago and be reduced to such a point!”","Upon hearing this, Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment.","“One hundred thousand years ago? What do you mean? What happened one hundred thousand years ago?”","Zhao Lin glanced at her coldly, “Stop pretending! You are a god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, how could you not know what happened a hundred thousand years ago?”","“But, I really don’t know!”","Huang Yueli frowned, remembering that this was not the first time she heard Zhao Lin and other Phoenix say this.","When she and Li Moying entered the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, they were besieged by the Phoenixes because of their status as gods.","One hundred thousand years ago, something very serious must have happened!","Thinking of this, she hurriedly asked: “Lord Zhao Lin, I am not pretending, I really don’t know. I ascended from the lower world to the God Realm, and it has only been a few months since I returned to the clan...”","“Haha, alright, since you insist on saying that you don’t know, then I will tell you! I want to see if there is any way you can clear the name of the Sacred","Phoenix Clan!”","Zhao Lin sneered and simply sat down.","After looking at Little Wang Cai, he recalled, “One hundred thousand years ago, our Phoenix Clan did not live in Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, but on a volcano not far from the twelve continents of the God Clan, where the fire-attribute profound power was even stronger. It’s abundant, and the environment was open, with many spiritual beasts living around it.”","“At that time, our clan had more people, and there were at least a thousand Phoenixes.”","“The Phoenix Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan have always been inextricably linked. Occasionally, there will be cultivators from the Sacred Phoenix Clan who can be recognized by the young Phoenix in our clan. The two parties sign a contract and become life and death partners. Not only that, Our entire Phoenix Clan regards the Sacred Phoenix Clan as our good friends. Our territorv never lets humans or gods enter, but when the Sacred Phoenix Clan comes over, we will warmly entertain them.”","“But... ”","He paused for a moment, looked at Huang Yueli, and said word by word. “None of our clan expected that one day our good friend would swing his knife directly over our heads!”","Huang Yueli had actually guessed something.","However, she was still shocked when she heard these cold words coming from Zhao Lin’s mouth!","Zhao Lin said: “That day, the Patriarch at that time summoned the clan members and said that the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan had arrived in person and brought a group of young cultivators with him, hoping to come to our place for some experience. Everyone was very happy and welcomed them warmly. But who would have thought that when night fell, these friends who were still chatting with us during the day actually attacked us secretly, seriously injured all our clansmen, and forced us to sign a contract with them!”","“Some clansmen refused to accept it, and they were hacked to death on the spot. They also collected blood, feathers, and even... internal organs! They said they were going to be used to refine elixirs!”","“That night, the Phoenix Clan’s home became a sea of blood!”"]},{"number":4366,"title":"Chapter 4366: Huang Yueli...must die! (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4366: Huang Yueli...must die! (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Zhao Lin’s tone was actually very calm, and he did not speak fast.","However, every word he said was so thrilling and impactful.","In his unhurried narration, Huang Yueli seemed to have witnessed the tragedy that happened to the Phoenix Clan a hundred thousand years ago.","The friend whom he once trusted the most suddenly wielded a knife against him for his own benefit.","The once peaceful and peaceful home was destroyed, the clansmen were massacred, and even brutally abused...","The friendship accumulated over hundreds of thousands of years was shattered in an instant, and the entire Phoenix family paid an unbearable price for this...","One hundred thousand years of history was too long.","Among the Phoenixes currently living in Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, Zhao Lin was probably the only one left who has experienced that dark night.","Not only did Zhao Lin witness all this, he protected his younger brother and fled away, but he also saw his younger brother being killed, leaving only his spirit body behind.","Huang Yueli couldn’t even imagine how this would feel.","If it were her, I’m afraid she wouldn’t be able to bear it at that time. She must fight to the death to avenge the enemy. Even if she can’t kill the top masters of the enemy force, she must kill the ordinary clansmen and let them pay with blood!","From this perspective, it was completely normal for Zhao Lin to want to kill her.","There was no expression on Zhao Lin’s face, only his increasingly cold eyes reflected the hatred in his heart.","His eyes swept across Huang Yueli’s face and continued: “Zhao Hua’s father and I were the leaders of the Phoenix Clan at the time. He tried his best to block the enemy and made me take my brother to escape. I watched my parents die with my own eyes. In front of me... But I don’t have time to cry because my brother was still so young and I have to protect him...”","“However, in the end, I couldn’t even protect Zhao Hua. Although I barely saved his spirit body and sealed him into the Sky Phoenix Ring, I myself was severely injured by the elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. And in that chaos, even the Sky Phoenix Ring was also lost.”","“It’s been a hundred thousand years, and I still wake up from the nightmare that night each night...”","Huang Yueli remained silent.","Even she didn’t know what to say.","The Ancestor of the Sacred Phoenix Clan did indeed do a wrong thing that was outrageous and unjust, and there was no room for excuse.","With a “boo hoo” sound, Little Wang Cai burst into tears and threw himself into Zhao Lin’s arms.","“Brother...boo hoo hoo, I remember! It was so dark and scary that night...a lot of blood...boo hoo hoo...","After hearing Zhao Lin’s narration, the vague details in Little Wang Cai’s mind became clear little by little.","The suffocating darkness and fear at that time also returned to his memory.","For a moment, he seemed to have turned back into the little Phoenix cub hiding in his brother’s arms and shivering.","Zhao Lin hugged Little Wang Cai tightly, his eyes filled with sadness.","Little Wang Cai started crying regardless.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly but said nothing.","Li Moying knew that she was in a complicated mood, so he reached out and held her white little hand in his palm.","The man’s scorching body temperature made Huang Yueli gradually calm down, and her body involuntarily leaned towards Li Moying.","After half an hour, the crying Little Wang Cai gradually became calmer.","However, he still grabbed his brother’s sleeve and kept sobbing.","“It’s so terrible...my parents and clan members all died miserably...oooh...hiccup!”","Zhao Lin touched his little head, and a cold glint flashed by his eyes, “In order to avenge his clan, Huang Yueli.... must die!”"]},{"number":4367,"title":"Chapter 4367: Huang Yueli...Must Die! (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4367: Huang Yueli...Must Die! (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing this, Little Wang Cai, who had been burying his head in his brother’s arms just now, was suddenly startled.","The little body trembled, and the little head suddenly raised.","“Brother...brother, what did you say? Why do you still want to kill the Female Devil?”","Zhao Lin said coldly: “Didn’t I tell you just now? The hatred between us and the Sacred Phoenix Clan will never end! I have sworn a long time ago that in my lifetime, as long as I see a cultivator from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, I will not let one go, I will kill each one I see!”","“You...brother, how could you do this?! The Female Devil has no enmity against us...”","Zhao Lin had a look of hatred on his face, “Did everything I just said was in vain? Have you forgotten how those clan members died?”","Little Wang Cai was speechless. Facing the angry Zhao Lin, he was obviously a little scared.","However, for the sake of his Female Devil, he still mustered up the courage and continued to argue: “But what happened a hundred thousand years ago, what does it have to do with the Female Devil? Moreover, she’s kind to me...","“Haha, are you kind? Don’t be too naive! If you, as an Artifact Spirit, could not enhance her strength, would she be so kind to you? Besides, why does what happened a hundred thousand years ago have nothing to do with her? As long as she has something to do with the blood of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! Besides, from the aura emanating from her body, it seems that she has also received the blood core initiation, right? Where did those blood cores come from, have you ever thought about it?!”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was shocked.","Even she herself had never thought about this.","The blood cores used by the major ancient gods to perform blood core initiation ceremonies are all from the condensed crystal nuclei in the bodies of ancient divine beasts. After the death of the divine beasts, they are taken out from their corpses and retained.","However, no one can tell whether these mythical beasts died naturally or were hunted by the Ancient God Clans.","Combined with the massacre Zhao Lin mentioned just now, she has reason to believe that at least these Phoenix blood cores of the Sacred Phoenix Clan are stained with the blood of the Phoenix Clan...","Little Wang Cai also fell silent.","Zhao Lin glanced at him sideways and curled his lips coldly, “How are you? Are you calm now? Are you awake? You have to remember that only your clan was your strong backing. Those Ancient God Clans and Devil Clans are all insidious and cunning. I can’t believe them at all! Come on, come here!”","Little Wang Cai lowered his head and did not refute his brother’s words, nor could he.","However, his feet seemed to have taken root, and he refused to move even a step, still blocking Huang Yueli.","Zhao Lin also lost his patience, raised his eyebrows, and shouted sternly:","“Come here! Do you hear me?”","Little Wang Cai was obviously frightened, and his face turned pale.","He hesitated for a while, then slowly moved his steps and walked towards Zhao Lin.","The anger on Zhao Lin’s face subsided a little. His dark eyes were deep as he watched Little Wang Cai move little by little, but did not urge him.","Little Wang Cai moved very slowly. Every step he took, there was a very tangled look on his face, as if he was struggling painfully in his heart.","Just when he was about three metres away from Zhao Lin, his footsteps suddenly stopped.","Zhao Lin waited for a while, and when he saw that he was motionless, he couldn’t help but say: “What are you waiting for? Come here quickly! Do you hear me?”","Little Wang Cai suddenly gritted his teeth, raised his legs again, and took a few steps forward.","Seeing that Little Wang Cai had already walked up to him, Zhao Lin showed a happy smile on his face.","“That’s good...”","As soon as he opened his mouth, something unexpected happened!"]},{"number":4368,"title":"Chapter 4368: Huang Yueli...Must Die! (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4368: Huang Yueli...Must Die! (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Little Wang Cai walked in front of him, and when he was only three steps away, his aura suddenly exploded!","Incomparably pure fire attribute energy suddenly surged out of the small body.","Rays of golden light lit up around him, surrounding him.","The energy quickly condensed on his body, and this energy, which had just been formed and was not yet stable, did not stop for a moment, but directly bombarded Zhao Lin’s chest!","A hint of astonishment suddenly flashed across Zhao Lin’s eyes.","He never imagined that his brother, the only relative in the world, would actually take action against him.","Moreover, he still burned the remaining spiritual power in his spirit body without any reservation.","The fire attribute energy hit Zhao Lin’s chest, causing him to groan, cover his chest, and take a few steps back.","Little Wang Cai succeeded in the sneak attack, his eyes suddenly brightened, and he shouted loudly: “Female Devil, take the Big Devil away quickly! I have seen the map here, just keep running along the path to the west, there was a slope at the end of the run. If you go down there, even if you can’t fly, you won’t die based on your strength!”","When Little Wang Cai approached Zhao Lin just now, Huang Yueli had already guessed his intention.","Now when she heard this, she and Li Moying immediately became depressed, turned around and ran away.","This may be their only chance to escape from Phoenix Tranquility Gorge.","The opportunity that Little Wang Cai finally got for them must not be wasted.","Both of them were good at agility and movement skills, hence they were extremely fast. In just a few flashes, they had already rushed to the end of the corridor.","Seeing that the two of them were about to escape from the courtyard gate, Zhao Lin also reacted from his shock.","He pushed Little Wang Cai away.","The Phoenix Divine Beast, which has been cultivated for 100,000 years, was by no means comparable to the strength of a small person like Wang Cai. He was able to succeed just now, all thanks to a sneak attack.","Now that Zhao Lin was getting serious, the little guy tried his best to block him, but he couldn’t even hold on for a breath.","Little Wang Cai stumbled to one side.","“Damn! Stop right there!”","The momentum around Zhao Lin surged, the surrounding air became burning in an instant, and the clouds in the air were quickly dyed blood red.","The movements of Huang Yueli and Li Moying immediately became much slower.","Under the full pressure unleashed by the adult Phoenix Divine Beast, even a god-level genius cannot compete with it.","Li Moying’s breath was stagnant, and his first reaction was to pull the girl next to him behind him, trying to protect her with all his strength. However, Huang Yueli was unwilling to hide behind him.","“Let me go!”","“Little Li’er, hurry up and leave! If Zhao Lin catches you, you will die!” Li Moying was furious.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips.","Just because she would die, she couldn’t let Li Moying face it alone.","Even if her life was lost here today, she will fight side by side with Li Moying.","It was too late for her to say anything more.","Because Zhao Lin’s powerful offensive was already approaching the two of them.","Although they had responded with all their strength, under such a powerful impact, blood began to flow from the corners of Huang Yueli’s mouth.","“Little...Little Li’er...”","Li Moying wanted to protect her, but the pressure he was under was actually greater than that of Huang Yueli, and he had no energy left to escape.","Zhao Lin’s face was full of stern expression, and a cruel sneer appeared at the corner of his mouth.","“I wanted to kill you while you were in a coma, so that you could at least suffer less. It was also a reward for your kindness to Zhao Hua..”"]},{"number":4369,"title":"Chapter 4369: Huang Yueli...Must Die! (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4369: Huang Yueli...Must Die! (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“However, you are so smart that you don’t drink that cup of drugged wine and you will suffer the consequences yourself. You can’t blame me for that!” As he spoke, the fire attribute energy he controlled surged again.","“Ughh...!”","A groan escaped from Huang Yueli’s mouth.","“Little Li’er...!”","When Li Moying saw the painful look on Huang Yueli’s face, she couldn’t care less about anything and immediately rushed over.","Even if he could only let Huang Yueli live a few more breaths at all costs, he was not willing to let her get hurt at all.","At least, he must protect her while he was alive!","“You...!”","Huang Yueli was connected with him and knew what he was thinking, and her expression suddenly changed.","Zhao Lin curled his lips with unclear meaning, “It’s true that we are deeply affectionate, so whatever, I will help you and become a pair of mandarin ducks with the same destiny...”","Before he finished speaking, his pupils suddenly shrank.","A small red figure suddenly jumped out from the corner.","He jumped directly in front of Huang Yueli and Li Moying, just blocking the last burst of spiritual power he blasted towards them.","The small figure obviously couldn’t withstand such fierce and powerful force. It only shook slightly, like a kite with a broken string, flying out crookedly.","Zhao Lin originally thought that the attack just now would severely damage these two annoying gods, making them lose the ability to resist and have no choice but to be at his mercy.","Unexpectedly, Little Wang Cai would suddenly rush out and use his own body to block it!","Zhao Lin froze on the spot. After a few breaths, he suddenly woke up and immediately rushed towards the direction where Little Wang Cai landed. “Zhao Hua, Zhao Hua, how are you? Wake up, wake up!”","Little Wang Cai’s frail little body collapsed on the ground, with no trace of blood on his face and his eyes closed tightly, looking as if he was dead.","Zhao Lin was panicked and felt horrified. He quickly stretched out his hand to check the little guy’s pulse and explore the situation inside his body.","However, the moment he put his hand on Little Wang Cai’s wrist, he was suddenly shocked, as if being burned by fire, and let go of his hand.","“Damn it!!”","Zhao Lin didn’t feel his meridians.","Only then did he remember that Little Wang Cai was not actually a real Phoenix, but now only existed in the form of a spirit body!","Although the spiritual power in his body was solidified and he usually looks like an ordinary Phoenix child, this does not change the fact that he was a spirit body.","Therefore, he has no pulse and no meridians.","Once he was hit by strong energy, a physical body cannot be damaged, but the spirit body...","Thinking of this, Zhao Lin quickly lowered his head and immediately discovered with horror that Little Wang Cai’s body was becoming transparent at a speed visible to the naked eye.","This was exactly the sign that his spirit body was weakening rapidly!","If the spirit body becomes completely transparent, it will completely dissipate and will no longer be able to condense!","That was the real death, and there was no possibility of rebirth.","“Zhao Hua, Zhao Hua! Damn it! You can’t do this, hold on! You must hold on!”","Zhao Lin never expected that Little Wang Cai would risk his life to save Huang Yueli, someone from the Ancient God Clan.","Now, it was too late to say anything. He grabbed Little Wang Cai’s body, pressed his hand on his chest, and frantically injected spiritual power into his body.","Zhao Lin’s spiritual power was very powerful, but the changes in Little Wang","Cai’s body still did not stop, but were slightly delayed.","If this continues, he will completely dissipate in less than two hours.","Zhao Lin was so anxious that his eyes were red, but there was nothing he could do.."]},{"number":4370,"title":"Chapter 4370 Nirvana and Rebirth (1)","paragraphs":["\"Wang Cai, how are you?!\"","Suddenly, a clear female voice sounded above his head.","Zhao Lin was stunned for a moment, almost unable to recover.","When he looked up, he saw Huang Yueli's fair and delicate face.","Her face was full of anxiety and nervousness, and she seemed completely unaware of Zhao Lin's surprised gaze. She squatted down directly and threw herself on Little Wang Cai.","\"Wake up quickly! What's going on? Where's he injured?\"","Huang Yueli patted Wang Cai's chubby face and found that he didn't respond, so she immediately turned to ask Zhao Lin.","Zhao Lin said in a daze: \"He...his spirit body was seriously damaged...\"","\"Sure enough, his spiritual body was damaged! I see that his spiritual power is draining very quickly. What should I do? Is there any way to cure it?\"","Huang Yueli asked nervously.","Zhao Lin calmed down a little and shook his head, \"There's nothing , even I have no ideas...\"","\"How could you have no ideas? Aren't you the leader of the Phoenix Clan and have lived for a hundred thousand years? Your Phoenix Clan can survive in the spirit state. You should be very experienced. How could you not be able to save him!\"","\"This...I...\"","Zhao Lin was questioned by her and was rendered speechless.","Huang Yueli stood up immediately and shouted to Yan Zhu and others who were at a loss behind him: \"What are you doing here? Don't you Phoenix Clan have a doctor? Hurry up and find someone!\"","\"Oh, yes, yes...\"","Yan Zhu and others reacted, turned around hurriedly, and ran to find someone.","Only then did Zhao Lin realise that something was not quite right.","Why did Huang Yueli appear here? Did she run back by herself?","His brother himself fell under his attack, wasn't it just to save this little girl's life?","If she didn't take the opportunity to escape quickly, why would she come back?","There are also Yan Zhu and the others. He, the Patriarch, hasn't spoken yet, but with just a few words from that little girl, they are obedient and obeyed?","??What was this... exactly?","Before he could say anything, Huang Yueli glared at him again.","\"And you! Why are you in such a daze? Can't you see that Wang Cai is about to die? Hurry up and inject spiritual power into him! Otherwise, he won't last long!\"","Huang Yueli looked at Zhao Lin and was still in a daze, and suddenly became very angry.","It's a pity that she only has profound power in her body, and spiritual power was unique to these ancient beasts. Otherwise, she wouldn't have to wait for these stupid Phoenixes to take action.","She has been following Li Moying for a long time, and her momentum was gradually getting closer to him, becoming more and more powerful.","It was not obvious at ordinary times, but at this critical moment, the pressure on her suddenly broke out.","Even Zhao Lin subconsciously obeyed her order, immediately lowered his head, pressed down on Little Wang Cai's chest, and continued to inject spiritual energy into his body.","Seeing that Little Wang Cai's situation was a little more stable, Huang Yueli breathed a sigh of relief.","Li Moying stood behind her and said nothing.","However, he was completely on alert at this time, with all the profound energy in his body concentrated towards his Dantian. His right hand was gently resting on the hilt of the sword, ready to take action at any time.","His Little Li'er chose to run back to save people. He couldn't stop her, and he wouldn't stop her.","Little Wang Cai also saved his and Huang Yueli's lives several times!","However, he would never allow Zhao Lin to hurt her.","Fortunately, Zhao Lin was now focused on his brother's injury and had no intention of taking action against them."]},{"number":4371,"title":"Chapter 4371 Nirvana and Rebirth (2)","paragraphs":["Not long after, an old man with white hair rushed in.","Li Moying couldn't help but look at him one more time.","The Phoenix Clan has an extremely long lifespan, and old people like this were very rare.","It seems that he was older than Zhao Lin.","The old man came to Little Wang Cai's side, lowered his head and inspected it for a while, and pondered without speaking.","\"What happened to him?\"","\"What's going on? Tell me quickly!\"","Huang Yueli and Zhao Lin urged each other almost at the same time.","The old man looked a little embarrassed. He looked at Huang Yueli, then turned to Zhao Lin and said: \" Patriarch, this...can you ask Young Miss Huang to avoid it...\"","Zhao Lin was shocked.","He was so anxious that he lost his mind just now. Only then did he realise that Huang Yueli and Li Moying were in the room the whole time.","They didn't leave!","Zhao Lin's eyes suddenly narrowed, \"You ...\"","He just stood up when Huang Yueli interrupted him impatiently.","\"Alright, what kind of a situation is this now, and you still talk about avoiding! Come on, tell me how to save Wang...Zhao Hua! I have reason to believe that if you want to save him, you will definitely need my cooperation.\"","As Little Wang Cai's contract partner, her soul has even been fused with the Sky Phoenix Ring.","Little Wang Cai's spirit body has an extremely close connection with her.","No matter what method was used to treat Little Wang Cai, it was impossible to break away from her.","This was why her first reaction was to run back to Little Wang Cai.","Because the farther the spirit body was from the host, the weaker the energy of the spirit body was.","When Little Wang Cai was seriously injured, if she escaped with the Sky Phoenix Ring, as long as the distance between the two was more than ten miles, Little Wang Cai would die on the spot, and he would not be able to be saved no matter what.","The old man hesitated.","Zhao Lin gritted his teeth, \"Alright, tell me! What's going on?\"","The old man then said: \"Master Zhao Hua's spiritual body was severely damaged and should have disappeared directly. The reason why it can persist until now was that, on the one hand, you, the Patriarch, injected spiritual energy into him, but the more important reason is that he is now the Sky Phoenix Ring's Artifact Spirit! The Sky Phoenix Ring is so powerful that it greatly buffered the trauma it suffered and stabilised his spirit body.\"","\"However, all this was only temporary. I believe you can see it, Patriarch. As long as you stop inputting spiritual energy, his spiritual body will gradually weaken...\"","\"I know!\"","Zhao Lin said impatiently: \"Let's get straight to the point. How can we save him?\"","The old man glanced at Huang Yueli again and said: \"The only way now was to perform a Nirvana Ceremony for Master Zhao Hua while his spirit body can still barely hold on! If he can successfully reshape his physical body, then his spirit body will be able to stabilise, and although his strength will regress, given time, he can still cultivate again.\"","\"This...\" Zhao Lin couldn't help but be startled.","\"What's with the fuss? Hold a Nirvana ceremony for him immediately!\" Huang Yueli stepped in, \"I remember you said yesterday that you have all the materials and manpower needed for the Nirvana Ceremony! So what are you waiting for?!\"","The old man looked like he was hesitant to speak.","Zhao Lin's face also became very ugly. He frowned and stared at Huang Yueli for a while before saying, \"Things are not as simple as you think. Do you think...\"","\"What is it?\" Huang Yueli was confused.","Zhao Lin pursed his lips, \"Are you willing to save my brother at all costs?\""]},{"number":4372,"title":"Chapter 4372 Nirvana Rebirth (3)","paragraphs":["\"Of course! I'm willing...\"","Huang Yueli blurted out.","However, she was interrupted halfway.","\"She doesn't want to.\"","Huang Yueli was startled and suddenly a strong force came from her wrist as she was pulled behind by Li Moying.","Li Moying's handsome face was filled with coldness as he repeated word by word,\"She. Doesn't. Want. To!\"","\"Zhao Lin, you asked for everything today! If it wasn't for you scheming against us, your little brother wouldn't have suffered such heavy injuries in order to protect Little Li'er! The person who injured him was you! In the end, this is all your own responsibility. What right do you have to let Little Li'er save him?\"","\"Moreover, you want her to do it at all costs? Do you really think we're stupid?\"","Li Moying's voice was cold and deep as a cold glint flashed in his eyes.","The Profound Energy pressure in his body was gradually released.","His right hand was on the hilt of his sword at his waist, ready to fight at any time.","When Huang Yueli heard this, she subconsciously said, \"Moying, you can't say that. Wang Cai was injured because he was protecting me. I can't...\"","\"Keep quiet!\"","Li Moying said in a chilly tone as he turned to glare at her.","Huang Yueli's words were stuck in her throat.","Li Moying had always been obedient to her and no matter how cold and strict he was to outsiders, he was always very gentle to her.","He rarely spoke to her in such a tone.","Just as she was in a daze, Li Moying had already turned towards Zhao Lin once again,\" No matter what idea you have up your sleeves, I won't let Little Li'er take the risk. Let's go!\"","His strong and powerful arm locked onto Huang Yueli's slender waist and with a forceful pull, he pulled her into his embrace.","Then, he used his movement mystic skill and was about to leave.","Huang Yueli regained her senses as she struggled in his embrace,\" Moying, Moying, listen to me, you... Let go of me first. We can't leave like this...\"","She was extremely anxious, and her eyes were a little red.","It wasn't that she didn't know of Li Moying's determination to protect her, but she also understood that if they didn't take this chance to leave when Zhao Lin was flustered, they really wouldn't be able to escape from the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge.","However, when she thought about how Little Wang Cai was injured in order to save her, her spirit body was about to dissipate...","If she left just like that, she would probably have a guilty conscience for the rest of her life!","However, Li Moying had long expected that she wouldn't listen to him so when she wasn't on guard earlier, he had already restrained her meridians.","Huang Yueli's Profound Energy was restricted so she couldn't contend against Li Moying and could only be carried away by him.","That stance was no different from a tyrant snatching a commoner girl.","Li Moying knew that the possibility of them escaping was very low so from the very beginning, he had already used all his strength to burn a portion of his life's blood essence to increase his speed.","In just the blink of an eye, they had already moved over a thousand meters.","Only then did Zhao Lin react and realize that the two of them had already run away.","He wanted to chase after it, but with Little Wang Cai's current situation, he could not leave his side at all!","Once the spirit energy that was injected into little Wang Cai's body decreased, in less than 15 minutes, little Wang Cai would completely dissipate!","However, if he didn't chase after Huang Yueli, he wouldn't be able to carry out the Nirvana Ceremony and Little Wang Cai would also dissipate!","In this dilemma, Zhao Lin could not care about anything else. He could only grab the last chance and shout behind the two of them.","\"Huang Yueli, you...Come back! As long as you can save my brother, the Phoenix Clan will definitely reward you handsomely!\""]},{"number":4373,"title":"Chapter 4373 Nirvana Rebirth (4)","paragraphs":["Zhao Lin's suppressed voice echoed in the air.","However, after waiting for a while, he did not receive any response.","Only the wind blew past the nearby trees, and the branches and leaves rustled.","Evidently, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already run far away.","At this moment, under his palm, Little Wang Cai's delicate body suddenly trembled violently.","Zhao Lin had diverted his attention to look for Huang Yueli and the rest's traces and the spiritual energy that he had injected into Little Wang Cai's body had weakened slightly, causing him to be unable to withstand it.","Zhao Lin quickly lowered his head again and placed his attention back on Little Wang Cai.","This way, Little Wang Cai's spirit body stabilized once again.","At least, he didn't become more transparent.","The crisis was temporarily averted, but Zhao Lin's brows furrowed even more tightly.","If this continued, how would it end? It was impossible for him to last long.","There were times when his own spirit power would be exhausted. Moreover, it was simply unrealistic to maintain his entire body's concentration at all times.","Just at this moment, Yan Zhu and the rest who had gone to chase after Huang Yueli and the rest hurriedly ran in from outside.","\"How did it go? Have you caught her?\"","Yan Zhu and the others panted. Their faces revealed guilt, \"They... They've ran too fast, we... we can't catch up!\"","Although Zhao Lin had expected this, his expression still darkened.","Everyone's expression was solemn and they did not dare to speak.","Only the doctor could not help but speak up after a moment of hesitation. \"Patriarch, Young Master Zhao Hua's spirit body will not be able to hold on for long. The Nirvana Ceremony must be carried out. It must be carried out before nightfall tomorrow at the latest...\"","\" I know but Huang Yueli didn't care about Zhao Hua's life or death and ran away on her own, what can I do?\"","Zhao Lin was so angry that his face turned red.\" What are you all standing there for? Hurry up and go out and look for her!\"","However, no one moved.","Yan Zhu pondered for a moment before he braced himself and walked forward. Patriarch, we've already tried our best. We couldn't catch them just now. They must have run far away now...However, if...Uh...\"","\"What are you trying to say? Don't stutter!\" Zhao Lin was impatient when he heard that and could not help but urge.","Yan Zhu gritted her teeth.\" This subordinate was watching from the side just now and felt that Miss Huang didn't seem like a heartless person. She was genuinely concerned about Young Master Zhao Hua. If the Patriarch promises not to harm her and Young Master Li's lives and send them away safely after the matter is done, I think Miss Huang should be willing to participate in the Nirvana Ceremony...\"","\"Nonsense!\" \"Didn't I just say it?\" Zhao Lin said angrily. As long as she was willing to save Zhao Hua, she would definitely be rewarded heavily. She did not stay! Besides, I just asked her if she was willing to pay the price to save Zhao Hua. Didn't that Young Master Li not agree?\"","Yan Zhu and the others were speechless.","Only a fool would agree to the Patriarch's question, right?","It was obvious that he wanted to kill her after using her.","Miss Huang and Master Li were god grade geniuses, how could they not see through this?","Sensing everyone's gazes, Zhao Lin was a little embarrassed.","\"Why are you all looking at me? Am I wrong? Have you all forgotten the deep hatred between us and the Sacred Phoenix Clan? If I really let those two god clans go, how will I explain to my ancestors?\"","\"We haven't forgotten our deep hatred, but isn't this to save Young Master Zhao Hua's life?\" \"Now that the Phoenix Clan has declined to this point, in order to save the lives of one more clansman, we have let go of two god clans. Ancestor will definitely understand...\"","Hearing this, Zhao Lin's expression clearly revealed hesitation.","He wanted to save his brother more than anyone else, but he couldn't bring himself to do so.","The doctor's words gave him a way out.","Zhao Lin gritted his teeth.\" Alright, I'll listen to you then. For Zhao Hua...\" Release the news now! It's late at night now. They can't take the risk to go down the mountain. They will definitely hide until dawn. So, there's still time to find them!\"","..","Zhao Lin was right.","Li Moying brought Huang Yueli all the way to the west side of the gorge, the small path that Little Wang Cai had mentioned."]},{"number":4374,"title":"Chapter 4374 Nirvana Rebirth (5)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli's meridians were restrained by Li Moying and although it didn't affect her normal movements, but the Profound Energy in her body couldn't be unleashed at all.","She couldn't contend against Li Moying's powerful strength and could only be carried away by him.","Her heart was burning with anxiety, \"Moying, you...Stop for a moment! We can't leave like this!\"","Little Wang Cai's weak appearance earlier was truly shocking.","She had reason to believe that if they left like this, little Wang Cai would completely disappear in less than a day.","Li Moying was completely unmoved, \" No, we can't go back!\"","\"Li Moying! I can't be so selfish! If anything happens to Wang Cai, I... I will never forgive myself!\" Huang Yueli cried out anxiously.","However, Li Moying took a glance at her but his speed didn't decrease at all.","\"If I say no, I mean no! If anything happens to you, I will never be able to forgive myself.\"","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth but there was nothing she could do. She couldn't even say anything to refute.","Li Moying had always gone along with her wishes but the moment he encountered something that threatened her personal safety, his attitude would instantly become incomparably unyielding. No matter what she said or did, he would never compromise.","This point had already been verified in countless life and death situations in the past.","Li Moying hugged the young lady tightly in his arms as he sped along, a clear Qilin phantom image appeared behind him.","Huang Yueli knew that this was the result of her husband burning his blood essence which caused his Profound Energy to leak out.","In order to save her, he had already risked his life to this extent.","She could not let him down.","But... Little Wang Cai...","Just as Huang Yueli was in a dilemma, the ground suddenly shook violently.","Li Moying's body swayed but he quickly controlled himself and didn't fall down.","Not only did he not slow down, he even sped up.","Huang Yueli laid on his shoulder, looking at the center of the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge from afar.","In the originally dark valley, a raging flame suddenly rose. This flame shot into the sky and emitted a piercing silver light at the same time. Moreover, it became more and more intense, making people almost unable to open their eyes.","Even Li Moying who was rushing on his way halted in his footsteps.","\"Damn it, what happened? What the hell is Zhao Lin doing now?\"","An extremely strong fire attribute gushed out from the center of the flames and spread in all directions.","Even though the two of them had already left the center of the canyon, they still suffered a strong impact.","Huang Yueli was still considered to be alright. After all, her main cultivation was fire attribute so she could resolve a portion of it.","But to Li Moying, this was an exceptionally heavy burden.","He slowed down exceptionally.","Huang Yueli's expression changed drastically as she patted Li Moying's shoulder,\" Moying, why... why don't we go back!\"","Li Moying's thick black brows suddenly creased up as he frowned,\" No way, I've already said it countless times. Your life is much more important than Wang Cai's. For this kind of thing, I absolutely won't listen to you!\"","Huang Yueli took a deep breath and explained: \"No, it's not what you think. If we go back now, there's no longer any danger...\"","Li Moying swept her a glance as he spoke coldly, \" Do you think I will believe your words?\"","In order to protect the important people around him, his little fox would do anything!"]},{"number":4375,"title":"Chapter 4375 Nirvana Rebirth (6)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli looked at his cold expression and was extremely anxious, \" Li Moying, I really didn't lie to you! Now, it's like this because...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, a pained expression suddenly appeared on her face, and she could not help but moan.","\"Hiss...It hurts...\"","Li Moying's expression changed in shock, \" Little Li'er, you... What's wrong with you? What happened?\"","Huang Yueli lowered her head and hugged her head as her entire body curled up.","Her face was as pale as paper, and large drops of sweat were dripping down her forehead.","Li Moying's heart instantly sank as fear filled his entire body, \" Little Li'er, what exactly is going on? Where are you feeling unwell? Could it be that Zhao Lin and the others are up to something again?\"","He hurriedly stretched out his hand and pressed on Huang Yueli's dantian as he injected his Profound Energy into her body, removing the restriction he had placed on Huang Yueli's meridians.","At the same time, he checked the condition of her body.","Huang Yueli's meridians didn't suffer any damage and the circulation of Profound Energy was still considered smooth.","Li Moying frowned as he lowered his head and pressed his forehead against Huang Yueli's, trying to probe the condition of her primordial spirit.","However, the moment he sent his divine sense in, an intense pain rushed straight into his primordial spirit.","Li Moying was caught off guard as he was bounced off.","\"Damn it! It really was like this! These damn Phoenixes are really annoying! If anything happens to Little Li'er, even if I die, I will drag everyone in this Phoenix Tranquility Gorge down with me!\"","He suppressed his anger and heartache as he rummaged through his interspatial ring.","Because his primordial spirit had suffered serious injuries previously, in order to extend his life, Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli specially developed a kind of medicinal pill to restore his primordial spirit and reduce the pain when it acted up.","Although he no longer had any use for it now, but there were still some pills left from that time. He hurriedly found them and poured out a huge handful, stuffing it into Huang Yueli's mouth.","Fortunately, the effects of these medicinal pills were still not bad.","After a few breaths, Huang Yueli's complexion had obviously turned for the better and her breathing had also eased up.","However, she was still frowning, looking very uncomfortable.","\"Mo...Moying, bring me back.\"","Li Moying gritted his teeth as he glared fiercely at her, \" Little Li'er, are you crazy? You're acting like this. It's obvious that Zhao Lin and the others are up to something! We have to leave this place as soon as possible. Only by leaving the Phoenix Clan's sphere of influence can we have a chance to save you. You still want to go back?\"","Huang Yueli shook her head slightly as she stretched out her hand to grab Li Moying's sleeve.","\"No, it's not like that! They ...are...initiating the Nirvana Ceremony!\"","Li Moying was startled, \" What?!\"","\"I... I can feel it...\" Huang Yueli panted, \"Because...\" The Nirvana Ceremony began, and Wang Cai... Its spiritual body must be separated from the Sky Phoenix Ring. That's why it affected my primordial spirit...\"","\"I... I have to go back, otherwise...the Nirvana Ceremony would definitely fail! Little Wang Cai... his ..soul will dissipate!\"","Little Wang Cai, as the spirit of the Sky Phoenix Ring, had already merged together with Huang Yueli's primordial spirit.","If his spirit body wanted to escape and merge back into the corporeal body, it would definitely tear apart a portion of Huang Yueli's primordial spirit.","It was precisely because of this that she was in so much pain just now.","Li Moying's brows furrowed tightly, \" No way! Don't go! It's not that I don't want you to save him, but Zhao Lin and the others...\""]},{"number":4376,"title":"Chapter 4376 Nirvana Rebirth (7)","paragraphs":["?","Huang Yueli shook her head, \" As long as the Nirvana Ceremony starts, they won't be able to kill me.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","Li Moying raised his brows slightly as he looked at her.","Although he was a little surprised, but he knew that his Little Li'er would not speak without thinking about such matters.","Huang Yueli quickly explained: \" As long as the Nirvana Ceremony officially starts, I will need to cooperate with them to continue. Otherwise, even if they forcefully strip Wang Cai's spirit body, it would definitely not succeed. Once it fails, Wang Cai's spiritual body will completely dissipate. To me, although my primordial spirit will be heavily injured, my life will not be in danger...\"","\"Therefore, they have to rely on me to ensure that Wang Cai's Nirvana will succeed.\"","Hearing this, Li Moying's tightly knitted brows relaxed slightly but his right hand still grabbed Huang Yueli's wrist, not allowing her to leave.","\" Alright, they do need you now, and they won't do anything to you. But have you ever thought about how we're going to escape after the Nirvana ceremony ends and you're no longer of any use?\"","Huang Yueli shook her head, \" After the Nirvana ceremony ends, we don't have to worry anymore. \"Wang Cai's spirit body has fused with a portion of my primordial spirit. Therefore, if I'm injured, Wang Cai will also be injured or even more severely injured than me! If I die, Wang Cai will most likely not live either...\"","This was why Zhao Lin had insisted on knocking her out and holding her down from the start.","This was because the only way to kill her without affecting Little Wang Cai was to use a special method to kill her before the Nirvana ceremony began and force out her primordial spirit.","Normally, when a primordial spirit leaves the body, it will dissipate in a few breaths.","However, the Phoenix Clan should have an ancient secret technique that could maintain her primordial spirit for a period of time.","Zhao Lin and the others had to strip off Little Wang Cai's spirit body in this period of time to complete the Nirvana Ceremony.","Once he missed this opportunity, it would be almost impossible to kill her again.","The matter was urgent so Huang Yueli could only briefly explain the matter.","But Li Moying was also a person with vast knowledge and experience so he didn't need her to explain in detail as he already understood most of it.","Huang Yueli said anxiously, \" Moying, now you understand right? The Phoenix Clan forcefully activated the Nirvana ceremony to show me their stance. They only want to save Wang Cai now and don't want to target us anymore...They took the risk of Little Wang Cai's soul dissipating and handed the initiative to us. Therefore, I have to rush back.\"","Under such circumstances, if she still could not save Little Wang Cai, that would really form a demon in her heart for the rest of her life, and it would affect her advancement in the future.","Li Moying also understood this point and finally let out a sigh of relief, \" I understand what you mean, let's go now!\"","\"Alright, let's hurry up!\"","Huang Yueli looked at her handsome and tall husband beside her and didn't say anything.","Their hearts were connected. This man...He was the one who understood her the most!","The two of them used their movement mystic skills and turned around. They followed the path they came from and flew back at their fastest speed.","..","At this moment, in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge.","An exquisite array appeared in the center of the canyon.","This was set up overnight by the Phoenix Clan. They originally thought that it would only be used in a few days, but they did not expect that it would be activated urgently tonight.","\"Patriarch, this... This array...It's still a little incomplete. I'm afraid its power is not enough...\""]},{"number":4377,"title":"Chapter 4377 Nirvana Rebirth (8)","paragraphs":["Zhao Lin took a deep breath and waved his hand.","\" It's fine. I've already checked. Although some of the materials are not available and the power of the array itself will be weakened, the clansmen who entered the array today are all extremely powerful. Their cultivation is much higher than the Nirvana ceremony.\"","In the past, when the Phoenix Clan was in its glory, although there were many more experts than now, most of them were traveling outside. It was impossible for them to gather all of them with a wave of their arms like now.","Yan Zhu's face was filled with worry.\" However, Patriarch, it's useless no matter how high the cultivation of the clansmen is. If the most crucial thing is missing...\"","He stole a glance at Zhao Lin's expression and did not dare to continue speaking.","Zhao Lin pursed his lips. \" Since things have come to this, we have no other choice. We can only take a gamble.\"","He hoped that his brother's judgment was accurate enough and that the mistress he followed was not a heartless thing.","Otherwise, he would personally leave the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge in the future and go to the twelve continents of the God Clan to hunt down the two geniuses of the God Clan.","\"Let's begin!\"","Zhao Lin walked to the center of the array and sat down.","As he spoke, all the Phoenixes in the array attacked at the same time.","Almost in an instant, a powerful fire attribute energy surged and was guided by the complex array patterns to gather at the center of the array.","In the end, it formed a pillar of light that reached the sky.","Little Wang Cai was in the center of this pillar of light.","Its spirit body had already begun to dissipate, and it was almost unable to maintain the shape of its body.","However, under the control of the powerful energy in the pillar of light, they were forcefully condensed together.","By doing so, it could indeed protect its spirit body for a very short period of time, but it would have to endure immense pain.","One could see that within the light pillar, Little Wang Cai's face was completely distorted and his body was still trembling slightly.","However, it was very weak now and could not even make a sound.","All the Phoenixes in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge had already come out. Even if they did not enter the array, they were still watching from the side.","Seeing Little Wang Cai's current situation, everyone was sweating for him.","\"How did this happen? Didn't they say this afternoon that Young Master Zhao Hua's condition is not bad and that he can prepare for a few more days before the ceremony?\"","\"Isn't it because the Patriarch insisted on killing those two geniuses of the god clan? Young Master Zhao Hua did it to protect them, that's why...\"","\"Heavens, how could this be? In my opinion, those two Ancient God clansmen don't look like bad people.\"","\"Sigh, stop talking. We're in big trouble now. If that Ancient God clansman doesn't come back, Young Master Zhao Hua will...\"","As time passed, Little Wang Cai's situation became more and more critical.","Even with the support of the pillar of light, its spirit body began to fade uncontrollably.","When Zhao Lin saw this, his heart felt like it was being stabbed by a knife.","This was his only family!","The joy he felt when he regained what he had lost this afternoon was the same as the heartache and regret he felt now!","Unfortunately, there was no medicine for regret in this world.","Zhao Hua was about to die here because of his obsession, unless...","No, from the looks of it, it was impossible for the Ancient God clansmen to return!","The Ancient God clansmen themselves were all sinister and cunning people. It was already good enough that they did not take the opportunity to hit them while they were down. How could they take the risk to run back just to save a half-dead little Phoenix?"]},{"number":4378,"title":"Chapter 4378 Nirvana Rebirth (9)","paragraphs":["Looking at Little Wang Cai's figure slowly blending into the pillar of light, Zhao Lin gritted his teeth and slowly closed his eyes in trepidation.","However, just as he was about to fall into despair, a figure suddenly rushed out of the dark forest!","The eyes of Zhao Lin and the others immediately lit up, and they were extremely excited.","Huang Yueli's running speed was extremely fast and a faint red glow appeared around her body as a few drops of sweat slid down her snow-white skin.","She stopped in front of the array and was still panting slightly \"You...you really initiated the Nirvana Ceremony!\"","Zhao Lin looked at Huang Yueli's anxious look and his mood was extremely complicated.","Ever since the massacre that almost wiped out the entire Clan 100,000 years ago, in his mind, all those from the Ancient Ancient God Clans were synonymous with despicable shamelessness.","Even though Little Wang Cai repeatedly emphasized that Huang Yueli was a good person, he still harbored doubts in the depths of his heart.","So much so that the moment Huang Yueli appeared, he couldn't recover his senses.","This girl from the Ancient Ancient God Clan had really returned!","She really came back to save his brother!","Zhao Lin opened his mouth, not knowing what to say for a moment.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she became anxious and couldn't help but stomp her feet, \" Hey, what are you daydreaming about? What should I do now? Can't you quickly explain it clearly! Wang Cai can't wait much longer!\"","Only then did Zhao Lin come to his senses.\" Young Miss Huang, do you see the center of the array?\" he asked hurriedly. There is an array eye, each in the east and west. Zhao Hua is in one of them. You will enter the other array eye later. When the array is officially activated, Zhao Hua's corporeal body will gradually take shape. At the moment it takes shape, its spiritual body will be separated from your primordial spirit. I hope you will take the initiative to cooperate and guide it to enter his body...\"","Zhao Lin gave a simple explanation and taught Huang Yueli the Phoenix Clan's unique technique of controlling primordial spirit.","Huang Yueli repeated it in her mind and had already completely memorized it.","She didn't dare to delay any longer and hurriedly nodded.\" Alright, I understand. I'll enter the array now.\"","Huang Yueli turned around and was about to walk towards the light pillar when suddenly, her arm was grabbed from behind.","\"Little Li'er...\"","Hearing Li Moying's deep voice, Huang Yueli's footsteps halted as she turned around.","The man's handsome face was still indifferent, but his eyes were filled with worry.","Huang Yueli winked at him and pretended to be relaxed as she said: \" Don't worry, Moying. I'm fine. Just wait for me for a while.\"","Li Moying frowned slightly.","Hearing Huang Yueli's words, the worry in his heart didn't lessen.","Because he was very clear that although Huang Yueli's life wouldn't be in danger if she stripped her primordial spirit, but the entire process was extremely painful. Furthermore, after a portion of her primordial spirit left her body, Huang Yueli's cultivation might weaken and her body would be severely damaged.","If not for Little Wang Cai, she would not have to take such a risk.","Not to mention that after Little Wang Cai's spirit body was reconstructed, its own strength had increased but to Huang Yueli, the Sky Phoenix Ring which had lost its weapon spirit, its power had dropped by at least a level!","She did this...The sacrifice was too great!","But although Li Moying didn't agree with her actions, he didn't say anything to stop her.","As a wife slave, he had long been used to listening to his wife's arrangements.","\"Be careful.\" Li Moying squeezed out these words in a hoarse voice."]},{"number":4379,"title":"Chapter 4379 Nirvana Rebirth (10)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli looked at the man's furrowed brows and her heart softened.","\"Alright, I will be careful. Husband, you don't have to worry.\"","After saying that, she turned around and walked into the array.","Huang Yueli stood at the position Zhao Lin had pointed out.","\"Activate the array!\"","Zhao Lin also returned to his position and commanded the experts in the clan to attack at the same time, once again strengthening the strength of the energy in the array.","The piercing flames soared into the sky again.","However, this time, there wasn't only one, but two!","One of them revolved around Little Wang Cai's body while the other wrapped around Huang Yueli.","Little Wang Cai's expression was obviously in pain while Huang Yueli looked much calmer.","She sat cross-legged at the center of the array. Her eyes were slightly closed and her lips were slightly pursed. Her head was lowered and there was no expression on her face.","Powerful energy was continuously injected into the array. The blazing temperature emitted by the flames seemed to freeze the surrounding air. The weaker Phoenixes among the surrounding spectators could no longer withstand it and could not help but retreat.","Li Moying's tall and straight figure was like a pine tree, standing upright and unwavering.","Although his primary cultivation was not the fire attribute, he was still a god grade genius after all. It was not a problem for him to withstand such a small energy impact.","He had been staring intently at Huang Yueli who was in the array, as though the other people in the surroundings didn't exist at all.","Because of Huang Yueli's cooperation, this time, the array's power was completely unleashed.","The array patterns on the periphery of the array lit up one after another. Immediately after, a strong smell of blood spread out!","Only then did Li Moying realise that there were huge basins of Phoenix's blood, Phoenix's feathers and various rare herbs placed at several key locations within the array.","Under the power of the array, the Phoenix blood and tail feathers were instantly vaporized into balls of energy in the void.","The energy came from all directions and gathered at the center of the array.","In the middle of Huang Yueli and Little Wang Cai, a huge Phoenix phantom formed.","This shadow was formed by fire attribute energy, so it appeared very illusory at first. Other than a faint red light, it could be said to be almost transparent.","However, as time passed, this huge shadow began to slowly shrink inward and shrink again.","The shadow that was originally hundreds of meters tall shrank at a speed visible to the naked eye. After more than an hour, it became only a few meters tall.","The illusory energy also became more and more solid and stronger during this process.","When Li Moying saw this, he gradually couldn't maintain his cold expression as he raised his eyebrows in astonishment.","\" So, the Phoenix Clan's Nirvana Ceremony is to use the Phoenix blood and tail feathers left behind by the seniors to fuse with the fire attribute energy to reconstruct a new body...\"","His physical body was almost fully formed. The next step was the most crucial step.","If Little Wang Cai's spirit body was unable to be successfully separated from the Sky Phoenix Ring, or if any mistakes were to occur during the process of fusing with the new body, all their previous efforts would be for naught.","If an accident happened, the waste of manpower and resources was secondary. Little Wang Cai's life would definitely not be saved.","There was only one chance.","Thinking of this, Zhao Lin and the others revealed grave expressions.","Right at this moment, Little Wang Cai, who was in the pillar of light, suddenly let out a shrill scream.","Huang Yueli's face turned pale."]},{"number":4380,"title":"Chapter 4380 A thank you gift from the Phoenix Clan (1)","paragraphs":["Seeing the pained expression on Huang Yueli's face, Li Moying's expression immediately sank.","However, he was very clear about the urgency of the matter so he forcefully held back the impulse to pull Little Li'er back.","The Nirvana Ceremony had reached the most critical moment.","Little Wang Cai's spirit body seemed to be pulled by an invisible thread as it slowly floated into the air. Following that, it moved towards the direction of the physical body.","The closer the spirit body was to the physical body, the paler Huang Yueli's complexion became.","Cold sweat kept dripping from her forehead, and her delicate brows were furrowed into a ball.","At this moment, Huang Yueli's feeling wasn't any better than Little Wang Cai's and the pain she was enduring was even worse.","Because if Little Wang Cai's spirit body wanted to be separated from the Sky Phoenix Ring, it would require the assistance of a powerful energy that was sufficient to impact this spirit artifact.","Huang Yueli's primordial spirit had already merged with the Sky Phoenix Ring and when these energies were attacking the Sky Phoenix Ring, they were also attacking her primordial spirit.","Even though she was strong enough and her primordial spirit was stable, it was impossible for her not to be injured under such an impact.","However, in order for Little Wang Cai to successfully undergo Nirvana, not only could she not resist or defend, she had to take the initiative to bear such injuries.","As time passed by, Huang Yueli's hair was drenched in cold sweat but Little Wang Cai still wasn't able to successfully escape.","After all, Little Wang Cai had already entered the Sky Phoenix Ring for a hundred thousand years and his fusion with the spirit artifact was too stable.","Although Huang Yueli had already done her best to cooperate, but the entire process was still very slow.","Seeing this, Zhao Lin and the rest became rather anxious.","All the Phoenixes stared at Zhao Lin.","\"Patriarch, this time... What should he do? Young Master Zhao Hua's spirit body can't take it anymore!\"","\" That's right. If we delay any longer, I'm afraid the Nirvana Ceremony will fail!\"","\"I have already successfully condensed my physical body. It would be a pity if I fail now...Quickly think of a way!\"","Zhao Lin's brows were already tightly knitted.","If he could think of a way, how could he not?","But no matter if it was the Phoenix Clan's experts present or Huang Yueli, they had already reached their limits.","Now, the only one who could help Little Wang Cai was Huang Yueli herself.","If her willpower was strong enough and she was willing to give up more primordial spirits, she could still force Little Wang Cai to succeed in his nirvana.","However, the price she had to pay was too high.","Not only would she have to endure unimaginable pain, but her strength would also decrease greatly, even affecting her future cultivation.","To a god-grade genius with a boundless future, this was something even more painful than death.","\"No one would be willing to do such a thing... Could it be that Zhao Hua really...Is there really no hope?\"","Zhao Lin closed his eyes.","However, at this moment, the center of the array suddenly emitted a bright light. The explosive fire attribute energy lit up the entire Phoenix Tranquility Gorge as if it was daytime.","In an instant, powerful energy attacked every corner of the array.","With Zhao Lin's strength, he was caught off guard and almost could not continue sitting in his original position.","He took a deep breath and managed to maintain his balance.","At this moment, he suddenly heard the sharp cry of a Phoenix.","This cry was extremely long."]},{"number":4381,"title":"Chapter 4381 A thank you gift from the Phoenix Clan (2)","paragraphs":["Everyone's eardrums were hurt by this scream, and they could not come back to their senses for a long time.","After about fifteen minutes, the hissing gradually weakened.","The energy in the center of the array began to spread out in all directions.","Zhao Lin reacted, and his face immediately revealed an extremely surprised expression.\" It's Zhao Hua!!\" Zhao Hua's Nirvana has succeeded!\"","Following Zhao Lin's shout, all the Phoenixes understood.","Everyone immediately rushed into the array.","At the center of the array, the blinding light gradually faded, revealing a golden-red little Phoenix.","This Phoenix was spreading its wings and stopping in mid-air.","In terms of size, it was still a juvenile that had yet to reach adulthood. Its fiery red wings were spread to the extreme, but it only had a wingspan of two meters. It could not be compared to the original body of Zhao Hua.","However, the energy around its body was very stable and condensed.","Seeing this scene, Zhao Lin was extremely pleasantly surprised and almost cried out.","His brother, whom he had been separated from for 100,000 years and thought had passed away, had finally returned to his side. Moreover, he had successfully condensed a physical body!","This body was as beautiful as the one he saw 100,000 years ago.","\"Zhao Hua, you finally...you've finally recovered. That's great... that's great...!\"","At this moment, Zhao Lin had long forgotten his identity as the Patriarch. He completely ignored his image and directly pounced towards Little Wang Cai.","When Little Wang Cai heard the commotion, its original body trembled slightly in the air. Immediately after, silver light flashed and it turned into the appearance of a little boy.","\"Zhao Hua, quickly come over to brother. Let brother take a good look...\"","Zhao Lin ran to his side and said loudly. He stretched out his hand and was about to pull him over so that Little Wang Cai could feel the warmth of a family member.","Who knew that after Little Wang Cai transformed into a human, it did not even look at him.","Turning around, he rushed towards Huang Yueli who was not far away.","\"Female devil, female devil! You... How are you? Don't scare me!\"","..","On the other side of the array, Huang Yueli's face was pale and weak as she laid in Li Moying's embrace.","After the Nirvana Ceremony ended, the Phoenix Clan's clansmen immediately rushed towards Little Wang Cai. Only Li Moying immediately ran over and caught his wife.","He quickly held her wrist to feel her pulse and checked the condition of her body as his brows creased.","The situation of Little Li'er's damaged primordial spirit... It was more serious than he had imagined.","At this moment, Huang Yueli coincidentally raised her head and saw his solemn expression as she couldn't help but pull out a smile, \" Moying, you...\" Don't worry too much, I'm fine... I'm just a little uncomfortable. I should be fine after resting for a period of time.\"","Compared to the pain of her primordial spirit being damaged, what she was more unaccustomed to was that her primordial spirit no longer had a direct connection with Little Wang Cai.","This made her feel a little empty.","Although they usually despised this brat for being too much, they had been together for several years and fought side by side countless times. They were no different from biological siblings.","Li Moying glared at her as his heart was filled with displeasure.","\"You still dare to say that you're fine! With your primordial spirit damaged to this extent, do you not want to advance in the future? Do you have to go to this extent for a devilish brat?\"","It wasn't that Li Moying didn't like Little Wang Cai but the moment he thought of how he caused his little fox to suffer serious injuries, he couldn't wait to throw him down the cliff.","Huang Yueli didn't mind at all as she asked him with a smile: \" If my strength isn't good enough and I can't fight side by side with you, would you divorce your wife and marry another?\""]},{"number":4382,"title":"Chapter 4382 A thank you gift from the Phoenix Clan (3)","paragraphs":["Li Moying glared at her fiercely, \" You still dare to ask such a question? Are you trying to anger me to death?\"","Seeing the obvious anger in Li Moying's eyes, Huang Yueli didn't dare to spout nonsense as she secretly stuck out her tongue and shut her mouth.","Li Moying saw that she was still able to smile and finally felt a little relieved.","There were still quite a number of elixirs left which were used to restore primordial spirit and he took them out to feed Huang Yueli personally.","Huang Yueli originally disliked the pill for being too bitter and didn't want to eat it but seeing Li Moying's sunken face, her expression was so tense that it was frightening so she didn't dare to say anything more and obediently swallowed the pill.","After eating, Huang Yueli's face had indeed regained a bit of colour.","Li Moying bent down and was prepared to carry his wife away when suddenly, he heard Little Wang Cai's voice from behind.","\"Female devil, female devil! How are you? Do you have a headache?\"","Little Wang Cai had just woken up and was already running towards Huang Yueli's direction with all his heart.","This frightened the members of the Phoenix Clan.","Zhao Lin and the others all jumped up and chased after him.","\"Zhao Hua, stop right now. Don't run around!\"","\"Young Master Zhao Hua, come back quickly. Your body is very weak now!\"","\"Young Master Zhao Hua...\"","Amidst the series of screams, Little Wang Cai had already run to Huang Yueli's side.","Looking at Huang Yueli's pale face, he couldn't help but pounce on her.","\"Female devil, how are you? Is it...\"","However, Little Wang Cai's hand had yet to touch Huang Yueli's body when he was grabbed by the collar behind his neck, like a little chick.","\"Don't get so close.\"","Li Moying warned expressionlessly.","Little Wang Cai's face turned green, \" Great Demon King, you...\" What kind of situation is this, and you still say such things! Let me see the Female Devil!\"","\"There's nothing to see. It's just that my primordial spirit is injured.\"","\"But...\"","Little Wang Cai still wanted to say something, but the Phoenixes had already chased after him.","Zhao Lin panted heavily as he listened from beside Little Wang Cai's pillow. His eyes were still in shock.","\"Zhao Hua, you...Why are you running around? Do you know that the Nirvana ceremony has just ended and your spirit body is not stable enough to fuse with your physical body? Therefore, not only can you not do anything too intense, but you also can't be too sad or happy...\"","\"That's right, Young Master Zhao Hua, the Patriarch spent so much effort to let you successfully attain Nirvana. You must not treat your own body as a joke! If you get hurt anywhere, Patriarch will be very sad.\"","\"Young Master Zhao Hua, you...\"","\"Enough!\"","As Little Wang Cai listened, he could not bear to listen any longer. He puffed up his cheeks and angrily interrupted them.","His shout shocked all the clansmen present.","This was because no one had expected that Little Wang Cai, who still looked childish, would suddenly lose his temper. Moreover, his angry appearance actually had some might, looking like a miniature version of Zhao Lin.","Seeing that everyone had quieted down, Little Wang Cai gritted his teeth, \" Don't get me wrong. The one who spent so much effort to save me was my female devil! If it wasn't for her splitting her primordial spirit to save me, I would have completely dissipated by now!\"","\"Now, because she saved me, her primordial spirit was damaged and she suffered such a serious injury. How can none of you care about her?\"","Everyone looked at each other blankly when they heard his words."]},{"number":4383,"title":"Chapter 4383 A thank you gift from the Phoenix Clan (4)","paragraphs":["Only then did he recall that Huang Yueli had also been injured during the Nirvana ceremony and her primordial spirit was seriously injured.","However, they were all concerned about Little Wang Cai and no one thought of this.","Little Wang Cai snorted coldly, \" You guys are too much! How could they still have the cheek to say that the Ancient God Clans were ungrateful? What about you guys?\"","After hearing what he said, the Phoenixes were so ashamed that they could not raise their heads.","At this moment, Zhao Lin also rushed over.","Hearing Little Wang Cai's words, a trace of embarrassment appeared on his face.","Turning towards Huang Yueli, he coughed lightly, \" Cough cough, Miss Huang, it's all thanks to your help today that my younger brother was able to successfully attain nirvana. Now, his spirit body and new corporeal body have already fused together. As long as he recuperates for a period of time, he will be able to stabilize. I represent all the clansmen to thank you.\"","Huang Yueli leaned into Li Moying's embrace and her head was still a little dizzy so she didn't say anything immediately.","Li Moying raised his eyes and his icy cold gaze swept across Zhao Lin's face as he sneered, \" This 'thank you' is not something my wife can afford! If you can stop shouting and killing, we will thank the heavens.\"","Zhao Lin looked even more embarrassed.\" Cough cough, Young Master Li, this... How could this be? Miss Huang is the benefactor of our Phoenix Clan. We are not people who repay kindness with ingratitude...\"","\"Is that so?\" Huang Yueli lifted her lips lazily, \" Yesterday, when I brought Zhao Hua back, you guys had also thanked us. In the end, in just a few hours, you drugged us and wanted to kill us...\"","\"This... It was really a misunderstanding, a misunderstanding! I was too narrow-minded and offended the two of you. It's rare that the two of you are willing to risk your lives to save my brother. I will definitely not forget this kindness and will repay it in the future!\"","This time, Zhao Lin spoke very sincerely.","Even though he still couldn't forget the grudge he had with the Sacred Phoenix Race a hundred thousand years ago, but Huang Yueli's actions these two days had deeply moved him.","He asked himself honestly, even he himself was unable to be as loyal as Huang Yueli.","He clearly knew that Little Wang Cai's brother and clansmen had been plotting to kill him, but he still rushed back to save him.","During the Nirvana Ceremony, the moment he saw Huang Yueli rushing over with a body full of dust, other than being shocked and moved, he also felt a deep sense of shame.","However, seeing Zhao Lin's regret, Huang Yueli didn't have any intention of forgiving him.","She still had a cold expression on her face.\" There's no need to repay me. When we leave the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, I'll be satisfied as long as you don't stop us.\"","Zhao Lin laughed dryly: \" Miss Huang, if you and Master Li want to leave, we definitely won't stop you!\" However, your body is in such a bad condition now, and the road to enter and exit the canyon is so dangerous. Isn't this not good for you? Why don't we rest in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge for a while?\"","\"Our Phoenix Clan has herbs that are specially used to repair the primordial spirit. It is very beneficial for your injuries. These herbs are priceless in the territory of the Ancient Ancient God Clan. You can't buy them no matter how much money you have!\"","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were still hesitant.","Little Wang Cai cried out anxiously, \" Female devil, my brother didn't lie to you this time. The Phoenix Clan really has a lot of herbs! There were also heavenly and earthly treasures used to refine weapons! You stay. They caused you so much trouble, but you ate all their herbs!\"","Zhao Lin was speechless.","Was this traitor really his younger brother?"]},{"number":4384,"title":"Chapter 4384 A thank you gift from the Phoenix Clan (5)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli was also speechless.","Why did he make her sound like a rice bucket that only knew how to eat?","Although she was very particular about her diet, it was just a small hobby.","However, Little Wang Cai's words reminded her.","She could be considered to have contributed to the Phoenix Clan. It was not her style to leave quietly without any benefits.","Huang Yueli nodded her head, \" Alright then, I'll stay in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge for a period of time and I can also take a look at Wang Cai's... The fusion of Zhao Hua's spirit body.\"","Now that Huang Yueli's safety wasn't a problem anymore, Li Moying naturally wouldn't oppose his wife's decision.","\"This way please.\"","Zhao Lin secretly heaved a sigh of relief and personally led the way.","Li Moying carried Huang Yueli horizontally and followed behind Zhao Lin.","This time around, the Phoenix Clan had shown sufficient sincerity as they vacated the largest courtyard in the valley for Huang Yueli to recuperate.","Not only that, Zhao Lin even sent people to deliver large amounts of medicinal herbs for Huang Yueli's use every day.","Huang Yueli squatted on the ground, picking and choosing the herbs.","\"Tsk tsk, as expected of a Divine Beast clan that has been in seclusion for tens of thousands of years. The medicinal herbs they collect are all rare treasures of the God Realm, and their quality is quite good! It's just that they're too wasteful. Such good medicinal herbs are actually not refined into medicinal pills!\"","\"Not refining it into a pill?\" Li Moying was slightly surprised as he raised his brows, \" Then how do I consume it?\"","Huang Yueli's face was filled with helplessness, \" Earlier I specially asked Little Sister Xiangxiang who brought the medicinal herbs over and she said that her clansmen all swallowed it directly. For those who are more particular, they can be cooked together with the food they eat and made into medicinal cuisine...\"","Making the medicinal herbs into dishes sounded a little more particular, but from her point of view as a half-barrel water spirit apothecary, the degree of waste of medicinal power was about the same.","It was nothing more than that medicinal cuisine looked better than eating herbs directly.","From this, it could be said that the Phoenix Clan basically did not study spirit medicine techniques.","Li Moying pondered for a moment and smiled, \" This might be because the ancient divine beasts 'ability to communicate with heaven and earth and absorb Profound Qi is much higher than ours so they don't need to refine the medicinal herbs into pills and can absorb most of the medicinal effects so naturally they don't need to expend so much effort.\"","Huang Yueli nodded, \" You're right. Unfortunately, I'm a from the Ancient God Clan, not a divine beast.\"","She would really feel heartache if she swallowed all these herbs.","It was really too wasteful!","So Huang Yueli only ate a small portion to ensure that her injured primordial spirit could recover.","The remaining medicinal ingredients were all placed into the Sky Phoenix Ring's space, preparing to bring them back to Liu Buyan.","One could imagine that if her Senior Brother saw that he had brought back so many rare medicinal herbs, he would definitely be overjoyed!","The two of them stayed in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge for a period of time.","Because Huang Yueli had saved Little Wang Cai, now when the Phoenixes saw the two of them, they weren't as hostile as before.","As time passed, the two of them gradually became familiar with each other.","The Phoenixes realized that the Ancient God Clans were not as annoying as they had imagined.","At least, Huang Yueli had a huge advantage.","That was that she was very good at cooking!","Especially the roasted drumsticks!","That day, Little Wang Cai pestered Huang Yueli, insisting that she would roast a chicken drumstick for him to eat.","Huang Yueli was initially unwilling as Zhao Lin had specially warned her not to feed Little Wang Cai with such non-nutritious food as it would affect his growth and development."]},{"number":4385,"title":"Chapter 4385 A thank you gift from the Phoenix Clan (6)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli was also speechless.","Why did he make her sound like a rice bucket that only knew how to eat?","Although she was very particular about her diet, it was just a small hobby.","However, Little Wang Cai's words reminded her.","She could be considered to have contributed to the Phoenix Clan. It was not her style to leave quietly without any benefits.","Huang Yueli nodded her head, \" Alright then, I'll stay in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge for a period of time and I can also take a look at the prosperous... The fusion of Zhao Hua's spirit body.\"","Now that Huang Yueli's safety wasn't a problem anymore, Li Moying naturally wouldn't oppose his wifey's decision.","\"This way please.\"","Zhao Lin secretly heaved a sigh of relief and personally led the way.","Li Moying carried Huang Yueli horizontally and followed behind Zhao Lin.","This time around, the Phoenix Clan had shown sufficient sincerity as they vacated the largest courtyard in the valley for Huang Yueli to recuperate.","Not only that, Zhao Lin even sent people to deliver large amounts of medicinal herbs for Huang Yueli's use every day.","Huang Yueli squatted on the ground, picking and choosing the herbs.","\"Tsk tsk, as expected of a Divine Beast clan that has been in seclusion for tens of thousands of years. The medicinal herbs they collect are all rare treasures of the God Realm, and their quality is quite good! It's just that they're too wasteful. Such good medicinal herbs are actually not refined into medicinal pills!\"","\"Not refining it into a pill?\" Li Moying was slightly surprised as he raised his brows, \" Then how do I consume it?\"","Huang Yueli's face was filled with helplessness, \" Earlier I specially asked Little Sister Xiangxiang who brought the medicinal herbs over and she said that her clansmen all swallowed it directly. For those who are more particular, they can be cooked together with the food they eat and made into medicinal cuisine...\"","Making the medicinal herbs into dishes sounded a little more particular, but from her point of view as a half-barrel water spirit apothecary, the degree of waste of medicinal power was about the same.","It was nothing more than that medicinal cuisine looked better than eating herbs directly.","From this, it could be said that the Phoenix Clan basically did not study spirit medicine techniques.","Li Moying pondered for a moment and smiled, \" This might be because the ancient divine beasts 'ability to communicate with heaven and earth and absorb Profound Qi is much higher than ours so they don't need to refine the medicinal herbs into pills and can absorb most of the medicinal effects so naturally they don't need to expend so much effort.\"","Huang Yueli nodded, \" You're right. Unfortunately, I'm a god, not a divine beast.\"","She would really feel heartache if she swallowed all these herbs.","It was really too wasteful!","So Huang Yueli only ate a small portion to ensure that her injured primordial spirit could recover.","The remaining medicinal ingredients were all placed into the Sky Phoenix Ring's space, preparing to bring them back to Liu Buyan.","One could imagine that if his senior brother saw that he had brought back so many rare medicinal herbs, he would definitely be overjoyed!","The two of them stayed in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge for a period of time.","Because Huang Yueli had saved Little Wang Cai, now when the Phoenixes saw the two of them, they weren't as hostile as before.","As time passed, the two of them gradually became familiar with each other.","The Phoenixes realized that the Protoss were not as annoying as they had imagined.","At least, Huang Yueli had a huge advantage.","That was that he was very good at cooking!","Especially the roasted drumsticks!","That day, Little Wang Cai pestered Huang Yueli, insisting that she would roast a chicken drumstick for him to eat.","Huang Yueli was initially unwilling as Zhao Lin had specially warned her not to feed Little Wang Cai with such non-nutritious food as it would affect his growth and development."]},{"number":4386,"title":"Chapter 4386 A thank you gift from the Phoenix Clan (7)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli totally didn't expect that there would be someone behind her as she jumped in fright and the roasted chicken in her hand almost fell to the ground.","Li Moying caught the roast chicken in time and used his other hand to pull Huang Yueli into his embrace to protect her.","His handsome brows slightly creased up as he looked at the person behind Huang Yueli with a displeased expression.","Huang Yueli turned her head and saw Yan Zhu and the other Phoenixes standing behind her.","Everyone's faces were drooling as they stared at the roast chicken on the shelf. Their saliva was about to drip down.","That expression...It was exactly the same as Little Wang Cai.","Huang Yueli's lips twitched.","\"All of you...You want to eat roast chicken too?\"","Yan Zhu nodded repeatedly,\" Miss Huang, although it is very presumptuous, but... Your roast chicken is really too fragrant...\"","\"Yes, yes, it smells so good!\"","\"I haven't smelled such fragrant food for tens of thousands of years!\"","The other Phoenixes nodded.","Huang Yueli's head was full of black lines,\" If I remember correctly, doesn't Phoenix only eat a few rare herbs and drink dew? Are you sure you want to eat this... Something greasy?\"","This was what was recorded in the various great ancient records of the Divine Realm.","So Huang Yueli had always felt that this little Phoenix of hers was not normal and guessed that it might be because the cubs were more gluttonous so when he grew up a little, he would be normal.","Who would have thought that after Little Wang Cai returned to the Perched Phoenix Canyon, not only did he not fall in love with the herbs and dew, on the contrary, even his clansmen were seduced by the roasted chicken drumstick?","Yan Zhu hurriedly explained,\"This...\" We phoenixes can actually eat anything. It's just that we usually live on the top of high mountains, where clouds and mist surround the place with dense mystic qi. This kind of environment is suitable for our Phoenix clan to cultivate. However, there are only medicinal herbs and dew around for consumption...\"","In other words, it wasn't that they couldn't eat roast chicken, they just couldn't eat it.","Moreover, looking at their eager eyes, it seemed... You like it?","Huang Yueli was speechless.","Yan Zhu and the others looked at her hesitant expression and looked at each other.","Huang Yueli opened her mouth again,\" This...It's not impossible for you to eat roast chicken. My husband and I have been living in the Perched Phoenix Canyon for some time now. We are considered neighbors. We see each other every day and are all acquaintances. It's not too much to come to our house for a meal...\"","When Little Wang Cai heard this, his eyes widened in shock. He did not even bother to eat the chicken drumstick in his hand.","What kind of stimulation had his she-devil received? He actually changed?","She was obviously very stingy. When did she become so generous?","He was actually willing to give his roasted drumstick to someone else?","Little Wang Cai was anxious as he rushed to Huang Yueli's side and hugged her thigh as he shouted: \" No way no way! Female devil, you can't let them eat roast chicken! I can only eat one drumstick, so why should they eat and drink for free?\"","When Huang Yueli saw this, the corners of her lips curled up slightly.","\"Hehe, you're right.\"","When Little Wang Cai saw her smile, he was startled and suddenly felt a chill on his back.","For some reason, he had a feeling that he had been scammed again...","Was it an illusion?","Without waiting for him to figure it out, Huang Yueli had already turned towards Yan Zhu and the rest, her face full of apology.","\"Seniors, it's not that I don't want to give you food. Instead...As you can see, your little young master Radiant said that he would let you eat and drink for free. He would be jealous. If you really want to eat, why don't you... Give me something in exchange?\""]},{"number":4387,"title":"Chapter 4387 The Phoenix Clan’s Gift of Thanks (8)","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Little Wang Cai almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","He knew it. He knew it!","It was impossible for the money-hungry she-devil to suddenly become so generous!","As expected, she had taken a fancy to the treasures that their Phoenix clan had collected for many years and wanted to extort a sum of money.","But if she wanted to blackmail him, then so be it. Why did she want him to take the blame?","Yan Zhu and the others looked at each other.","\"This... Miss Huang, what can we exchange for it? You know, we almost never leave the Perched Phoenix Canyon. We don't have any spirit stones or spiritual jades from your god clan!\"","They had lived in seclusion in the Perching Phoenix Gorge for a long time, and the clansmen were very close to each other. They almost did not have the concept of bartering with others.","Hearing Huang Yueli's words out of the blue, they were a little dumbfounded.","When Huang Yueli saw their silly looks, she immediately burst out laughing, smiling till her eyes curved into crescents and the corners of her eyes narrowed.","Tsk tsk, look at them...He was simply a fat sheep that had delivered itself to her door, waiting to be slaughtered by her!","Huang Yueli smiled: \" I didn't say that you must use spirit jade to exchange for it. Whatever you have, just bring it over.\" Especially if there were medicinal herbs or something, that would be the best. Many medicinal herbs could be added to dishes, and the taste of the dishes would be very good. If the medicinal herbs you bring are suitable, I can also consider making some other dishes...\"","Upon hearing this, the Phoenixes almost drooled.","He immediately patted his chest,\"Miss Huang, don't worry, we have plenty of herbs!\" I'll go back and get it for you immediately!\"","The Phoenixes turned around and ran home. Not long after, they returned with bundles of medicinal herbs.","All of them were in a hurry and their expressions were urgent, as though they were afraid that Huang Yueli would secretly run away!","The few of them squeezed in the courtyard, and the medicinal herbs under their feet piled up into a small mountain.","\"Miss Huang, look at this...Silver Frost Spirit Dew, I collected it after breaking a ten-thousand-year-old Silver Frost Vine in the back mountain thirty thousand years ago. This kind of spirit dew has a strong fragrance and I haven't been willing to use it. I think I can use it when cooking!\"","Yan Zhu carried a large bucket of silver translucent liquid and passed it to Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli opened the lid and sniffed as the corners of her lips curled up slightly.","\" Yes, the Silver Frost Spirit Dew can indeed be used to cook dishes. Mix some mushrooms into a sauce and apply it on freshly roasted chicken. The taste is amazing.\"","Yan Zhu thanked her profusely,\" Miss Huang, then it's been hard on you!\"","Huang Yueli couldn't help but snicker.","How much spiritual dew could be used to make a mushroom sauce? To make a bucket of sauce, he only needed to add a few drops and the taste would be good enough.","Yan Zhu had brought over a large bucket!","This time, he made a killing!","Sigh, the people of the Phoenix clan were really too honest. She was a little embarrassed...","\"Miss Huang, look at this. This is a fire attributed heaven grade medicinal herb, Profound Yang Scarlet Flame Grass. To fire attributed practitioners, it's the best ingredient! Eating one could increase one's cultivation by a lot! Can you see if you can use it to cook?\"","Huang Yueli looked at the huge bundle of Profound Yang Scarlet Flame Grass in front of her and was speechless.","This kind of medicinal herb was priceless. It was hard to find in the territory of the Gods Race. Just one stalk could be used to refine a large bottle of Profound Yang Pills. To a Fire Attribute martial artist in the Profound Intent Realm, three bottles could forcefully increase his cultivation by a small realm.","In the end, Phoenix treated him like a cabbage and gave him to her.","Seeing that Huang Yueli didn't say anything, this phoenix was still very perturbed,\" Miss Huang, I know that this Profound Yang Scarlet Flame Grass doesn't taste very good but the place I live in is rather remote and there isn't anything good to eat so you just... Make do?\""]},{"number":4388,"title":"Chapter 4388 A thank you gift from the Phoenix Clan (9)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli forcefully held back the urge to laugh as she deliberately said in a serious tone,\" Cough cough, this Profound Yang Scarlet Flame Grass...\" The taste was indeed a little bad. Not only were the roots and leaves rough, but they also emitted a special earthy smell. No matter if it's used to stir-fry or make soup, it won't work...\"","When Phoenix heard this, her face revealed an obvious look of disappointment.","\"This, this...Did it mean that it was inappropriate? But, I only have these Scarlet Flame Grass? Why don't I give you a little more? If one basket is not enough, then... Three baskets it is!","Three baskets can be exchanged for a roast chicken, right?\"","Huang Yueli almost couldn't smile anymore.","Because she was trying her best to hold back her laughter, her face was about to cramp up, and she felt as if her intestines were about to be knotted.","She lowered her head, covered her mouth with her hand, and coughed twice. Three baskets it is! After all, we're neighbors, and you're so sincere. Even if I suffer a loss, this roast chicken is yours!\"","Huang Yueli picked up a roasted chicken that had just been cooked and smeared it with honey before handing it over to the phoenix.","The other party thanked him profusely. He held the roast chicken and happily sat at the side to eat it.","Little Wang Cai was dumbstruck as he watched from the side. His heart was filled with the urge to vomit blood.","This she-devil...He was really getting more and more ruthless!","After extorting so many heavenly treasures from the other party, he actually had the nerve to pretend that he had suffered a huge loss!","And wasn't his clansmen too silly and sweet? This was... He was still counting money for others after being sold?","Which side should he stand on?","Should he remind his clansmen not to be deceived by this black-hearted she-devil?","However, this she-devil would definitely pluck his fur and make him into a flower phoenix!","Little Wang Cai had already finished the chicken drumstick in his hand. However, he was thinking about such a profound question in his heart that he forgot to put down the bone in his hand. He was still grabbing the chicken bone and biting it.","Xiangxiang Beila was frightened by such a voice. She subconsciously shifted her butt and sat a little further away.","When Huang Yueli heard the commotion, she shot Little Wang Cai a warning look, successfully scaring him.","Then, he continued to trade herbs for roast chicken.","Li Moying leaned against the shade of a large tree and looked at the sly and sweet smile on his little fox's face as the corners of his lips couldn't help but curl up.","From the sixteen year old year in his previous life, the day he met Huang Yueli, what he yearned for, was not this kind of life.","He was training outside with his Li 'er, protecting her and watching her scam others...","What a beautiful day.","While Huang Yueli was collecting debts, she also had to roast the chicken and was gradually overwhelmed.","Hence, he waved his hand in the direction of Little Wang Cai,\"Wang...\" Hey, come here!\"","Little Wang Cai got up from the ground and slowly moved towards her. His face was filled with reluctance,\" What? Are you calling me? I'm not a dog. Why are you barking? I have a handsome name, Radiant!\"","\"Alright, alright, alright. No matter what your name is, come over quickly. I'm going to roast a batch of roast chicken now, so I can't collect the medicinal herbs. You're in charge of helping me count the ingredients. If you do well, I'll reward you with another drumstick.\"","\"What? You want me to help you scam money?\" Little Wang Cai cried out in shock,\" No, I will never be a traitor to the Phoenix clan! Doing such a backstabbing thing!\"","Hearing that, Huang Yueli's eyes narrowed."]},{"number":4389,"title":"Chapter 4389 The Phoenix Clan’s Gift of Thanks (10)","paragraphs":["Hearing that, Huang Yueli's eyes narrowed.","\"What do you mean by betraying me? You make it sound like I've done something bad! I've made a fair deal with the fellow villagers of the Phoenix clan. We're both willing parties. When have we ever cheated money?\"","\"You... You...\"","Little Wang Cai's face turned red and he held it in for a long time.","The she-devil's words made sense, and he couldn't refute her!","However, she was clearly scamming money.","\"Are you really not coming over to help? Did he not want a second drumstick? Since you think I'm scamming you, fine. Don't come over. I'll ask someone else.\"","As she spoke, she turned to look at the other Phoenixes beside her and shouted,\" Whoever is willing to help me count the ingredients, I'll give you a roasted chicken drumstick!\" Is anyone willing?\"","Almost at the instant she finished speaking, the Phoenixes were all excited.","One by one, they rushed to her side and raised their hands.","\"Me, me, me! I'm willing!\"","\"Miss Huang, look here, look here! Let me help you! I want more honey on my drumsticks.\"","\"Go away, go away. Miss Huang won't bother with you if you ask for so much! Miss Huang, I only want half a drumstick, and I don't need to use honey!\"","When Little Wang Cai saw this scene, his face turned green.","His clansmen...They were really silly and sweet!","There were even people fighting to do this kind of work!","Wasn't it just a chicken drumstick?","He just didn't like it...","Huang Yueli pointed at one of the young and handsome phoenixes who had just matured,\" You! Your job is very simple, as long as...\"","Upon seeing this, Little Wang Cai's expression changed as he pounced forward and hugged Huang Yueli's arm.","\"Wait, wait! Female devil, didn't you agree to let me count the medicinal herbs? How could you find another phoenix?\"","Huang Yueli glanced at him indifferently,\" Didn't you say you weren't willing?\"","\"When did I say I wasn't willing? You heard wrong!\"","Little Wang Cai was thick-skinned and refused to admit that he had said those words just now.","Huang Yueli's brows rose with a smile that was not a smile.","Little Wang Cai had already nimbly jumped to her side. It held a tree branch in its hand and knocked on a large rock beside it as it cried out.","\"Dear fellow villagers, brothers and sisters, please do not miss this opportunity! The Huang Clan's Roast Chicken was crispy on the outside and tender on the inside. The meat was fresh and delicious. It was refined using an exclusive technique and a special sauce. The flavor was excellent. Moreover, there was only one place like this! Limited supply every day!\"","\"Everyone, don't hesitate. Once you hesitate, you won't be able to eat roast chicken! The roast chicken will be sold out as soon as it comes out of the oven!\"","\"If you want to buy it, hurry up and line up with me! A bottle of Silver Frost Spirit Dew or three baskets of Profound Yang Scarlet Flame Grass would be enough! Of course, you can bribe me to cut the queue...\"","Huang Yueli saw him calling out in a proper manner and couldn't help but burst out laughing.","It seemed that when she brought little Wang Cai out to train, this little fellow had eavesdropped on the hawking of restaurants and merchants.","With Little Wang Cai's help, Huang Yueli put all her energy into roasting the chicken and Li Moying also came over to help.","For a time, the small courtyard was bustling with business.","Roasted chickens were sold one by one.","Huang Yueli looked at the increasing number of medicinal herbs in the courtyard and her heart was filled with joy.","This time, at the Perched Phoenix Canyon...It was the right choice to come!","Suddenly, footsteps came from outside the courtyard.","Little Wang Cai thought that a new customer had arrived and quickly greeted him,\" Brother, do you want to eat roast chicken? Did you bring the herbs? Hurry up and line up at the back...Eh, big...Big brother?","Why are you here?\""]},{"number":4390,"title":"Chapter 4390 The Phoenix Clan’s Gift of Thanks (11)","paragraphs":["Hearing this, everyone in the courtyard turned their heads and looked at the door.","As expected, Zhao Lin, who was wearing a golden-red robe, was standing in front of the courtyard.","But his expression was obviously not good as he glared fiercely at Huang Yueli and the grill beside her, his eyes seemingly about to spew fire.","\"What are you all doing here? I can hear you guys gathering here from afar! The black smoke in the courtyard is everywhere. What does it look like?\"","Zhao Lin reprimanded everyone sternly. He turned his head and looked at Little Wang Cai who was sitting on a big rock. His gaze became even more fierce.","\"Especially you! Radiant, what are you doing here? What's with the herbs around you?\"","\"Uh, this, this...Big brother... Cough cough...\"","Little Wang Cai shrunk its neck and subconsciously jumped down from the big rock. It took a few steps back and hid behind the small mountain of medicinal herbs.","He simply wanted to cry but had no tears.","Why was he so unlucky?","First, he was forced by the she-devil to do such a backstabbing thing, and now, he was actually caught red-handed by his big brother!","What was even worse was that both the she-devil and his big brother were people he could not afford to offend.","He was sandwiched between two evil forces, and he could only be cannon fodder!","\"Why are you hiding? Come out and explain clearly!\" Zhao Lin said with a livid expression.","When Huang Yueli saw Little Wang Cai's startled expression, she couldn't stand it any longer as she put down the condiments in her hands and walked towards them.","\"Lord Zhaolin, did you come to my small courtyard just to scare the children?\"","Although she often scared little Wang Cai, just because she could scare him didn't mean that she could scare others.","Even if it was Little Wang Cai's biological big brother!","Zhao Lin narrowed his eyes and a dangerous coldness flashed across his eyes,\" Miss Huang, may I ask, what exactly are you doing? Why are my clansmen gathered here and moving baskets of medicinal herbs over? They almost emptied the clan's warehouse!\"","Huang Yueli shrugged her shoulders as she replied nonchalantly: \" Lord Zhao Lin, isn't your words too exaggerated? That was not what the seniors said when they brought the medicinal herbs over just now. What they brought over were all their own private collections? Why did you empty the Phoenix clan's warehouse?\"","Upon hearing this, the Phoenixes who had just changed to roast chicken also protested.","\" That's right, Lord Patriarch. We took the medicinal herbs that we collected ourselves. We definitely didn't touch the ones in the warehouse.\"","\"We still know the severity of the situation. You don't have to worry!\"","\"Lord Clan Leader, don't scare Miss Huang. She's such a young girl. She can't be scared!\"","Hearing these words of defense, not only did Zhao Lin not smile, but his expression became even uglier.","Was there a mistake?","Back then, it was also them who had been shouting that the blood feud between the two races could never be wiped out and that they wanted to punish these two geniuses of the god clan on the spot.","Now, everyone was on her side.","Not only did he bring out all the medicinal herbs in the house for her, he even dared to go against him, the Clan Leader, for Huang Yueli?","Was this little girl poisonous?","Zhao Lin's expression was gloomy. He swept his gaze across the crowd and asked coldly,\" So, after all this time, what are you guys doing here?!\"","\"We... We're eating here...Eat roast chicken...\" Yan Zhu said weakly.","When Zhao Lin heard this, he had an expression as if he had seen a ghost.\" You said eat...\" Eat what? Say it again?\""]},{"number":4391,"title":"Chapter 4391 The Phoenix Clan’s Gift of Thanks (12)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli smiled as she took the initiative to step forward and said: \" Lord Zhao Lin, you have already seen it so why do you still ask the obvious? That's right, we're just roasting a few roast chickens here to eat. It's not a big deal. I wonder why you're so angry? Is there a rule in the Perched Phoenix Canyon that you can't make a fire to cook?\"","Zhao Lin stared at the grill behind Huang Yueli.","On the grill, there were two roast chickens that had just been roasted halfway. Under the burning of the open fire, the skin became scorched and crispy bit by bit. Drops of oil dripped down and fell into the fire. The fragrance was stimulated by the heat of the fire and quickly spread in the air.","The Phoenixes present swallowed their saliva in unison.","Zhao Lin subconsciously wanted to do the same.","However, he remembered his identity in time and forcefully held back.","Zhao Lin clenched his right fist and placed it against his lips. He coughed lightly to cover up his uneasiness.","\"Cough cough, there is indeed no such rule in the Perched Phoenix Canyon, but...\"","However, phoenixes were generally vegetarian. They basically ate raw food. Occasionally, they would catch a little snake or rabbit to eat. They would also simply cook it with the spiritual water in the mountains.","Who would set up a grill and roast chicken in the open like her?","Zhao Lin held it in for a while, unable to refute. He turned his gaze and saw the pile of medicinal herbs at the side, and his expression immediately darkened.","\" Barbecuing isn't a problem, but where did these herbs come from?\"","Huang Yueli gave a slight smile, with a pure and innocent expression,\" Medicinal herbs...Of course, it was brought by the seniors. I treated everyone to roast chicken, and the seniors probably felt sorry, so they brought me a small gift. Is that not okay?\"","\" This is called a 'small' gift?!\" Zhao Lin's face was so dark that ink was about to drip out.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes as she deliberately said: \" Isn't that so? Didn't the seniors just say that they picked this from the back of the mountain? Are you lying to me?\"","Most of the phoenixes in the canyon were born and raised in the Perched Phoenix Canyon. They rarely left the surrounding dense forest, so their personalities were very simple.","They had never thought that Huang Yueli, this kind of pure and innocent looking young lady, would be so cunning as to trick them.","Upon hearing her words, everyone spoke up to testify for her.","\"That's right. I picked this Blood Mysterious Yang Scarlet Flame Grass from the back of the mountain. Isn't that right?\"","\"Yes, yes. I also got my Silver Frost Spirit Dew from the back mountain.\"","\"Miss Huang is absolutely right!\"","\"Lord Clan Leader, Miss Huang can make such delicious roast chicken. Everyone wants to eat it, we can't just eat and drink for free here right? That's why we thought of bringing some gifts over...\"","\"Could it be that we gave too few gifts? Did you embarrass the Phoenix clan?\"","Zhao Lin saw that these phoenixes had not reacted to being played. They were still counting money for others after being sold. He was so angry that he almost fainted!","If he had known earlier, he would not have forbidden the phoenixes of his clan from leaving the mountain as they pleased.","Look at all of them. They had all become so silly and sweet. They had no idea that the things in their hands were priceless treasures!","He was fooled by that extremely cunning little girl of the God Race with just a few words!","He gritted his teeth in anger.\" Don't you have brains? \"Although the medicinal herbs in your hands are everywhere in the back mountain, they are priceless treasures in the territory of the god race! Roasted chicken is worthless in the Divine Realm. You were all deceived by that little girl!\""]},{"number":4392,"title":"Chapter 4392 The Phoenix Clan’s Gift of Thanks (13)","paragraphs":["\"What is it? How did this happen?\"","\"Lord Patriarch, is what you said true? Miss Huang really lied to us?\"","\"Miss Huang, are you really trying to cheat us of the medicinal herbs in our hands?\"","Hearing Zhao Lin's words, quite a number of phoenixes started to feel puzzled as they started to question Huang Yueli's earlier series of actions.","But there were also quite a number of Phoenixes who stood firmly on Huang Yueli's side.","\"It can't be, right? Miss Huang was such a good person...Her roast chicken is so delicious. She must be a good person!\"","\"Right, right, right, Miss Huang is as outstanding as her roast chicken! I definitely won't lie!\"","From the moment Zhao Lin appeared, Little Wang Cai had been hiding behind Huang Yueli. Although he didn't say anything, but he had pricked up his ears to listen to the movements around him.","Hearing that there were actually so many Phoenixes speaking up for Huang Yueli, cold sweat started dripping down his forehead.","Big brothers and sisters, wake up. Can you not be so stupid?","The first time he ate the roasted chicken made by the she-devil, he was so touched that he almost cried. He thought that he had followed a peerless master!","But what was the result?","Looking back on the past, it was all bitter tears...","However, Zhao Lin's prestige in the clan was extremely high. If he said that Huang Yueli was lying, even if most of the Phoenixes couldn't figure it out, their first reaction would be to believe their Clan Leader.","In an instant, more and more Phoenixes raised doubts towards Huang Yueli.","There were even people who understood it and stood out to request Huang Yueli to return the herbs.","Seeing that if this continued, the situation would go out of control, Huang Yueli suddenly took a step forward and coughed heavily.","\"Cough cough, what nonsense are you talking about? When did I lie to you?\"","\"Didn't you hear what our Clan Leader said?\" Phoenix asked loudly. This roast chicken isn't worth much, but our medicinal herbs are worth a lot. You're lying to us!\"","Huang Yueli swept a glance at him as her lips curled up into a smile as she spoke calmly.","\"Little brother, your memory doesn't seem to be very good. When did I ever say that your herbs are worthless? Did I say that? Think about it carefully and speak with your conscience!\"","Phoenix choked.\" Alright...\" It seemed that he had never said it before...But...\"","His 'but' had just left his mouth when he was interrupted by Huang Yueli.","\"Right? I really didn't say such a thing! As for the roast chicken, it's clearly priced. As long as you bring the medicinal herbs over, I've never owed you anything. Everyone's roast chicken is equally delicious! I'm doing business so honestly, and you're saying that I'm cheating?\"","\"This... This...\" Phoenix was tongue-tied as she stared at Huang Yueli with her eyes wide open, unable to say a word.","He clearly felt that Huang Yueli's words were not right but he totally didn't know how to retort!","Zhao Lin looked at the phoenixes 'foolish expressions and gritted his teeth. He waved his hand and stood up.","\"Miss Huang, don't twist logic here! This basket of Mysterious Yang Scarlet Flame Grass is enough to buy a million roast chickens in the twelve continents of the God Clan!\"","\"What is it? A million roast chickens!\"","\" Heavens, I gave Miss Huang three baskets of herbs just now, why did I only exchange it for this one?\"","\"If we go to the 12 continents of the God Clan, won't we be able to eat roast chicken every day?\"","\"You have a point. We'll go down the mountain tomorrow. No, no, no, we'll go down the mountain now!\"","Zhao Lin had not expected that after he had settled this score, not only did these phoenixes not have any intention of seeking justice from Huang Yueli, they even wanted to go down the mountain to feast!"]},{"number":4393,"title":"Chapter 4393 The Phoenix Clan’s Gift of Thanks (14)","paragraphs":["Zhao Lin's expression turned darker and darker. Finally, he couldn't listen anymore.","\"Shut up!\" he shouted.","The phoenixes were discussing the route down the mountain and were in high spirits when they suddenly heard Zhao Lin's sudden roar. They were all shocked.","A few of the more timid ones almost jumped up in fright.","The phoenixes hurriedly turned around and looked at Zhao Lin. Lord Patriarch...\"","\"Eat, eat, eat, you only know how to eat! Did you not eat anything good in the Perched Phoenix Canyon, or did you starve? You actually want to exchange such precious medicinal herbs for food!\"","Zhao Lin had an expression of disappointment as he reprimanded the phoenixes.","None of the Phoenixes were convinced. However, due to the authority of the clan leader, none of them dared to refute. All of them lowered their heads and did not speak.","Just as Zhao Lin felt a little relieved, a sweet voice of a young girl suddenly drifted over from not far away.","\"Lord Zhao Lin, you're wrong. The place you live in is good. There's abundant Xuan Qi in the heaven and earth and it's also very suitable for the growth of all kinds of rare herbs. However, there's really nothing good to eat. Have you eaten this fragrant roasted chicken before?\"","Huang Yueli pointed at the roast chicken that was still dripping oil on the grill as she asked loudly.","\"No, I haven't!\"","\"This is the first time I've eaten such delicious food!\"","\"We don't even have a live chicken on our mountain. How can we have eaten it?\"","The Phoenixes answered subconsciously. However, in the next moment, Zhao Lin's cold gaze swept over.","They were so frightened that they quivered and quickly changed their words.\"No, no, no...\" This... This is just roast chicken, no...There's nothing delicious!\"","The Phoenixes raised their heads and puffed out their chests. They did not look sideways, deeply expressing their disdain for the roast chicken.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she continued: \" Alright then. Roasted chicken is indeed not anything delicious. After all, there were too many ways to make chicken. It could be made into lingzhi chicken soup, braised, fried, steamed, braised, and sauced. Every one of them was delicious! Moreover, other than chicken, there was also pork, beef, and mutton...Even the vegetables and fruits that you usually eat have thousands of cooking methods...\"","Hearing Huang Yueli's description, the Phoenixes 'saliva fell onto the ground.","Once again, he had forgotten about the poor clan leader.","\"Really? Miss Huang, these vegetables...Do you know how to do it?\"","\"Can we try it? Miss Huang, I... I can exchange it with medicinal herbs!\"","\"Yes, yes, yes, I can do it too! I have even more precious herbs, better than the Profound Yang Scarlet Flame Grass!\"","\"I have a medicinal herb at home. Even in our Phoenix clan, it is a top-notch treasure...\"","Zhao Lin almost fainted as he listened by the side.","He had been trying his best to persuade them but not only did he fail to let these clansmen see Huang Yueli's true colors, he even seemed to have promoted her business?","What a living ghost!","Zhao Lin was so angry that his chest heaved up and down. As the clan leader, I order all of you to return to your own courtyards immediately. No one is allowed to come here to exchange for food, and no one is allowed to take the medicinal herbs out of the valley!\"","\"But, Lord tribe leader...\"","The Phoenixes were unwilling and wanted to protest.","However, under Zhao Lin's cold gaze, none of them dared to make a sound."]},{"number":4394,"title":"Chapter 4394 Earn a lot (1)","paragraphs":["Little Wang Cai couldn't stand it anymore.","Although he didn't want to help the Female Devil cheat the clansmen of their medicinal ingredients, he felt that his brother was being a little too arbitrary when he saw Zhao Lin's stern expression.","The clansmen liked to eat roast chicken. That was a normal need. It was not something that was heinous...","\"Brother, I think this matter...\"","\"Shut up!\"","The moment Little Wang Cai opened his mouth, he was stopped by Zhao Lin who was still in a fit of anger.","\"You were the one who caused this, and you still dare to speak! What did I tell you earlier? If you want to cultivate properly, you must first stop eating greasy food. You must eat the herbs I gave you! What did you promise me? What are you doing now?\"","Zhao Lin didn't even need to ask to guess that the cause of today's farce was definitely because Little Wang Cai wanted to eat roast chicken.","After all, the other Phoenixes in the canyon had never eaten roast chicken before, and they would not want to eat it for no reason.","Whereas Huang Yueli's primordial spirit was damaged so in order to recover her strength as soon as possible, she definitely wouldn't eat such oily food and Li Moying had always been in line with his wife.","Then the only remaining culprit would definitely be Little Wang Cai!","Little Wang Cai was exposed by his big brother on the spot and his little face immediately flushed red. His face was filled with guilt as he lowered his head.","\"Hmph!\" Zhao Lin glared at him and snorted coldly.\" Alright, everyone return to your own courtyards now!\" You are not allowed to gather here again! Disperse immediately!\"","The Phoenixes were reluctant to leave.","After tasting Huang Yueli's roast chicken, they had already fallen in love with this taste.","Moreover, Huang Yueli had just said that she knew how to cook many other dishes...","Just thinking about it made him feel that it was delicious.","Although Zhao Lin had always said that Miss Huang had lied to them, most of them still felt that this money was spent... It was worth it!","However, due to the authority of the Patriarch, they didn't dare to voice their anger and could only reluctantly glance at the last two roasted chickens on the grill before leaving Huang Yueli's courtyard one after another.","Huang Yueli stood at the side and didn't say anything as she silently watched the Phoenixes leave.","Zhao Lin swept her a glance. Seeing that she did not stop the phoenixes, his expression became a little better. He turned around and left as well.","Huang Yueli was after all Little Wang Cai's savior so he couldn't do anything to her so he could only restrain his clansmen.","Not long after, all the Phoenixes in the courtyard left.","The small courtyard, which was noisy just now, suddenly became quiet and desolate. It really looked a little miserable.","Little Wang Cai was the last to leave.","He stood beside Huang Yueli and whispered: \" Female Devil, my brother he... His temper is like this, he's very stubborn and it's probably caused by living in seclusion in the canyon for too long. He's not targeting you, you... please don't blame him...\"","Little Wang Cai's heart was abnormally perturbed.","After all, his female devil was not someone to be trifled with. She was full of evil ideas. If she really fought with his brother, the entire Phoenix Tranquility Gorge would be overturned by them!","Who knew that Huang Yueli wasn't as angry as he had imagined but instead revealed a sweet smile.","\"It's alright. I understand, I understand very much! These are all small matters. You don't have to take them to heart. Hurry up and go back!\"","Huang Yueli's voice was very gentle but Little Wang Cai's forehead was covered in cold sweat.","She was so reasonable. She really didn't look like the Female Devil he knew..."]},{"number":4395,"title":"Chapter 4395 Earn a lot (2)","paragraphs":["Little Wang Cai's face was filled with suspicion as he stared at Huang Yueli, as he silently studied her expression thoroughly.","However, he still couldn't figure out what the problem was.","Huang Yueli smiled and said: \" Why are you staring at me? Do you suddenly think that I'm smart, beautiful and kind?\"","Little Wang Cai choked for a moment and his little face turned red.","Why was his Female Devil getting more and more thick-skinned? How could he have the nerve to say such a thing?","It was true that she was smart and beautiful, but...Kindness?","Didn't her conscience hurt?","Little Wang Cai was struck by lightning until it was burnt on the outside and tender on the inside. It could not listen any longer. With a black face, it turned around and wanted to leave.","\"That... I have to go cultivate too. Otherwise, if Big Brother sees me, he'll scold me again...See you!\"","\"Hey, Wang Cai, wait. Don't leave yet!\" Huang Yueli called out from behind him.","However, not only did little Wang Cai not stop, he even walked faster and was about to run.","Huang Yueli's voice drifted over from behind him,\" Alright then, since you have something urgent to attend to, then you can leave first. Since no one wants to eat these two roast chickens, I can only throw them away...\"","\"What? Throw it away! What did you say you were going to throw?\"","Little Wang Cai, who was still running forward, suddenly stopped and turned around.","His eyes were wide open as he stared at Huang Yueli...to be more precise, the roast chicken in her hand.","Huang Yueli gave an innocent expression,\" I don't like to eat such oily things and my husband doesn't like it either. Since the Patriarch also doesn't allow me to feed your clansmen...Now that you're not interested, can't we just throw it away?\"","\"Throw it away? Are you really going to throw it away? This is a reckless waste of a heavenly treasure, a great waste!\" Little Wang Cai screamed.","Huang Yueli still had a matter-of-fact look on her face,\" I know this is a waste but we can't just eat it forcefully? If my husband eats too much and gets sick, I'll feel sorry for him. So, I'd better throw it away! Let it return to nature! Or you can just burn it. After it turns into ashes, it can be used to fertilize your herbs...\"","As Huang Yueli said that, she swung her small hand and was about to throw the roast chicken into the fire.","Little Wang Cai was startled as he pounced over and hugged Huang Yueli's arm.","\"No, no, no...Don't throw it! Don't burn it! Who said I don't want to eat roast chicken? I'm willing, I'm willing!\"","Little Wang Cai screamed and desperately tried to save these two pitiful roast chickens.","Huang Yueli replied: \" But earlier I asked you to stay behind to eat roasted chicken. You said you wanted to cultivate...\"","Little Wang Cai's face turned red and he was instantly embarrassed.","However, for the sake of his beloved roast chicken, he did not care about his face anymore. Besides, I don't have time now, but I can take the roast chicken back and eat it as supper after I finish cultivating...\"","Little Wang Cai argued irrationally and was already prepared to argue with the female devil to the end.","But who knew that after Huang Yueli heard his words, she actually nodded her head,\" Mm, what you said makes sense. Then I'll let you bring these two roasted chickens back to eat. You've been cultivating hard recently. It's time for you to nourish yourself.\"","When Little Wang Cai heard this, his jaw almost fell to the ground.","His Female Devil actually said that she wanted to nourish him!","What was wrong with her today? Did he take the wrong medicine?","She was actually so kind!","There couldn't be any conspiracy, right?","However, just as Little Wang Cai was feeling puzzled, Huang Yueli had already taken out two pieces of emerald green lotus leaves and placed the roast chicken in the middle, carefully wrapping it up."]},{"number":4396,"title":"Chapter 4396 Earn a lot (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli passed the roasted chicken that she had packed to Little Wang Cai.","\"Here, this is for you. Take it back and eat slowly.\"","Little Wang Cai could not believe his eyes!","\"This, this, this...Is it really for me?\" He didn't even dare to reach out to take it.","Huang Yueli raised her brows,\" If you don't want it, then I'll...\"","\" No, no, no, I want it! I want it!\" Little Wang Cai could tell that she was going to go back on her words and jumped up in excitement.","He quickly rushed over, snatched the lotus leaf bundle and hugged it in his arms.","\"Then...I'll take this roast chicken! Female Devil, you're so nice. Don't worry, if I see big brother, I'll definitely put in a good word for you!\"","When Little Wang Cai received the roast chicken, he immediately forgot that his sense of justice was still bursting out two hours ago, as he felt that Huang Yueli was cheating his clansmen of their money.","He finished speaking loudly and immediately turned around to leave. Without stopping, he rushed out of Huang Yueli's courtyard.","What a joke. It was rare for the Female Devil to be so kind. Who knew if she had taken the wrong medicine?","What if the drug wore off and she woke up and wanted to take back the roast chicken?","Little Wang Cai ran so fast that Huang Yueli was stunned by his swift and violent movements.","However, she was not angry. Instead, she curled her lips and revealed a playful smile.","Huang Yueli tugged at Li Moying's sleeve,\" Husband, let's secretly follow him over to take a look!\"","Li Moying lowered his head and met his little fox's sly smile as he couldn't help but laugh,\" You ah, why are you acting like a child?\"","In the future when they had a baby, would they be like Little Wang Cai, being played by Li 'er?","However, their child would definitely inherit their two-faced ways and would definitely not be as gullible as Little Wang Cai.","..","On the other side.","Little Wang Cai hugged the roast chicken tightly in his arms and ran out.","He only stopped after he had run out of the courtyard and for several miles.","\"Phew... I'm so tired! The Female Devil actually changed her attitude today and really gave me two roasted chickens! I used to complain about her every day. I shouldn't have. Actually, she's a good master!\"","The roasted chicken wrapped in lotus leaves kept emitting an alluring fragrance.","As Little Wang Cai sniffed, his saliva could not help but drip down. No matter what, he could not move his feet.","He looked left and right and realized that he had accidentally run out of the area where his clansmen lived and came to the forest at the side.","There was no one here and it was very quiet.","It was a good place to eat alone.","Little Wang Cai sat down on the spot and placed the lotus leaf bag on the ground before opening it gently...","In the middle of the green leaves, the roast chicken was still hot. It was golden in color and smelled tempting.","Little Wang Cai picked up the roast chicken and raised it to his mouth. He opened his mouth wide and was about to take a bite.","However, when he suddenly bit down, there was nothing.","He even bit her tongue.","\"Ouch, it hurts, it hurts, it hurts!\"","Little Wang Cai wailed and lowered his head to take a look. He realized that the roast chicken in his hand had disappeared!","How was this possible?","How could a cooked roast chicken fly away?","Little Wang Cai quickly turned his head and when he took a closer look, his face immediately paled.","\"Big, big, big...Big brother! You... Why are you here...This, this, this...\"","He was so frightened that he couldn't control his tongue.","Behind him, the dignified and dignified Phoenix Patriarch, who was wearing a golden-red robe, was looking down at him coldly.","In his hands were two roast chickens that were still dripping oil."]},{"number":4397,"title":"Chapter 4397 Earn a lot (4)","paragraphs":["When Little Wang Cai saw the roast chicken, he forgot everything else.","He even threw his fear of Zhao Lin to the back of his mind.","He screamed and pounced on the roast chicken. \" Big Brother, why did you snatch my roast chicken away? Give it back to me!\"","However, just as his little hand was about to grab the chicken wing, Zhao Lin took a step back unhurriedly.","Little Wang Cai did not expect this. Not only did he miss, he almost fell to the ground.","\"Big... Big Brother?\"","The little guy blinked his big eyes in shock.","Zhao Lin's long and narrow phoenix eyes narrowed as his gaze swept across his younger brother's face. He coldly said: \" I've already warned everyone earlier. No one is allowed to use medicinal herbs to exchange for roast chicken with Huang Yueli. Everyone else has listened to me but you.... As my younger brother, you dare to openly disobey orders?\"","When Little Wang Cai heard his cold tone, he trembled.","However, when he thought of his beloved roast chicken, he still mustered up his courage and tried to explain himself.","\"Big Brother, you're mistaken! I didn't disobey your orders. These two roast chickens were definitely not exchanged for medicinal herbs, but... My Female Devil gave it to me!\"","\"For you?\" Zhao Lin smirked coldly.\" You still want to lie to me? How could Huang Yueli be so kind?\"","\"This... This...\"","Little Wang Cai was instantly tongue-tied, not knowing how to explain.","What Zhao Lin said was absolutely right. According to his Female Devil's usual personality, she naturally wouldn't give it away for free!","The moment he received the roast chicken, he was also shocked.","However, the truth was the truth.","Before he could speak, Zhao Lin snorted coldly.\" You openly disobeyed the Patriarch's orders and even dared to fabricate a reason to deceive the Patriarch. Your crimes are even worse! On account of your young age, I won't punish you according to the clan rules. These two roast chickens are confiscated!\"","\"Wha... What? Confiscated?\"","Little Wang Cai widened his eyes and could not help but wail.","\"Big Brother, no, you can't confiscate my roast chicken! This is really a gift from the Female Devil! I don't know why she's so kind, but it's true. If you don't believe me, you can go and verify it with her face to face!\"","\"So what if I want to verify it? What if you guys colluded? Hmph!\" Zhao Lin snorted coldly.\" Anyway, I'm taking these two roast chickens! Even if Miss Huang gave it to you, you can't eat it anymore. Cultivate properly! Go back and continue practicing your swordsmanship a hundred times. I want to check it tomorrow morning!\"","\"What? Tomorrow...and you still want to check? No, Big Brother, no, you can't do this to me!\"","Little Wang Cai let out an extremely miserable cry.","However, he still couldn't save his roast chicken.","\" Big Brother is too much, too much!!\" Little Wang Cai squatted on the grass, one hand pulling the weeds on the ground, the other drawing circles on the mud,\" Big Brother doesn't eat roast chicken, and he even confiscated mine, he's simply inhumane!\"","His stomach was filled with unwillingness, but under Zhao Lin's cold and stern gaze, he could only look at the roast chicken a few times reluctantly before returning to his courtyard dejectedly.","Only when Little Wang Cai's figure disappeared at the end of the forest did Zhao Lin retract his gaze.","He lowered his head and looked at the roast chicken in his hand.","A trace of doubt flashed across his pale golden eyes.","\"What did Wang Cai and the others do? How could they be so addicted to such a greasy thing? What's going on?\"","He frowned and thought for a moment. Then, he reached out his right hand and pulled out a drumstick from the roast chicken."]},{"number":4398,"title":"Chapter 4398 Earn a lot (5)","paragraphs":["Zhao Lin raised the drumstick to his mouth.","Just as he was about to bite down, he suddenly stopped.","He turned around and looked at the bushes behind him.","It was quiet in the forest, except for the chirping of a few birds on the treetops.","Zhao Lin looked left and right, making sure there was no one around him before raising the drumstick again.","The alluring fragrance assailed his nostrils, and Zhao Lin could no longer maintain the cold and solemn expression on his face. He could not help but take a bite.","In the next moment, Zhao Lin's eyes widened. Clearly, he had not expected that this roast chicken would taste so good!","He paused for a moment, then raised the roast chicken without hesitation and ate it heartily.","Not long after, only the bones of the two roast chickens in his hands were left.","Zhao Lin still couldn't come back to his senses for a moment. He stared at the bones in a daze, as if questioning in his heart. These two chickens didn't look small either. How could they be finished so quickly?","Furthermore, he usually only ate flowers and grass and drank dew. Eating a little greasy food would make him feel nauseous so why didn't Huang Yueli's roast chicken taste disgusting at all and was so delicious?","Even he wanted to take out his own collection of medicinal herbs to exchange for a new roast chicken with Huang Yueli!","Fortunately, the Patriarch's willpower was still up to standard. He remembered his identity and position in time and did not do such a self-deprecating thing.","Zhao Lin stood in a daze in the empty forest for a long time before he woke up from his stupor.","After looking around, he threw the bones of the roast chicken on the ground and even buried it with the fallen leaves to prevent it from being discovered by passing clansmen.","After doing all this, he quickly left the forest.","Not long after Zhao Lin left, a slender figure emerged from the bushes behind him.","Immediately after, another tall figure walked out.","Huang Yueli used her hand to cover her stomach as she laughed so hard that she couldn't straighten her back, \" Ha ha ha, Zhao Lin, this fellow is too funny right? What was the use of only remembering to hide the bones after eating them? He forgot to wipe his mouth!\"","Anyone who saw the oil stains on the corner of the Patriarch's mouth would know what he had done just now, right?","Li Moying saw that she was laughing so hard that she was falling down and shook his head secretly as he walked over and pulled his little fox into his embrace.","\"Alright, alright, is it that funny? From the Patriarch to the ordinary clansmen, the Phoenix Clan is clear about love and hate. They are not scheming. Otherwise, Zhao Lin would not have been tempted by you and made such a mistake.\"","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was slightly dissatisfied as she puffed up her cheeks and turned to glare at the man behind her.","\"Husband, what do you mean? Why does it sound like I'm the one scheming against him? I asked Wang Cai to take away the roast chicken because I didn't want to waste it. Who asked him to steal my brother's roast chicken and eat it secretly?\"","Li Moying looked at her innocent look and couldn't help but laugh.","Huang Yueli had intentionally let Little Wang Cai take away the roast chicken because she was very clear that Zhao Lin would definitely be worried that his younger brother would be led astray and would secretly hide at the side to monitor Wang Cai. If he saw Wang Cai bringing along the roast chicken, he would definitely confiscate it!","In these two roasted chickens, Huang Yueli had secretly put in the Phoenix Clan's favourite, White Valerian, into its marinade. As long as Zhao Lin got his hands on it, he wouldn't be able to resist taking a bite.","Huang Yueli was still very confident in her own culinary skills so as long as Zhao Lin had tasted it, he would definitely not be able to resist eating it all.","As long as he had eaten Huang Yueli's roast chicken, Zhao Lin wouldn't be able to maintain his stance.","After all, Zhao Lin would more or less feel guilty if he ate someone's soft tongue.","The Phoenix Clan's character was simple and not as thick-skinned as the human race so they definitely wouldn't dare to ruin Huang Yueli's business."]},{"number":4399,"title":"Chapter 4399 Earn a lot (6)","paragraphs":["\" You have so many ideas. If Zhao Lin knew the truth, he would probably vomit blood from anger.\" Li Moying couldn't help but shake his head.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips,\" Husband, whose side are you on?\"","Li Moying saw that the little fox wasn't happy so he hurriedly replied,\" Of course I'm on your side. Alright, it's getting late. Zhao Lin has already run away. Let's go back to the courtyard.\"","Huang Yueli nodded, \"Alright then, let's go back. There are still so many medicinal herbs in the courtyard waiting for me to pack them up!\"","Thinking of the various rare herbs piled up like a small mountain in the courtyard, Huang Yueli couldn't stop smiling.","She did not expect that the Phoenix Clan actually hid so many good things.","She was rich, she was really rich!","Li Moying followed beside Huang Yueli and when he turned his head sideways to see the crafty and adorable smile on her delicate little face, the corners of his mouth curled up slightly.","It was getting late. It was time to go back.","However, it wasn't to collect the herbs.","The Heaven and Earth Profound Qi in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge was abundant and peaceful. The most suitable activity at night should be Dual Cultivation...","..","Everything was as Huang Yueli had expected.","After the \" roast chicken incident \" that day, Huang Yueli was quiet for three to five days.","Not only did she count the medicinal herbs she had received, but she also pulled her husband to the dense forest around the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge to investigate and find out what rare medicinal herbs were nearby.","She cooperated with Li Moying and harvested a hefty amount.","However, there were still many medicinal herbs that grew on the precipice or under the precipice.","To Huang Yueli and Li Moying, even though it wasn't impossible for them to go to these places to pick herbs, but they had to pay a huge price and there was also a considerable risk involved.","Huang Yueli didn't let her husband take the risk but instead took out a small notebook to record down the names of these herbs.","\"Scarlet Wind Pistil...Jade Marrow Snow Lotus...White Phoenix Fragrance...Alright, remember everything. We can go back now!\"","Huang Yueli kept the pen and paper as she tugged at her husband's sleeves,\" Let's go, go back and prepare for a while. Then we can sit down and collect the medicinal herbs!\"","Li Moying was seduced by her bright smile and he couldn't help but lower his head to give her a kiss on her face.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before her little face turned red as she obediently let her husband kiss her a few times.","Li Moying said in a low voice,\" Zhao Lin is too embarrassed to come and ruin your business now. But that day's incident has already frightened those Phoenixes. Would they still dare to exchange food with you?\"","Huang Yueli smiled and said: \" Husband, you have to have confidence in my culinary skills!\"","The two of them returned to the courtyard.","From the second day onwards, Huang Yueli started a fire in the courtyard and started cooking.","However, she didn't cook roast chicken. Instead, she cooked a variety of other dishes.","The fragrance of these dishes quickly spread throughout the entire valley.","The Phoenixes could no longer sit still.","Huang Yueli sat in the courtyard and could see that there would be Phoenixes wandering back and forth at the entrance from time to time, pretending to pass by and inadvertently peering into their courtyard.","And the moment Huang Yueli raised her head, the Phoenixes were like birds startled by the twang of a bow, shrinking back in an instant, not daring to meet her gaze.","Huang Yueli didn't expose them as she continued to focus on cooking.","She first set up a rack on the fire and placed the freshly slaughtered hen in it. She cut the onions, ginger, and spices stored in her space and added them to stew.","Then, she took out a huge iron pot and planned to cook fried chicken."]},{"number":4400,"title":"Chapter 4400 Earn a lot (7)","paragraphs":["As soon as the chicken was dipped into the hot oil, the fragrance instantly spread.","Moreover, the fragrance of the fried chicken was even stronger than the roast chicken he made that day.","The Phoenixes who came and went at the door were a little uneasy.","Initially, they were just looking around Huang Yueli's courtyard and after taking a few glances, they hurriedly left.","At this moment, they had already forgotten that they were peeping. A few of them even stood at the door and could not move their legs.","Huang Yueli saw this and laughed secretly in her heart.","Ever since she raised little Wang Cai, she discovered that the Phoenix Clan should like to eat it very much. It was just that they did not know how to cook it.","Now, it seemed that her guess was right.","In the oil pan, the chicken drumsticks were slowly dyed with a golden color, looking extremely fragrant and crispy.","Yan Zhu finally couldn't bear it anymore as he slowly walked towards Huang Yueli's side and coughed lightly.","\"That... Miss Huang, I smelled a strange smell in your courtyard. I thought that something had happened while you were cultivating, so I specially came over to take a look... What are you doing? Aren't you roasting chicken?\"","He was exchanging pleasantries with Huang Yueli but his eyes passed over her shoulder, as he looked straight into the oil pan.","Huang Yueli didn't seem to notice that something was wrong with him as she smiled and said: \" That's right. I'm not making roast chicken but fried chicken.\" My husband has been working hard recently. I'll cook a few good dishes to reward him. However, I haven't cooked for a long time. I can't master it well. I seem to have cooked too much...\"","Yan Zhu widened his eyes and subconsciously swallowed his saliva. \"Cooked too much? That's right, this fried chicken looks like it's enough for five to six people to eat. You're so small and can't eat much. Young Master Li will definitely be stuffed if he eats alone...What do you plan to do with the rest?\"","Huang Yueli gave an innocent expression,\" What else can we do? I can only throw it away!\"","\"Throw...Throw it away?\"","Hearing Huang Yueli's words, Yan Zhu's voice changed as he almost screamed out loud.","Huang Yueli's expression didn't change and her heart didn't beat as she nodded her head with absolute certainty.","Yan Zhu suppressed the shock in his heart and persuaded her nicely,\"This...\" Isn't this too wasteful? It wasn't easy for these chickens to grow to this size, and it wasn't easy for you to make such delicious dishes. How could you... just throw it away?\"","Huang Yueli gave an exaggerated sigh,\" Sigh, then what can I do? I've made so many dishes. If I can't eat them, they'll go bad!\"","\"But...But...\" Yan Zhu wanted to say something.","Huang Yueli interrupted him at the right time,\" Originally, I also knew that we shouldn't waste food so I planned to invite everyone to my house for a meal. There are so many of you so I reckon it's not enough to eat! However, Patriarch Zhao Lin warned me not to sell roast chicken in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge! I'm just a Heart Profound Realm small martial artist. I don't dare to disobey his orders!\"","Huang Yueli deliberately said this and even emphasized the two words 'roast chicken.'","Sure enough, when Yan Zhu heard this, he couldn't hold it in any longer. He said loudly,\" Miss Huang, the Patriarch only forbids you from selling roasted chicken. But, he didn't say that you can't buy fried chicken! These are two completely different things! The ancestral teachings of our Phoenix Clan state that we must not waste the food given to us by heaven and earth. This will incur the wrath of heaven! Your fried chicken... You can't throw it away!\"","\"Right, right, right. We definitely can't throw it away!\"","\" Roasted chicken is roasted chicken, fried chicken is fried chicken. You can't mix them up!\"","The other Phoenixes at the door also rushed in, scrambling to express their stance."]}]);
